578","name":"Mint","type":"mint","family":"mint","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mint","marketLabel":"fresh mint 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6061f8b25ed7288b4577","name":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","type":"pancetta","family":"pork","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5992fd2cb95a598b456a","name":"Risotto Rice","type":"risotto-rice","family":"rice","amount":"175 g","sourceAmount":175,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Risotto Rice","marketLabel":"risotto rice 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5d41512a9fe95c0010630ff0","name":"Monkfish Medallions","type":"monkfish-medallions","family":"Fish","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Monkfish Medallions","marketLabel":"white fish equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"57c0191877d68d50168b4568","name":"Unsalted Butter","type":"netherend-butter-unsalted","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Unsalted Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"61f968097f9b41760f4d2295","name":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","type":"boiled-water-for-the-risotto-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"500 ml","sourceAmount":500,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Boil a full kettle. Zest and halve the lemon. Halve the baby plum tomatoes. Pick the mint leaves from their stalks and roughly chop (discard the stalks). Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). If you prefer hob cooking your risotto, skip the oven and just use a normal pan in the next step.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large, wide-bottomed ovenproof pan on medium-high heat. If you don't have an ovenproof pan, use a normal pan and transfer to an ovenproof dish before baking. Once hot, add the bacon lardons and stir-fry until golden, 3-4 mins. Add the garlic and stir-fry for 1 min more, then add the risotto rice. Stir and cook until the edges of the rice are translucent, 1-2 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw meat. Cook bacon thoroughly.","Stir in the boiled water for the risotto (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and vegetable stock paste. Bring back up to the boil, then pop a lid on the pan (or cover with foil). Bake on the middle shelf of your oven until the rice is cooked and the water has been absorbed, 25-30 mins. Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, mix together the olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season with salt and pepper, then set the dressing aside. For hob cooking, pour in 2p: 800ml, 3p: 1200ml, 4p: 1600ml of boiled water a third at a time, stirring each time until the stock has been absorbed, 20-25 mins.","About 10 mins before the risotto is cooked, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. Pat the monkfish dry with kitchen paper, then season with salt and pepper. Once hot, add the monkfish pieces to the pan and scatter over the lemon zest. Cook for 3-4 mins each side, adjusting the heat as necessary. When cooked, transfer to a plate and cover to keep warm. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw fish. It's cooked when opaque in the middle.","When the risotto is cooked, remove from the oven and stir in the peas, butter, half the mint and half the grated hard Italian style cheese. Squeeze in some lemon juice, then taste and add more salt, pepper and lemon juice if needed. Add a splash of water to loosen the risotto to your desired consistency.","Share the bacon and pea risotto between your bowls, then top with the monkfish. Sprinkle over the remaining cheese and mint to finish. Toss the rocket and baby plum tomatoes in the dressing, then serve alongside."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69c2c4d1d00889bd558ce401/step-8fc60600.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69c2c4d1d00889bd558ce401/step-7fa39810.jpg","caption":"Start your Risotto"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69c2c4d1d00889bd558ce401/step-eec81620.jpg","caption":"Ready, Steady, Bake"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69c2c4d1d00889bd558ce401/step-a6d4d830.jpg","caption":"Cook the Monkfish"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69c2c4d1d00889bd558ce401/step-515dfe40.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69c2c4d1d00889bd558ce401/step-a1a13b50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/monkfish-bacon-and-pea-oven-baked-risotto-69c2c4d1d00889bd558ce401","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/monkfish-bacon-and-pea-oven-baked-risotto-69c2c4d1d00889bd558ce401","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Lemon"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["200 g","Monkfish Medallions"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Unsalted Butter"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["40 g","Wild Rocket"],["500 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"yoghurt-fruit-pots","sourceId":"69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf","title":"Tandoori Salmon Traybake","subtitle":"with Cumin Wedges, Peas, Tenderstem® Broccoli and Mango Chutney","time":35,"cost":14.68,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","prepped in 10","calorie smart","south/southeastasian","sheet pan","source of fibre","pescatarian","indian","seafood","other","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Medium Bowl","Baking Tray"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R33_W45_UK_R17656-8_edit_salmon_Main_R17656-15_var_high-3de12374.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/tandoori-salmon-traybake-69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1 sachet","Tandoori Masala Mix"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["450 g","Potatoes"],["1 sachet","White Cumin Seeds"],["80 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["120 g","Peas"],["40 g","Mango Chutney"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1 sachet","Tandoori Masala Mix"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["450 g","Potatoes"],["1 sachet","White Cumin Seeds"],["80 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["120 g","Peas"],["40 g","Mango Chutney"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"62fcaa4abd9a2478e193f089","name":"Tandoori Masala Mix","type":"tandoori-masala-mix","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tandoori Masala Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a56e74dab71d76f8b4570","name":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","type":"natural-yoghurt","family":"yogurt","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","marketLabel":"yoghurts pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"62fcaa09bd9a2478e193effe","name":"Salmon Fillets","type":"skin-on-salmon-fillet","family":"none","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salmon Fillets","marketLabel":"Scottish salmon fillets x2 240g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"62fca9f6bd9a2478e193efde","name":"White Cumin Seeds","type":"white-cumin-seeds","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"White Cumin Seeds","marketLabel":"cumin equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a665afd2cb99c598b4569","name":"Tenderstem® Broccoli","type":"tenderstem-broccoli","family":"broccoli","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tenderstem® Broccoli","marketLabel":"broccoli head","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55d366e84dab71542f8b4567","name":"Mango Chutney","type":"mango-chutney","family":"chutney","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mango Chutney","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308142dc4b928197f3b3","name":"Crispy Onions","type":"crispy-onions","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Crispy Onions","marketLabel":"crispy onions 75g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. In a medium bowl, combine the tandoori masala mix and half the yoghurt. Season with salt and pepper. Add the salmon to the bowl and stir to coat in the tandoori marinade. Leave to one side to marinate. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw fish.","While the salmon marinates, chop the potatoes into 2cm wide wedges (no need to peel).","Pop the wedges onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, sprinkle over the cumin seeds, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the middle shelf until golden, 30-40 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, lay the salmon onto one side of a medium, lined baking tray and drizzle with oil. Roast the salmon on the top shelf of your oven until cooked through, 10-15 mins. The fish is cooked when opaque in the middle. Meanwhile, halve any thick broccoli stems lengthways.","When the salmon has 12 minutes left, pop the Tenderstem® broccoli onto the other side of the baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Return to the oven to roast on the top shelf until tender and crispy, 10-12 mins. When the broccoli and salmon have 2 mins remaining, add the peas to the same baking tray. Return to the oven for the remaining time until the peas are piping hot and the salmon is cooked through, 2-3 mins. If you'd prefer to boil your broccoli and peas, boil while the salmon is roasting, for 3-4 mins, until tender.","When ready, share the salmon between your plates. Spoon the remaining yoghurt over the salmon, then drizzle with the mango chutney and sprinkle on the crispy onions. Serve the cumin seed wedges, roasted broccoli and peas alongside."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf/step-20131a00.jpg","caption":"Marinate the Salmon"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf/step-a8f9a310.jpg","caption":"Prep the Wedges"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf/step-0956b020.jpg","caption":"Ready, Steady, Bake"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf/step-a7f24630.jpg","caption":"Salmon Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf/step-f8c36440.jpg","caption":"Yes Peas"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf/step-14b26850.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/tandoori-salmon-traybake-69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/tandoori-salmon-traybake-69bae00ee0e4e3eb769f97cf","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"other","shoppingIngredients":[["1 sachet","Tandoori Masala Mix"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["450 g","Potatoes"],["1 sachet","White Cumin Seeds"],["80 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["120 g","Peas"],["40 g","Mango Chutney"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"hummus-crunch-wraps","sourceId":"69bae020d378378da7abd637","title":"Crispy Chicken, Chorizo and Herby Jersey Royal Potato Salad","subtitle":"with Lemon Dressed Garden Salad","time":40,"cost":24.19,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["high protein","mediterranean","classic-plates","low carb","seasonal heroes","new","spanish","poultry","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Colander","Large Saucepan","Pan","Baking Tray","Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R16_W21_UK_L55300-3_edit_chorizo_main_high-80758275.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/crispy-chicken-chorizo-and-herby-jersey-royal-potato-salad-69bae020d378378da7abd637","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["400 g","Jersey Royal Potatoes"],["2","Skin-On British Chicken Breasts"],["1 sachet","Mediterranean Style Seasoning"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["1","Lemon"],["1","Intense™ Tomato"],["50 g","Aioli"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["25 g","Red Pepper Chilli Jelly"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["400 g","Jersey Royal Potatoes"],["2","Skin-On British Chicken Breasts"],["1 sachet","Mediterranean Style Seasoning"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["1","Lemon"],["1","Intense™ Tomato"],["50 g","Aioli"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["25 g","Red Pepper Chilli Jelly"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"694423c63e57376810f92ad5","name":"Jersey Royal Potatoes","type":"jersey-royal-potatoes","family":"none","amount":"400 g","sourceAmount":400,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Jersey Royal Potatoes","marketLabel":"Jersey Royal potatoes 450g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a4f771dc2880079a1305f22","name":"Skin-On British Chicken Breasts","type":"chicken-fillet-skin-on","family":"chicken","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Skin-On British Chicken Breasts","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6949315e39d4849fb4579445","name":"Mediterranean Style Seasoning","type":"mediterranean-spice-mix","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mediterranean Style Seasoning","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e96f8b25e1e268b4578","name":"Mint","type":"mint","family":"mint","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mint","marketLabel":"fresh mint 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6964d09de6255ccadc13bd52","name":"Intense™ Tomato","type":"tomato-intense","family":"none","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Intense™ Tomato","marketLabel":"tomato cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68a44d3d7e1f6c64ca674b57","name":"Aioli","type":"aioli","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Aioli","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59159a3f2310a84f8641c5f3","name":"Red Pepper Chilli Jelly","type":"red-pepper-chilli-jelly","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Pepper Chilli Jelly","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"66ab6339f66002bbd100b304","name":"Diced Chorizo","type":"chorizo-diced","family":"none","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced Chorizo","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a large saucepan of water with ½ tsp salt to the boil on high heat. Halve the Jersey Royal potatoes (no need to peel). Quarter any larger ones. When boiling, add the potatoes to the water and cook until tender, 15-20 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and set aside to cool for 5 mins.","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, lay the chicken into the pan, skin-side down. Season with salt and pepper. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Fry until golden, 5-6 mins, then turn and cook for 1 min on the other side. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken.","Once browned, transfer the chicken to a baking tray, drizzle over some oil, sprinkle over the Mediterranean style seasoning and turn to coat the chicken. Place the chicken skin-side up and roast on the top shelf of your oven until cooked, 12-15 mins. The chicken is cooked when no longer pink in the middle. Return the (now empty) frying pan to medium-high heat (no need to clean). Once hot, add the chorizo and fry until it starts to brown, 3-4 mins, then set aside.","Meanwhile, pick the mint leaves from their stalks and roughly chop (discard the stalks). Cut the lemon into wedges. Cut the Intense™ tomato into 2cm chunks. In a medium bowl, combine a good squeeze of lemon juice with the sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper, then add the tomato chunks to the dressing. Set aside for now.","Once the potatoes have cooled, add the Jersey Royal potatoes, cooked chorizo, aioli, chopped mint, a good squeeze of lemon juice, salt and pepper to a large bowl and toss together. Add the baby leaves to the bowl of tomato and toss together. Cut the chicken widthways into 2cm thick slices.","Share the chicken between your plates and drizzle over the red pepper chilli jelly. Serve the Jersey Royal potato salad and the lemon dressed tomato salad alongside."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae020d378378da7abd637/step-c4a80600.jpg","caption":"Boil the Potatoes"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae020d378378da7abd637/step-27acdf10.jpg","caption":"Get Frying"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae020d378378da7abd637/step-9cbdc220.jpg","caption":"Time to Roast"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae020d378378da7abd637/step-63269c30.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae020d378378da7abd637/step-7d086240.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae020d378378da7abd637/step-a23cb650.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/crispy-chicken-chorizo-and-herby-jersey-royal-potato-salad-69bae020d378378da7abd637","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/crispy-chicken-chorizo-and-herby-jersey-royal-potato-salad-69bae020d378378da7abd637","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["400 g","Jersey Royal Potatoes"],["2","Skin-On British Chicken Breasts"],["1 sachet","Mediterranean Style Seasoning"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["1","Lemon"],["1","Intense™ Tomato"],["50 g","Aioli"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["25 g","Red Pepper Chilli Jelly"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"overnight-oats-berries","sourceId":"69bae02cd378378da7abd651","title":"Chorizo Crusted Baked Penne","subtitle":"with Cheese and Garlicky Tenderstem® Broccoli","time":40,"cost":23.66,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","customer favourite","bestseller","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","italian","pork","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Grater","Colander","Large Saucepan","Bowl","Pan","Oven dish","Lid"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R07_W21_UK_R2924-43_main_high-da534d16.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chorizo-crusted-baked-penne-69bae02cd378378da7abd651","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["180 g","Penne Pasta"],["60 g","Diced Chorizo"],["25 g","Breadcrumbs"],["1 sachet","Smoked Paprika"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["160 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["1 tbsp","Oil for Cooking"],["20 g","Butter for the Roux"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["200 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["180 g","Penne Pasta"],["60 g","Diced Chorizo"],["25 g","Breadcrumbs"],["1 sachet","Smoked Paprika"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["160 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["1 tbsp","Oil for Cooking"],["20 g","Butter for the Roux"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["200 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"69e600cbfe534c766c45012b","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6879961b7299475a5b057874","name":"Penne Pasta","type":"penne-wheat","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Penne Pasta","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"66ab6339f66002bbd100b304","name":"Diced Chorizo","type":"chorizo-diced","family":"none","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced Chorizo","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e2f42dc4b928197f136","name":"Breadcrumbs","type":"breadcrumbs","family":"breadcrumbs","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Breadcrumbs","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea6da082ea161fce4e2","name":"Smoked Paprika","type":"smoked-paprika","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Smoked Paprika","marketLabel":"paprika jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60002d898c8c0a188200a96d","name":"Chicken Stock Paste","type":"chicken-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chicken Stock Paste","marketLabel":"chicken stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a665afd2cb99c598b4569","name":"Tenderstem® Broccoli","type":"tenderstem-broccoli","family":"broccoli","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tenderstem® Broccoli","marketLabel":"broccoli head","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60f7ff6ae5a270ab7dbce1b7","name":"Oil for Cooking","type":"oil-for-cooking","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Oil for Cooking","marketLabel":"cooking oil","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6400aafb7cb532b7de19ed97","name":"Butter for the Roux","type":"butter-for-the-roux","family":"none","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter for the Roux","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60f9470be5a270ab7dbce1b8","name":"Plain Flour","type":"plain-flour-1-tbsp","family":"flour","amount":"1.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":1.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Plain Flour","marketLabel":"plain flour 1.5kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the pasta. Grate the Cheddar cheese. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). When your pan of water is boiling, add the penne and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","While the pasta cooks, heat the oil for cooking (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) in a frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the chorizo until it starts to brown, 1-2 mins. Once browned, transfer the chorizo and carefully drain its oil into a small bowl with the breadcrumbs. Season with pepper, stir to combine, then set the chorizo crumb aside.","Return the (now empty) frying pan on medium-high heat (no need to clean). Melt the butter for the roux (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Once melted, stir in the smoked paprika and flour (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Cook until it forms a paste, 1-2 mins - you've made a roux! Gradually stir in the water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients), followed by the chicken stock paste. Bring to the boil, stir and simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins. Add the spinach to the pan a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins. ​Make kid friendly: If you’d prefer to serve the spinach on the side, add it to the broccoli once the broccoli is cooked in step 5 and stir-fry until wilted and piping hot, 2-3 mins.","Stir in the creme fraiche, then remove from the heat. Add the Cheddar cheese and hard Italian style cheese and stir until melted. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed. Add the cooked pasta to the cheese sauce and stir to combine. Add a splash of water to loosen if needed, then transfer to an ovenproof dish and sprinkle the chorizo crumb evenly over the top. Bake on the top shelf of your oven until the crumbs are golden, 5-6 mins. Once cooked, remove from your oven and leave to stand.","Meanwhile, clean your frying pan and pop it back on medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. Halve any thick broccoli stems lengthways. Once hot, add the broccoli and stir-fry for 1-2 mins. Add the garlic and fry for 1 min more. Add a splash of water and immediately cover with a lid or some foil. Lower the heat to medium and allow to cook until the broccoli is tender, 4-5 mins. Remove from the heat.","Spoon the baked penne into bowls and serve the broccoli (and spinach if you've cooked it separately) alongside."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae02cd378378da7abd651/step-9aa37800.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae02cd378378da7abd651/step-e08f0710.jpg","caption":"Make the Chorizo Crumb"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae02cd378378da7abd651/step-a6af4c20.jpg","caption":"Make the Roux"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae02cd378378da7abd651/step-c72c3d30.jpg","caption":"Assemble your Bake"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae02cd378378da7abd651/step-2cab7840.jpg","caption":"Steam-Fry the Broccoli"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae02cd378378da7abd651/step-d3d74e50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[["6879961b7299475a5b057874","58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22"],["66ab6339f66002bbd100b304"],["6400aafb7cb532b7de19ed97","60f9470be5a270ab7dbce1b8","5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","69e600cbfe534c766c45012b","555084f34dab718e128b4569","60002d898c8c0a188200a96d"],["6879961b7299475a5b057874"],["60f7ff6ae5a270ab7dbce1b7","554a665afd2cb99c598b4569"],["60f7ff6ae5a270ab7dbce1b7","6400aafb7cb532b7de19ed97","60f9470be5a270ab7dbce1b8","5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","554a665afd2cb99c598b4569","69e600cbfe534c766c45012b","555084f34dab718e128b4569","60002d898c8c0a188200a96d","66ab6339f66002bbd100b304","6879961b7299475a5b057874","58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22"]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chorizo-crusted-baked-penne-69bae02cd378378da7abd651","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chorizo-crusted-baked-penne-69bae02cd378378da7abd651","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["180 g","Penne Pasta"],["60 g","Diced Chorizo"],["25 g","Breadcrumbs"],["1 sachet","Smoked Paprika"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["160 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["1 tbsp","Oil for Cooking"],["20 g","Butter for the Roux"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["200 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chickpea-couscous-jars","sourceId":"69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d","title":"Speedy Beefy Penne","subtitle":"with Bell Pepper, Spinach and Cheddar","time":25,"cost":17.74,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","quick","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","high protein","italian","beef","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Pan","Garlic Press","Medium Saucepan","Colander","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R39_W21_UK_G1888-4269-50_main_high-55caebbc.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-beefy-penne-69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["180 g","Penne Pasta"],["15 g","Worcester Sauce"],["1 carton","Finely Chopped Tomatoes with Onion and Garlic"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["180 g","Penne Pasta"],["15 g","Worcester Sauce"],["1 carton","Finely Chopped Tomatoes with Onion and Garlic"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c1c67fd2cb99f468b4567","name":"British Beef Mince","type":"beef mince","family":"beef","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Beef Mince","marketLabel":"5% fat beef mince 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"633c6597aa3f33c15c854bb0","name":"Mixed Herbs","type":"mixed-herbs","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mixed Herbs","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6879961b7299475a5b057874","name":"Penne Pasta","type":"penne-wheat","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Penne Pasta","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"67f6a20b596b6eeb0c6f979c","name":"Worcester Sauce","type":"vegetarian-worcestershire-sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Worcester Sauce","marketLabel":"Worcestershire sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5903128d043c3c5aa53bd822","name":"Finely Chopped Tomatoes with Onion and Garlic","type":"finely-chopped-tomatoes-with-onion-and-garlic","family":"tomato","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Finely Chopped Tomatoes with Onion and Garlic","marketLabel":"chopped tomatoes 400g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a4fc599c288003649295c52","name":"Red Wine Stock Paste","type":"red-wine-stock-pot","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"28 g","sourceAmount":28,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Wine Stock Paste","marketLabel":"beef cooking concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69e604f9b2918f341e7a66b7","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"50 ml","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil on high heat with ½ tsp salt. Meanwhile, halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Slice into thin strips. Heat a large frying pan on medium-high heat (no oil). Once hot, add the beef mince and sliced pepper. Fry until browned, 5-6 mins. Use a spoon to break up the mince as it cooks, then drain and discard any excess fat. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince. Meanwhile, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press), then add to the mince with the mixed herbs. Cook, stirring, for 1 min.","Meanwhile, add the penne to the pan of boiling water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back into the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","While the pasta cooks, add the Worcester sauce to the beef and allow to bubble away until evaporated, 30 secs. Stir in the chopped tomatoes, red wine stock paste, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, stirring, then reduce the heat to medium and simmer until the sauce has thickened, 5-6 mins. Add a splash of water if it gets too thick. The mince is cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Meanwhile, grate the Cheddar. When the sauce has thickened, add the spinach a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins.","Toss the cooked penne through the sauce along with the grated Cheddar and combine well. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed.","When ready, serve your beef penne in bowls."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d/step-5f438a00.jpg","caption":"Fry the Beef"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d/step-d3a4b310.jpg","caption":"Cook the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d/step-6ab6bf20.jpg","caption":"Sauce Things Up"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d/step-fa0e1b30.jpg","caption":"Wilt the Spinach"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d/step-57590940.jpg","caption":"Combine and Stir"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d/step-2f1ddd50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-beefy-penne-69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-beefy-penne-69bae01ffff2efa4150ed54d","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["180 g","Penne Pasta"],["15 g","Worcester Sauce"],["1 carton","Finely Chopped Tomatoes with Onion and Garlic"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"tuna-cucumber-wraps","sourceId":"69bae019d378378da7abd61f","title":"Quick Hot Honey Peri Peri Chorizo, Chicken and Pepper Tacos","subtitle":"with Spiced Potatoes and Cheddar Cheese","time":25,"cost":33.14,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","medium spice","latin-american-faves","handhelds","high protein","cajunsk","pork","handheld","wrap"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Medium Saucepan","Kettle","Grater","Medium Bowl","Large Frying Pan","Colander","Plate"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R41_W44_UK_QR25532-9_Main_QR25532-AP-2-14_var_high-0e2f0266.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/quick-hot-honey-peri-peri-chorizo-chicken-and-pepper-tacos-69bae019d378378da7abd61f","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["350 g","Salad Potatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Peri Peri Seasoning"],["50 g","Hot Sauce"],["15 g","Honey"],["4","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["30 g","Butter"],["2 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["350 g","Salad Potatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Peri Peri Seasoning"],["50 g","Hot Sauce"],["15 g","Honey"],["4","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["30 g","Butter"],["2 tbsp","Mayonnaise"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5dbc6e87b96bdd752017bc59","name":"Salad Potatoes","type":"salad-potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"350 g","sourceAmount":350,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salad Potatoes","marketLabel":"baby potatoes 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69e6082dfe534c766c450737","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"15 ml","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea605fc26d5313f23d2","name":"Diced British Chicken Breast","type":"chicken-breast-diced","family":"none","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced British Chicken Breast","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837ac5df7d5496ac4a6831f","name":"Peri Peri Seasoning","type":"peri-peri-seasoning","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peri Peri Seasoning","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e285e8c281b6b2b4a03982b","name":"Hot Sauce","type":"hot-sauce","family":"asian paste","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Hot Sauce","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683727bfd9848b9dac04fe03","name":"Plain Taco Tortillas","type":"plain-taco-tortilla","family":"none","amount":"4","sourceAmount":3.996,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Plain Taco Tortillas","marketLabel":"wraps or tortillas x8","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"66ab6339f66002bbd100b304","name":"Diced Chorizo","type":"chorizo-diced","family":"none","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced Chorizo","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbe487e8afb1b135f069bd2","name":"Mayonnaise","type":"mayonnaise-tbsp","family":"mayonnaise","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Mayonnaise","marketLabel":"mayonnaise 500ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["If you don't have a microwave, heat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7 for the tortillas. Boil a full kettle. Halve the salad potatoes (no need to peel). Halve any larger potatoes again. Pour the boiled water into a medium saucepan with ½ tsp salt and bring back to the boil on high heat. Add the potatoes to the water, lower the heat to medium and cook until tender, 12-15 mins.","Meanwhile, halve, peel and thinly slice the red onion. Halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Slice into thin strips. Grate the Cheddar cheese. In a medium bowl, combine the cider vinegar, sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Set your dressing aside.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the diced chorizo, diced chicken, red onion and sliced pepper to the pan. Sprinkle over half the peri peri seasoning and season with salt and pepper. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Stir-fry until golden brown on the outside and cooked through, 8-10 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","When the potatoes are cooked, drain in a colander and allow to steam for a few mins. Return the potato pan to medium heat and melt half the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Add the remaining peri peri seasoning and a pinch of sugar. Cook until fragrant, 30 secs. Add the potatoes back to the pan and toss to coat in the spiced butter. Season with salt and pepper. Remove from the heat and cover to keep warm.","Once cooked, add the hot sauce, honey and remaining butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) to the pan with the chicken and veg. If the measured honey is very thick, warm it briefly so it pours easily. Allow to melt and stir to combine, 1 min. Toss to coat the chicken, then remove from the heat. Pile the tortillas (2 per person) onto a plate. Heat them through in the microwave, 850W: 50 secs / 750W: 1 min, until warm and soft. If you're using the oven, pop them into the oven to warm through, 1-2 mins.","When everything's ready, add the leaves to the dressing bowl and toss to coat. Share the tortillas between your plates. Spread over the mayo (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Top with the baby leaf salad, chorizo, chicken and veg. Drizzle over any remaining sauce from the pan. Sprinkle over the cheese. Serve the buttery spiced potatoes alongside."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae019d378378da7abd61f/step-f0a79600.jpg","caption":"Boil the Potatoes"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae019d378378da7abd61f/step-8ab5ca10.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae019d378378da7abd61f/step-0c58a020.jpg","caption":"Fry the Chorizo and Chicken"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae019d378378da7abd61f/step-43503530.jpg","caption":"Spiced Butter Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae019d378378da7abd61f/step-8fd73a40.jpg","caption":"Add the Hot Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae019d378378da7abd61f/step-aff1b050.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/quick-hot-honey-peri-peri-chorizo-chicken-and-pepper-tacos-69bae019d378378da7abd61f","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/quick-hot-honey-peri-peri-chorizo-chicken-and-pepper-tacos-69bae019d378378da7abd61f","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"wrap","shoppingIngredients":[["350 g","Salad Potatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Peri Peri Seasoning"],["50 g","Hot Sauce"],["15 g","Honey"],["4","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["30 g","Butter"],["2 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chickpea-crunch-salad","sourceId":"69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df","title":"Fajita Flavours Chorizo, Spinach & Ricotta Tortelloni","subtitle":"with Cheese and Garlic Ciabatta","time":25,"cost":20.46,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","latin-american-faves","pasta-noodles","medium spice","mexican","pork","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Kettle","Baking Tray","Pan","Colander","Large Saucepan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R43_W47_UK_HVV26510-5_Main_diced_chorizo_edit_high-4d7735fd.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fajita-flavours-chorizo-spinach-and-ricotta-tortelloni-69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["3","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["300 g","Spinach and Ricotta Tortelloni"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["20 g","Chipotle Paste"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["3","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["300 g","Spinach and Ricotta Tortelloni"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["20 g","Chipotle Paste"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"3","sourceAmount":3,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"66ab6339f66002bbd100b304","name":"Diced Chorizo","type":"chorizo-diced","family":"none","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced Chorizo","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68419dfc5a41964b9c038cdd","name":"Spinach and Ricotta Tortelloni","type":"spinach-and-ricotta-tortellini","family":"none","amount":"300 g","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Spinach and Ricotta Tortelloni","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a70affd2cb95a598b456f","name":"Chipotle Paste","type":"chipotle paste","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chipotle Paste","marketLabel":"cooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"602fb8be9c479d367f798aee","name":"Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread","type":"olive-oil-for-the-garlic-bread-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"150 ml","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a full kettle for the tortelloni. Halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Slice into thin strips. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press).","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. Once hot, add the chorizo and sliced pepper and cook until charred, 5-6 mins. While the pepper cooks, halve the ciabatta and lay onto a baking tray, cut-side up. Spread over half the garlic and drizzle with the olive oil for the garlic bread (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Set aside for now.","Meanwhile, pour the boiled water into a large saucepan with ½ tsp salt on high heat. Add the tortelloni to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 4-5 mins. Preheat your grill to high. Once the tortelloni is cooked, drain in a colander. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Once the pepper is charred, add the tomato puree, chipotle paste and remaining garlic. Fry for 1 min. Next, stir in the veg stock paste, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then lower the heat and simmer until thickened, 2-3 mins. Meanwhile, pop the garlic bread under the grill until golden, 5-6 mins.","Once the sauce has thickened, stir in the creme fraiche and hard Italian style cheese. Simmer for 1 min more. Season with salt and pepper and remove from the heat.","Gently mix the cooked tortelloni into the sauce (add a splash of water if needed), then share between your bowls. Top with a handful of rocket. Cut the garlic bread diagonally in half and serve on the side."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df/step-ef8b9500.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df/step-5d486610.jpg","caption":"Fry the Chorizo and Pepper"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df/step-b1f7e120.jpg","caption":"Cook the Tortelloni"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df/step-50e18e30.jpg","caption":"Make the Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df/step-155c8f40.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df/step-272a2c50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fajita-flavours-chorizo-spinach-and-ricotta-tortelloni-69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fajita-flavours-chorizo-spinach-and-ricotta-tortelloni-69bae014e0e4e3eb769f97df","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["3","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["300 g","Spinach and Ricotta Tortelloni"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["20 g","Chipotle Paste"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chicken-pesto-sandwiches","sourceId":"69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4","title":"Lemongrass and Sambal Pork Larb Style Salad","subtitle":"with Green Beans, Carrot Ribbons and Jasmine Rice","time":25,"cost":17.88,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","medium spice","south/southeastasian","dinner-bowls","cuisine-spotlight","thai","pork","salad"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Medium Saucepan","Lid","Peeler","Pan","Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R12_W21_UK_L10929-21_main_high-784bf208.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/lemongrass-and-sambal-pork-larb-style-salad-69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["100 g","Basmati Rice"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Carrot"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["240 g","British Pork Mince"],["15 g","Ginger, Garlic & Lemongrass Puree"],["15 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["40 g","Ketjap Manis"],["15 g","Sambal Paste"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["200 ml","Water for the Rice"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["100 g","Basmati Rice"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Carrot"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["240 g","British Pork Mince"],["15 g","Ginger, Garlic & Lemongrass Puree"],["15 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["40 g","Ketjap Manis"],["15 g","Sambal Paste"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["200 ml","Water for the Rice"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"55508011fd2cb96c628b456c","name":"Basmati Rice","type":"basmati rice","family":"rice","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basmati Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555080c2f8b25e4d4c8b4568","name":"Green Beans","type":"green beans","family":"beans","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Green Beans","marketLabel":"green beans 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5f284dab71a6058b4567","name":"Carrot","type":"carrot","family":"carrot","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Carrot","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68ecc674fa624b85e8848c26","name":"Baby Gem Lettuce","type":"baby gem lettuce","family":"salad mix","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Gem Lettuce","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550e5664dab71c63e8b4567","name":"British Pork Mince","type":"pork-mince","family":"pork","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Pork Mince","marketLabel":"pork mince 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6148c0c0371d0a48484f9adb","name":"Ginger, Garlic & Lemongrass Puree","type":"ginger-garlic-lemongrass-puree","family":"ginger","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ginger, Garlic & Lemongrass Puree","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a68fa4dab71aa058b4568","name":"Rice Vinegar","type":"rice vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"15 ml","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Rice Vinegar","marketLabel":"cooking vinegar equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"574eff80f8b25eab0d8b4567","name":"Ketjap Manis","type":"ketjap-manis","family":"sauce","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ketjap Manis","marketLabel":"Asian cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60accf96e728ee63dd0d01d2","name":"Sambal Paste","type":"sambal","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sambal Paste","marketLabel":"cooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"10 ml","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"57bec7a892eec9ca688b4568","name":"Water for the Rice","type":"water-for-the-rice-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Rice","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Pour the water for the rice (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) into a medium saucepan with a tight-fitting lid. Stir in the rice and ¼ tsp salt and bring to the boil. Once boiling, turn the heat down to medium and cover with the lid. Leave to cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from the heat (still covered) and leave to the side for another 10 mins (the rice will continue to cook in its own steam).","Meanwhile, trim the green beans, then cut into thirds. Trim and peel the carrot. Use the peeler to peel long ribbons down the length of the carrot, stopping at the core. Trim the baby gem, halve lengthways, then thinly slice widthways.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a medium frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the pork mince and green beans. Cook until softened and browned, 6-8 mins. Use a spoon to break up the mince as it cooks, then drain and discard any excess fat. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle. Stir in the ginger, garlic & lemongrass puree. Cook for 30 secs.","Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine the rice vinegar, sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Add the carrot ribbons and toss to coat in the dressing. Set aside.","Once the pork is cooked, remove from the heat. Stir in the ketjap manis, sambal, soy sauce and 1 tbsp of water per person. Just before serving, add the baby gem to the bowl of carrot ribbons and toss to coat in the dressing.","Fluff up the rice with a fork and share between your bowls. Top with the pork larb on one side and salad on the other."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4/step-f40cfc00.jpg","caption":"Cook the Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4/step-18041f10.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4/step-89c8a520.jpg","caption":"Fry the Pork and Beans"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4/step-b0689730.jpg","caption":"Dress the Salad"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4/step-2b8e9c40.jpg","caption":"Bring on the Flavours"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4/step-a4585450.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/lemongrass-and-sambal-pork-larb-style-salad-69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/lemongrass-and-sambal-pork-larb-style-salad-69badfe0fff2efa4150ed4d4","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["100 g","Basmati Rice"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Carrot"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["240 g","British Pork Mince"],["15 g","Ginger, Garlic & Lemongrass Puree"],["15 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["40 g","Ketjap Manis"],["15 g","Sambal Paste"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["200 ml","Water for the Rice"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"tuna-sweetcorn-sandwiches","sourceId":"69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728","title":"Cheesy Veggie Mince Quesadillas","subtitle":"with Wedges and Apple Salad","time":40,"cost":23.2,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","latin-american-faves","handhelds","source of fibre","mexican","handheld","cook","wrap"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Grater","Pan","Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R49_W20_UK_V52148-5_main_high-adcf9c9d.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cheesy-veggie-mince-quesadillas-69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["50 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["60 g","Red Leicester"],["150 g","Vegan Mince"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["4","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["1","Apple"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Tomato Ketchup"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["50 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["60 g","Red Leicester"],["150 g","Vegan Mince"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["4","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["1","Apple"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Tomato Ketchup"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Mayonnaise"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69e606584af8f3547a653d8a","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60070bcc351ada1981143062","name":"Red Leicester","type":"red-leicester","family":"hard cheese","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Leicester","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"67fccaefa3ffaf7fe874d432","name":"Vegan Mince","type":"vegan-mince","family":"none","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegan Mince","marketLabel":"plant protein equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c89afa8e1c4145a37bc75f","name":"Mexican Style Spice Mix","type":"mexican-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mexican Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683727bfd9848b9dac04fe03","name":"Plain Taco Tortillas","type":"plain-taco-tortilla","family":"none","amount":"4","sourceAmount":3.996,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Plain Taco Tortillas","marketLabel":"wraps or tortillas x8","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c34ebf8b25eb9658b4567","name":"Apple","type":"apple","family":"apple","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Apple","marketLabel":"crisp apples x6","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"15 ml","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"150 ml","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60f949dce5a270ab7dbce1ba","name":"Tomato Ketchup","type":"tomato-ketchup-1-tbsp-15g","family":"other drink","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Tomato Ketchup","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbe487e8afb1b135f069bd2","name":"Mayonnaise","type":"mayonnaise-tbsp","family":"mayonnaise","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Mayonnaise","marketLabel":"mayonnaise 500ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potatoes into 2cm wide wedges (no need to peel). Pop the wedges onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the middle shelf until golden, 30-40 mins. Turn halfway through. Meanwhile, grate the Cheddar and Red Leicester cheeses.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the meat-free mince to the pan and stir-fry, 5-6 mins. Ensure it's piping hot throughout. Add the Mexican style spice mix and stir-fry for 1 min. Add the tomato puree, water for the sauce, ketchup and honey (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then simmer until the sauce has thickened slightly, 2-3 mins.","Lay the tortillas (2 per person) onto a lightly oiled baking tray and spoon the plant-based minced filling onto one half of each one. Top the mince with the grated cheese. Fold together to make a semi-circle. Press down lightly to keep together.","Rub a little oil over the top of each quesadilla, then bake on the top shelf of your oven until golden, 8-12 mins.","Meanwhile, quarter, core and thinly slice the apple (no need to peel). In a large bowl, combine the cider vinegar, sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. When everything's ready, add the apple and rocket leaves to the dressing and toss to evenly coat. Don't add the leaves too early or they'll go soggy.","Share the quesadillas, wedges and salad between your plates. Add dollops of mayonnaise (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) on the side for dipping."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728/step-c46f0300.jpg","caption":"Start the Wedges"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728/step-9e61d210.jpg","caption":"Make the Filling"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728/step-9a8aaf20.jpg","caption":"Assemble the Quesadillas"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728/step-0bbff930.jpg","caption":"Time to Bake"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728/step-98551240.jpg","caption":"Make the Salad"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728/step-363b2450.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cheesy-veggie-mince-quesadillas-69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cheesy-veggie-mince-quesadillas-69b19cc9c4d2659f3727d728","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"wrap","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["50 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["60 g","Red Leicester"],["150 g","Vegan Mince"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["4","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["1","Apple"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Tomato Ketchup"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"egg-spinach-sandwiches","sourceId":"69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4","title":"Glazed Halloumi and Jewelled Pearl Couscous Salad","subtitle":"with Fig Jam, Pomegranate, Pistachios and Yoghurt","time":40,"cost":22.88,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","taste of middle east","dinner-bowls","source of fibre","new","hellofresh specials","middle eastern","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Bowl","Baking Tray","Sieve","Medium Saucepan","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R80_W20_UK_SVP52614-3_main_high-171abe1f.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/glazed-halloumi-and-jewelled-pearl-couscous-salad-69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["160 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["200 g","Diced Sweet Potato"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["150 g","Pearl Couscous"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["1","Pomegranate"],["25 g","Salted Pistachios"],["0.5","Lemon"],["35 g","Caramelised Onion Paste"],["40 g","Fig Jam"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["160 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["200 g","Diced Sweet Potato"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["150 g","Pearl Couscous"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["1","Pomegranate"],["25 g","Salted Pistachios"],["0.5","Lemon"],["35 g","Caramelised Onion Paste"],["40 g","Fig Jam"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a6387fd2cb99c598b4568","name":"Chickpeas","type":"organic chickpeas","family":"canned chickpeas","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chickpeas","marketLabel":"chickpeas 400g, 240g drained","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a665afd2cb99c598b4569","name":"Tenderstem® Broccoli","type":"tenderstem-broccoli","family":"broccoli","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tenderstem® Broccoli","marketLabel":"broccoli head","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55686e0bf8b25e15418b4567","name":"Halloumi","type":"halloumi","family":"hard cheese","amount":"225 g","sourceAmount":225,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Halloumi","marketLabel":"Cypriot halloumi 225g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a6b6a9030006c2b3c4eac22","name":"Diced Sweet Potato","type":"diced-sweet-potato","family":"potato","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced Sweet Potato","marketLabel":"sweet potato","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"566af3d3f8b25e717b8b4567","name":"Chermoula Spice Mix","type":"chermoula-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chermoula Spice Mix","marketLabel":"chermoula seasoning","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68d55859478b7ea4b4a801f7","name":"Pearl Couscous","type":"pearl-couscous","family":"none","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Pearl Couscous","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e96f8b25e1e268b4578","name":"Mint","type":"mint","family":"mint","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mint","marketLabel":"fresh mint 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d5f39fd2cb932078b4568","name":"Pomegranate","type":"pomegranate","family":"pomegranate","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Pomegranate","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69c88999591ea8bdcc9d81d0","name":"Salted Pistachios","type":"salted-pistachios","family":"none","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salted Pistachios","marketLabel":"table salt 750g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"0.5","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"682ddc6ec4a648afcad0da76","name":"Caramelised Onion Paste","type":"caramelised-onion-paste","family":"none","amount":"35 g","sourceAmount":35,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Caramelised Onion Paste","marketLabel":"onion preserve equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e285e97dd6676655d5288b9","name":"Fig Jam","type":"fig jam","family":"fruit preserves","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Fig Jam","marketLabel":"fig jam jar","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a56e74dab71d76f8b4570","name":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","type":"natural-yoghurt","family":"yogurt","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","marketLabel":"yoghurts pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a medium saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the pearl couscous. Drain and rinse the chickpeas in a sieve. Halve any thick broccoli stems lengthways. Pop the Tenderstem® broccoli onto a baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer, then set aside. Drain the halloumi, then cut it into 3 slices per person. Place them into a small bowl of cold water and leave to soak.","Put the chickpeas and diced sweet potato on another baking tray. Drizzle with oil and season with salt and pepper. Sprinkle over the chermoula. Toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the middle shelf of your oven until both are golden, 25-30 mins. Add the broccoli to the top shelf of the oven for the last 10-12 mins of cooking time to roast until tender and crispy.","Meanwhile, add the pearl couscous to the boiling water, reduce the heat to medium and simmer until tender with a slight bite, 14-15 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve, pop back in the pan with a drizzle of oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","While the couscous cooks, pick the mint leaves from their stalks and roughly chop (discard the stalks). Quarter the pomegranate. Remove the seeds from the white pith and pop the seeds into a bowl (discard the pith). Pat the outside of the pomegranate with the back of the spoon to help release the seeds. Remove the pistachios from their shells, then roughly chop. Halve the lemon. Squeeze the lemon juice into a large bowl and add the caramelised onion paste, sugar and olive oil (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper and mix together. Set aside.","Once drained, add the couscous to the caramelised onion dressing. Add half the pomegranate seeds and half the mint, then gently stir to combine. About 10 mins before you're ready to serve, remove the halloumi slices from the cold water, pop them onto a plate lined with kitchen paper and pat them dry. Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the halloumi and fry until golden, 2-3 mins each side. Add the fig jam and 1 tbsp water to the pan, stir together and turn to glaze the halloumi in the fig jam. Remove the pan from the heat.","Add the roasted chickpeas and sweet potato to the couscous mixuture and gently stir again to combine. Share the couscous salad between your bowls and top with the remaining mint and pomegranate seeds. Finish with a dollop of yoghurt, the broccoli and halloumi in separate sections. Finish with a sprinkling of pistachios."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4/step-9d18d300.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4/step-bb179110.jpg","caption":"Roast Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4/step-1702b820.jpg","caption":"Boil your Pearl Couscous"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4/step-6c4bda30.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4/step-a027e640.jpg","caption":"Fry the Halloumi"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4/step-03cc6d50.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/glazed-halloumi-and-jewelled-pearl-couscous-salad-69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/glazed-halloumi-and-jewelled-pearl-couscous-salad-69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b4","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["160 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["200 g","Diced Sweet Potato"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["150 g","Pearl Couscous"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["1","Pomegranate"],["25 g","Salted Pistachios"],["0.5","Lemon"],["35 g","Caramelised Onion Paste"],["40 g","Fig Jam"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"hummus-pepper-sandwiches","sourceId":"69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6","title":"Teriyaki Glazed Salmon on Fragrant Coriander Rice","subtitle":"with Sweet Chilli Spring Rolls, Sesame Purple Sprouting Broccoli and Baby Corn","time":30,"cost":28.94,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["pescatarian","pan-asian-plates","classic-plates","hellofresh specials","japanese","seafood","rice","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Medium Saucepan","Lid","Baking Tray","Baking Paper","Bowl","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R72_W20_UK_SPR11101-13_main_high-9a1ddd77.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/teriyaki-glazed-salmon-on-fragrant-coriander-rice-69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["3","Garlic Clove"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["300 g","Salmon Fillets"],["4","Vegetable Spring Rolls"],["160 g","Purple Sprouting Broccoli"],["60 g","Baby Corn"],["1 bunch","Coriander"],["64 g","Mayonnaise"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["80 g","Fresh Edamame Beans"],["5 g","Roasted White Sesame Seeds"],["20 ml","Sesame Oil"],["150 g","Teriyaki Sauce"],["48 g","Sweet Chilli Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["3","Garlic Clove"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["300 g","Salmon Fillets"],["4","Vegetable Spring Rolls"],["160 g","Purple Sprouting Broccoli"],["60 g","Baby Corn"],["1 bunch","Coriander"],["64 g","Mayonnaise"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["80 g","Fresh Edamame Beans"],["5 g","Roasted White Sesame Seeds"],["20 ml","Sesame Oil"],["150 g","Teriyaki Sauce"],["48 g","Sweet Chilli Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"3","sourceAmount":3,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55508011fd2cb96c628b456c","name":"Basmati Rice","type":"basmati rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basmati Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e285ffbe63f0f7cad20bdac","name":"Salmon Fillets","type":"salmon-fillet","family":"Fish","amount":"300 g","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salmon Fillets","marketLabel":"Scottish salmon fillets x2 240g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fa942dc4b928197f184","name":"Vegetable Spring Rolls","type":"vegetable-spring-rolls","family":"none","amount":"4","sourceAmount":4,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Spring Rolls","marketLabel":"vegetable spring rolls pack","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c8e60f8b25e1f6c8b4568","name":"Purple Sprouting Broccoli","type":"purple sprouting broccoli","family":"broccoli","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Purple Sprouting Broccoli","marketLabel":"broccoli head","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556876f2fd2cb983298b4569","name":"Baby Corn","type":"baby corn","family":"corn","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Corn","marketLabel":"fresh vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5f54fd2cb99c598b4567","name":"Coriander","type":"coriander","family":"coriander","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Coriander","marketLabel":"fresh coriander 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9d234dab7162138b4568","name":"Mayonnaise","type":"mayonnaise-tbsp","family":"mayonnaise","amount":"64 g","sourceAmount":64,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mayonnaise","marketLabel":"mayonnaise 500ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5c3f3eadc445fa4233599443","name":"Sriracha Sauce","type":"sriracha (anchovy)","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"16 ml","sourceAmount":16,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sriracha Sauce","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6908bfe548e7b2ec1b0ec551","name":"Fresh Edamame Beans","type":"fresh-edamame-beans","family":"none","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Fresh Edamame Beans","marketLabel":"fresh green vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69c11afcd795c2c9e4ff7e54","name":"Roasted White Sesame Seeds","type":"roasted-white-sesame-seeds","family":"sesame seed","amount":"5 g","sourceAmount":5,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Roasted White Sesame Seeds","marketLabel":"sesame seeds 100g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6923f8b25ef53e8b4567","name":"Sesame Oil","type":"sesame oil","family":"oil","amount":"20 ml","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sesame Oil","marketLabel":"sesame oil 250ml","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"67f0611cb777f3317f54763f","name":"Teriyaki Sauce","type":"teriyaki-sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Teriyaki Sauce","marketLabel":"teriyaki sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55683f84fd2cb985278b4568","name":"Sweet Chilli Sauce","type":"sweet chilli sauce","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"48 g","sourceAmount":48,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweet Chilli Sauce","marketLabel":"sweet chilli sauce 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"57bec7a892eec9ca688b4568","name":"Water for the Rice","type":"water-for-the-rice-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"300 ml","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Rice","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Melt the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) in a deep saucepan with a tight-fitting lid on medium-high heat. Stir in the garlic and fry until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in the rice and cook until coated, 1 min. Add ¼ tsp salt and the water for the rice (use the quantities listed in the ingredients), then bring to the boil.","Once the water is boiling, turn the heat down to medium and cover with the lid. Leave the rice to cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from the heat (still covered) and leave to the side for another 10 mins or until ready to serve (the rice will continue to cook in its own steam).","Meanwhile, lay the salmon fillets, skin-side down, onto one side a baking tray lined with baking paper. Season with salt and pepper. Add the spring rolls to the other side of the tray and drizzle over some oil. When the oven is hot, bake the salmon and spring rolls on the top shelf until cooked through, 10-15 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw fish. It's cooked when opaque in the middle.","While the salmon bakes, halve any thick purple sprouting broccoli stems lengthways. Halve the baby corn lengthways. Roughly chop the coriander (stalks and all). In a small bowl, mix together the mayo and sriracha sauce. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the broccoli, edamame and baby corn. Stir-fry for 2-3 mins, then add a splash of water and immediately cover with a lid or foil. Cook until tender, a further 4-6 mins.","Once the veg is cooked, transfer to a bowl, then stir in half the sesame seeds and half the sesame oil. Season with salt and pepper, cover to keep warm, then set aside. Pop the (now empty) frying pan back on medium heat. Pour in the teriyaki sauce and remaining sesame oil. Stir together and cook until warmed through, 1-2 mins. Once the fish is cooked, carefully transfer it to the pan of teriyaki sauce (reheat first if needed), then turn in the sauce to evenly glaze it.","When ready, fluff up the garlic rice with a fork and stir through half the coriander. Share the rice between your bowls. Top with the teriyaki salmon, spooning over any sauce left in the pan. Serve with the sesame veg and sprinkle with the remaining sesame seeds. Drizzle the sriracha mayo over the salmon and veg and finish by sprinkling over the remaining coriander. Serve the spring rolls on the side with the sweet chilli sauce for dipping."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6/step-cbc20400.jpg","caption":"Prep your Garlic Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6/step-8374c010.jpg","caption":"Cook and Steam"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6/step-c6406a20.jpg","caption":"Bake the Salmon"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6/step-dab1d530.jpg","caption":"Bring on the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6/step-f5a70740.jpg","caption":"Hey Sesame"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6/step-853b8350.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/teriyaki-glazed-salmon-on-fragrant-coriander-rice-69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/teriyaki-glazed-salmon-on-fragrant-coriander-rice-69b19ccbe5990988b41b39b6","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["3","Garlic Clove"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["300 g","Salmon Fillets"],["4","Vegetable Spring Rolls"],["160 g","Purple Sprouting Broccoli"],["60 g","Baby Corn"],["1 bunch","Coriander"],["64 g","Mayonnaise"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["80 g","Fresh Edamame Beans"],["5 g","Roasted White Sesame Seeds"],["20 ml","Sesame Oil"],["150 g","Teriyaki Sauce"],["48 g","Sweet Chilli Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"feta-tomato-sandwiches","sourceId":"69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5","title":"Spring Clean Up Cajun Spiced Chorizo and Leek Orzo","subtitle":"with Peas and Crispy Onions","time":25,"cost":18.44,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","very hot","latin-american-faves","pasta-noodles","daddy’s dishes","cajunsk","pork","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Kettle","Sieve","Large Saucepan","Large Frying Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y24_R15_W50_UK_R17525-15_Main__4low-e07e55e1.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-cajun-spiced-chorizo-and-leek-orzo-69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Leek"],["180 g","Orzo"],["60 g","Diced Chorizo"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Leek"],["180 g","Orzo"],["60 g","Diced Chorizo"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e334dab71a9058b4567","name":"Leek","type":"leek","family":"leek","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Leek","marketLabel":"leeks 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308242dc4b928197f3bc","name":"Orzo","type":"orzo","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Orzo","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"66ab6339f66002bbd100b304","name":"Diced Chorizo","type":"chorizo-diced","family":"none","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced Chorizo","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5aba35df7918d5096b2f","name":"Cajun Spice Mix","type":"cajun-style-spice","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cajun Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60002d898c8c0a188200a96d","name":"Chicken Stock Paste","type":"chicken-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chicken Stock Paste","marketLabel":"chicken stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308142dc4b928197f3b3","name":"Crispy Onions","type":"crispy-onions","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Crispy Onions","marketLabel":"crispy onions 75g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a full kettle for the orzo. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Trim the root and dark green leafy part from the leek and discard. Halve lengthways, then thinly slice.","Pour the boiled water into a large saucepan with ½ tsp salt on high heat. Add the orzo to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 10 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the chorizo and leek. Fry until the leek is softened, 5-6 mins. Lower the heat, then stir in the garlic, tomato puree and Cajun spice mix (add less if you'd prefer things milder). Cook until fragrant, 1 min.","Add the chicken stock paste, honey and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) to the chorizo. Stir to combine and bring to the boil. Simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins.","Once the sauce has thickened, add the peas and simmer until piping hot, 1 min. Stir through the cooked orzo and creme fraiche. Bring to the boil, then remove from the heat. Stir through the cheese until melted. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed.","Share the creamy Cajun chorizo orzo between your serving bowls. Sprinkle over the crispy onions to finish. Scrub Daddy's Top Are you a winner after dinner? Spin the sponge to find out who gets to wash up."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5/step-d749f200.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5/step-c3a36f10.jpg","caption":"Boil the Orzo"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5/step-1c61d920.jpg","caption":"Chorizo Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5/step-6bcea930.jpg","caption":"Sauce Things Up"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5/step-53b34740.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5/step-f883bd50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-cajun-spiced-chorizo-and-leek-orzo-69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-cajun-spiced-chorizo-and-leek-orzo-69b19c3ee5990988b41b38e5","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Leek"],["180 g","Orzo"],["60 g","Diced Chorizo"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chickpea-avocado-sandwiches","sourceId":"69a86480540e60f740c54f9c","title":"Fragrant Ginger Beef Noodle Stir-Fry","subtitle":"with Carrot, Green Beans and Spring Onion","time":30,"cost":13.86,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["high protein","calorie smart","south/southeastasian","noodle-stir-fry","healthy options","indonesian","beef","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Pan","Sieve","Large Saucepan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R27_W22_UK_L20546-3_Main_high-550210f5.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fragrant-ginger-beef-noodle-stir-fry-69a86480540e60f740c54f9c","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Carrot"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Spring Onion"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["15 g","Ginger Puree"],["40 g","Ketjap Manis"],["15 g","Honey"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Carrot"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Spring Onion"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["15 g","Ginger Puree"],["40 g","Ketjap Manis"],["15 g","Honey"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a5f284dab71a6058b4567","name":"Carrot","type":"carrot","family":"carrot","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Carrot","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555080c2f8b25e4d4c8b4568","name":"Green Beans","type":"green beans","family":"beans","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Green Beans","marketLabel":"green beans 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6684fd2cb9ba598b4567","name":"Spring Onion","type":"spring onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Spring Onion","marketLabel":"spring onions bunch","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c1c67fd2cb99f468b4567","name":"British Beef Mince","type":"beef mince","family":"beef","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Beef Mince","marketLabel":"5% fat beef mince 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373080f7d5496ac4a65cdc","name":"Egg Noodle Nest","type":"egg-noodle-nest","family":"other noodle","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Egg Noodle Nest","marketLabel":"egg noodles 4 nests","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59f334f92c3e085ecd21b7f2","name":"Ginger Puree","type":"ginger-puree","family":"ginger","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ginger Puree","marketLabel":"fresh ginger 100g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"574eff80f8b25eab0d8b4567","name":"Ketjap Manis","type":"ketjap-manis","family":"sauce","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ketjap Manis","marketLabel":"Asian cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"20 ml","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5fe8f8b25e1e268b4579","name":"Chilli Flakes","type":"chilli flakes","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chilli Flakes","marketLabel":"chilli flakes 45g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Trim the carrot, then halve lengthways (no need to peel). Thinly slice widthways into pieces about ½ cm thick. Trim the green beans, then cut into thirds. Trim and thinly slice the spring onion. Set aside to garnish later.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. Once hot, add the beef mince, carrot and green beans. Fry until the mince has browned, 5-6 mins. Use a spoon to break up the mince as it cooks. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince.","While your mince is frying, bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the noodles. When boiling, add the noodles to the water and cook until tender, 4 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and run under cold water to stop them sticking together.","When the mince has browned, drain and discard any excess fat. Season with salt and pepper. The mince is cooked when no longer pink in the middle. Next, add the ginger puree and fry until fragrant, 1 min more. Stir in the ketjap manis, honey, soy sauce and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). If the measured honey is very thick, warm it briefly so it pours easily. Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat and simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins.","Once thickened, stir the cooked noodles into the sauce. Add a splash of water if you feel it needs it.","Share the noodles between your serving bowls. Sprinkle over the spring onion and chilli flakes (add less if you'd prefer things milder) to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86480540e60f740c54f9c/step-d753f600.jpg","caption":"Prep the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86480540e60f740c54f9c/step-31a52e10.jpg","caption":"Get Frying"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86480540e60f740c54f9c/step-38dd3920.jpg","caption":"Boil the Noodles"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86480540e60f740c54f9c/step-0ea19f30.jpg","caption":"Add the Flavour"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86480540e60f740c54f9c/step-2e52ff40.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86480540e60f740c54f9c/step-43795a50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fragrant-ginger-beef-noodle-stir-fry-69a86480540e60f740c54f9c","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fragrant-ginger-beef-noodle-stir-fry-69a86480540e60f740c54f9c","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Carrot"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Spring Onion"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["15 g","Ginger Puree"],["40 g","Ketjap Manis"],["15 g","Honey"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chicken-mustard-sandwiches","sourceId":"69a864a3e566b4ce79013fdb","title":"Smoky Spiced King Prawn Spaghetti","subtitle":"with Asparagus, Peas and Italian Style Cheese","time":15,"cost":22.37,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["super quick","calorie smart","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","high protein","pescatarian","healthy options","italian","seafood","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Medium Saucepan","Kettle","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R15_W18_UK_UQ32011-4_Main_7_high-026e4472.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/smoky-spiced-king-prawn-spaghetti-69a864a3e566b4ce79013fdb","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["180 g","Spaghetti"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["26 g","Smoky Base Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["10 g","Butter"],["as needed","olive oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["180 g","Spaghetti"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["26 g","Smoky Base Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["10 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a58da4dab71d76f8b4573","name":"Asparagus","type":"asparagus-bundles","family":"asparagus","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Asparagus","marketLabel":"fresh vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373082f7d5496ac4a65cf3","name":"Spaghetti","type":"spaghetti (wheat)","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Spaghetti","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55672166f8b25e412f8b4567","name":"Tomato Passata","type":"tomato passata","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Passata","marketLabel":"passata 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59ad32ea2c3e08228606b422","name":"Central American Style Spice Mix","type":"central-american-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Central American Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6489bd550635a1e9befbb46e","name":"Smoky Base Paste","type":"smokey-base-paste","family":"none","amount":"26 g","sourceAmount":26,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Smoky Base Paste","marketLabel":"cooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a full kettle. Meanwhile, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Trim the asparagus and cut into thirds. Pour the boiled water into a saucepan with ½ tsp salt on high heat. Boil the spaghetti, 8 mins. Add the asparagus to the spaghetti in the last 2-3 mins. Once cooked, drain and return to the pan. Drizzle over some olive oil.","While the pasta cooks, drain the prawns. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw prawns. Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, fry the prawns, 2-3 mins. Add the garlic. Fry, another 30 secs.","Stir in the passata, Central American style spice mix, veg stock paste, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, reduce the heat. Simmer, 3-4 mins. Stir in the smoky base paste, peas and butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Cook, 2-3 mins. Cook so the prawns are opaque in the middle. Remove from the heat, stir in the cheese and season with salt and pepper.","Toss the spaghetti and asparagus in the sauce. Add a splash more water if needed. Share between your serving bowls."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864a3e566b4ce79013fdb/step-13f39b00.jpg","caption":"Pasta On"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864a3e566b4ce79013fdb/step-c2165f10.jpg","caption":"Fry Prawns"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864a3e566b4ce79013fdb/step-3e613920.jpg","caption":"Sauce Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864a3e566b4ce79013fdb/step-38afba30.jpg","caption":"Dinner's Ready!"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/smoky-spiced-king-prawn-spaghetti-69a864a3e566b4ce79013fdb","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/smoky-spiced-king-prawn-spaghetti-69a864a3e566b4ce79013fdb","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["180 g","Spaghetti"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["26 g","Smoky Base Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["10 g","Butter"],["as needed","olive oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"cheese-tomato-sandwiches","sourceId":"69a864b9e566b4ce79014004","title":"Peri Peri Chicken Breast and Aioli Ciabatta Sandwich","subtitle":"with Spiced Fries, Apple and Baby Gem Salad","time":25,"cost":22.14,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","high protein","august-bank-hol","new","portuguese","poultry","handheld","sandwich"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Bowl","Cling Film","Rolling Pin","Baking Paper","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R18_W19_UK_QR54014-3_main_QR54014-SP-1-3_var_high-9902249f.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/peri-peri-chicken-breast-and-aioli-ciabatta-sandwich-69a864b9e566b4ce79014004","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1 sachet","Peri Peri Seasoning"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["1 sachet","Dried Oregano"],["1","Apple"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["2","Ciabatta"],["50 g","Aioli"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1 sachet","Peri Peri Seasoning"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["1 sachet","Dried Oregano"],["1","Apple"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["2","Ciabatta"],["50 g","Aioli"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Honey"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837ac5df7d5496ac4a6831f","name":"Peri Peri Seasoning","type":"peri-peri-seasoning","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peri Peri Seasoning","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e56f8b25ed7288b4576","name":"British Chicken Breasts","type":"chicken-fillet","family":"chicken","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Chicken Breasts","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550da144dab718e128b456e","name":"Dried Oregano","type":"dried oregano","family":"oregano","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Dried Oregano","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c34ebf8b25eb9658b4567","name":"Apple","type":"apple","family":"apple","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Apple","marketLabel":"crisp apples x6","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68ecc674fa624b85e8848c26","name":"Baby Gem Lettuce","type":"baby gem lettuce","family":"salad mix","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Gem Lettuce","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"15 ml","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68a44d3d7e1f6c64ca674b57","name":"Aioli","type":"aioli","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Aioli","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 240°C/220°C fan/gas mark 9. Chop the potatoes lengthways into 1cm slices, then chop into 1cm wide chips (no need to peel). Pop the potatoes into a microwave-safe bowl and add a splash of cold water. Cover the bowl tightly with cling film, then microwave on high until tender, 5 mins. Once cooked, drain away any excess water from the bowl and allow to steam dry, 1 min.","Pop the chips onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with a generous amount of oil and season with salt and pepper. Sprinkle over half the peri peri seasoning, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, bake on the top shelf until golden, 16-18 mins. Turn halfway through. Alternatively, if you don't have a microwave, you can bake the chips without microwaving for 25-30 mins. Turn halfway through. Sandwich each chicken breast between two pieces of baking paper or cling film. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Pop onto a board, then give it a bash with a rolling pin or the bottom of a saucepan until it’s 2-3cm thick. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken.","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, lay in the chicken, turn the heat down to medium and cook until golden brown, 7-8 mins each side. The chicken is cooked when no longer pink in the middle. Add the remaining peri peri seasoning and dried oregano to the chicken for the last min of frying.","Meanwhile, quarter, core and thinly slice the apple (no need to peel). Trim the baby gem, separate the leaves, then tear into bite-sized pieces.","In a large bowl, combine the cider vinegar with the sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Add the torn baby gem to the dressing and toss. Next, halve the ciabatta. If you're using the toaster, toast the ciabatta in your toaster until golden. If you're using the oven, pop them into the oven to warm through, 2-3 mins.","When the chicken has cooked, drizzle over the honey (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and turn to coat. Transfer the toasted ciabatta to your serving plates, top with a handful of the baby gem and the peri peri chicken breasts. Dollop on the aioli, then sandwich close. Add the apple to the remaining baby gem and toss together. Serve the peri peri chips and apple salad alongside."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864b9e566b4ce79014004/step-2ac6b000.jpg","caption":"Start the Chips"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864b9e566b4ce79014004/step-49596010.jpg","caption":"Bake the Chips"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864b9e566b4ce79014004/step-535b3d20.jpg","caption":"Get Frying"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864b9e566b4ce79014004/step-9c9c4f30.jpg","caption":"Prep the Salad"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864b9e566b4ce79014004/step-522c6f40.jpg","caption":"Final Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a864b9e566b4ce79014004/step-d5fce950.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/peri-peri-chicken-breast-and-aioli-ciabatta-sandwich-69a864b9e566b4ce79014004","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/peri-peri-chicken-breast-and-aioli-ciabatta-sandwich-69a864b9e566b4ce79014004","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"sandwich","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1 sachet","Peri Peri Seasoning"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["1 sachet","Dried Oregano"],["1","Apple"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["2","Ciabatta"],["50 g","Aioli"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chicken-fajita-wraps-lunch","sourceId":"699f293156e1348f7ad80602","title":"Ham Tortelloni and Bacon in Creamy Garlic Sauce","subtitle":"with Green Beans, Peas and Garlic Ciabatta","time":20,"cost":19.43,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","italian","pork","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Garlic Press","Large Frying Pan","Kettle","Colander","Large Saucepan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R39_W18_UK_QV17193-14_main_high-98c76233.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/ham-tortelloni-and-bacon-in-creamy-garlic-sauce-699f293156e1348f7ad80602","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["160 g","Green Beans"],["3","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["300 g","Cured Ham Tortelloni"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["30 g","Butter"],["as needed","olive oil"]],"sourceIngredients":[["160 g","Green Beans"],["3","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["300 g","Cured Ham Tortelloni"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["30 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"555080c2f8b25e4d4c8b4568","name":"Green Beans","type":"green beans","family":"beans","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Green Beans","marketLabel":"green beans 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"3","sourceAmount":3,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60002d898c8c0a188200a96d","name":"Chicken Stock Paste","type":"chicken-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chicken Stock Paste","marketLabel":"chicken stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68ae57659bc786cb212c7f55","name":"Cured Ham Tortelloni","type":"cured-ham-tortelloni","family":"none","amount":"300 g","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cured Ham Tortelloni","marketLabel":"prepared pasta or pastry equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5fe8f8b25e1e268b4579","name":"Chilli Flakes","type":"chilli flakes","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chilli Flakes","marketLabel":"chilli flakes 45g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6061f8b25ed7288b4577","name":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","type":"pancetta","family":"pork","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Trim the green beans, then cut into thirds. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the ciabatta and lay onto a baking tray, cut-side up. Spread over half the garlic and drizzle with the olive oil for the garlic bread (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Set aside for later.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the bacon lardons. Stir-fry until golden, 4-5 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw meat. Cook bacon thoroughly. Next, add the remaining garlic and fry for 30 secs. Stir in the chicken stock paste and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then lower the heat and simmer for 1-2 mins. Stir in the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) until melted. Simmer until thickened, 2-3 mins.","Meanwhile, boil a full kettle. Pour the boiled water into a saucepan with ½ tsp salt and bring back to the boil. Add the pasta and green beans. Cook until tender, 3-4 mins. Once cooked, carefully drain in a colander. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Preheat your grill to high. Grill the ciabatta until golden, 5-6 mins. Once grilled, cut the ciabatta halves diagonally.","Once the sauce has thickened, stir in the creme fraiche and cook for 1-2 mins. Add the cooked pasta, green beans, peas and hard Italian style cheese to the pan. Gently stir to melt the cheese and combine everything together.","Share your creamy garlic butter pasta between your serving plates. Sprinkle over the chilli flakes. Serve with your garlic bread alongside."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293156e1348f7ad80602/step-24225300.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293156e1348f7ad80602/step-57705110.jpg","caption":"Garlic Butter Sauce Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293156e1348f7ad80602/step-18273b20.jpg","caption":"Cook the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293156e1348f7ad80602/step-81edc430.jpg","caption":"Toast your Ciabatta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293156e1348f7ad80602/step-a5ab4f40.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293156e1348f7ad80602/step-23c89550.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/ham-tortelloni-and-bacon-in-creamy-garlic-sauce-699f293156e1348f7ad80602","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/ham-tortelloni-and-bacon-in-creamy-garlic-sauce-699f293156e1348f7ad80602","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["160 g","Green Beans"],["3","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["300 g","Cured Ham Tortelloni"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["30 g","Butter"],["as needed","olive oil"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"tuna-sweetcorn-wraps","sourceId":"69a86445540e60f740c54ebd","title":"Moroccan Style Beef and Couscous","subtitle":"with Spinach, Pepper and Toasted Almonds","time":20,"cost":24.76,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","medium spice","high protein","taste of middle east","soup-stew","middle eastern","beef","salad","grain"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Lid","Large Saucepan","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R19_W26_UK_QR1765-24_Main_high-772d4a22.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/moroccan-style-beef-and-couscous-69a86445540e60f740c54ebd","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["20 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["120 g","Couscous"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["50 g","Harissa Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["15 g","Toasted Flaked Almonds"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["20 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["120 g","Couscous"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["50 g","Harissa Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["15 g","Toasted Flaked Almonds"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"60002d898c8c0a188200a96d","name":"Chicken Stock Paste","type":"chicken-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chicken Stock Paste","marketLabel":"chicken stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837302fd9848b9dac04ffc1","name":"Couscous","type":"couscous-duplicate","family":"grains","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Couscous","marketLabel":"couscous 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c1c67fd2cb99f468b4567","name":"British Beef Mince","type":"beef mince","family":"beef","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Beef Mince","marketLabel":"5% fat beef mince 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"566af3d3f8b25e717b8b4567","name":"Chermoula Spice Mix","type":"chermoula-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chermoula Spice Mix","marketLabel":"chermoula seasoning","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55672166f8b25e412f8b4567","name":"Tomato Passata","type":"tomato passata","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Passata","marketLabel":"passata 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c80fdf8b25e246c8b4567","name":"Harissa Paste","type":"rose-harissa-paste","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Harissa Paste","marketLabel":"harissa paste 130g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69bd7a5414877becd77f49eb","name":"Toasted Flaked Almonds","type":"toasted-flaked-almonds","family":"none","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Toasted Flaked Almonds","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb1e3688281450b8bd066","name":"Water for the Couscous","type":"water-for-the-couscous-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Couscous","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"50 ml","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Pour the water for the couscous (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and half the chicken stock paste into a saucepan, then bring to the boil. When boiling, remove from the heat, stir in the couscous and pop a lid on the pan. Leave to the side for 8-10 mins or until ready to serve.","Meanwhile, halve, peel and thinly slice the red onion. Halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Slice into thin strips. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the beef mince, pepper and onion. Fry until browned, 5-6 mins. Use a spoon to break up the mince as it cooks, then drain and discard any excess fat. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Once the beef is browned, add chermoula spice mix (add less if you'd prefer things milder) and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Add the remaining chicken stock paste, tomato passata, harissa paste (add less if you'd prefer things milder), honey and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Stir to combine and bring to the boil.","Lower the heat of the beef pan to medium and simmer, stirring occasionally, until the sauce has thickened, 4-6 mins.","Once thickened, stir the spinach into the beef a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins. Stir in the peas.","When ready, fluff up the couscous with a fork. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed, then share between your bowls. Top with the beef and sprinkle over the toasted almonds to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86445540e60f740c54ebd/step-a817c700.jpg","caption":"Cook the Couscous"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86445540e60f740c54ebd/step-c850b610.jpg","caption":"Fry the Beef"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86445540e60f740c54ebd/step-9fe77020.jpg","caption":"Bring on the Flavour"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86445540e60f740c54ebd/step-2c786e30.jpg","caption":"Simmer your Beef"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86445540e60f740c54ebd/step-1a6c8440.jpg","caption":"Add the Spinach"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69a86445540e60f740c54ebd/step-a242b850.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/moroccan-style-beef-and-couscous-69a86445540e60f740c54ebd","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/moroccan-style-beef-and-couscous-69a86445540e60f740c54ebd","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"grain","shoppingIngredients":[["20 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["120 g","Couscous"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["50 g","Harissa Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["15 g","Toasted Flaked Almonds"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"halloumi-pepper-wraps","sourceId":"699f295d867683566cfd0604","title":"Apple, Blue Cheese and Walnut Market Salad","subtitle":"with Avocado and Smashed Potatoes","time":45,"cost":15.25,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","regional-specialty","dinner-bowls","calorie smart","british","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Pan","Lid","Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R29_W31_UK_V23440-3_Main_high-d8106a48.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/apple-blue-cheese-and-walnut-market-salad-699f295d867683566cfd0604","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["350 g","Salad Potatoes"],["1","Ciabatta"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Avocado"],["1","Apple"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["10 g","Wholegrain Mustard"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["30 g","Crumbled Blue Cheese"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"],["30 ml","water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["350 g","Salad Potatoes"],["1","Ciabatta"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Avocado"],["1","Apple"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["10 g","Wholegrain Mustard"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["30 g","Crumbled Blue Cheese"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5dbc6e87b96bdd752017bc59","name":"Salad Potatoes","type":"salad-potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"350 g","sourceAmount":350,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salad Potatoes","marketLabel":"baby potatoes 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555080c2f8b25e4d4c8b4568","name":"Green Beans","type":"green beans","family":"beans","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Green Beans","marketLabel":"green beans 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550e278f8b25e56468b456f","name":"Avocado","type":"avocado","family":"avocado","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Avocado","marketLabel":"avocado each","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c34ebf8b25eb9658b4567","name":"Apple","type":"apple","family":"apple","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Apple","marketLabel":"crisp apples x6","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"30 ml","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c147a4dab71ac398b4567","name":"Wholegrain Mustard","type":"wholegrain mustard","family":"mustard","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wholegrain Mustard","marketLabel":"mustard 185g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69c3ef52d795c2c9e4004975","name":"Walnuts","type":"walnuts","family":"nut mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Walnuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5d36e205d6292e000a2f1a0d","name":"Crumbled Blue Cheese","type":"blue-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Crumbled Blue Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":1.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Halve the salad potatoes widthways (halve any large ones again). Put the potatoes onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer, cut-side down. When the oven is hot, roast the potatoes on the top shelf, 20 mins.","Meanwhile, tear the ciabatta into roughly 2cm chunks. Pop the ciabatta onto another medium baking tray in a single layer. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat well. Bake the croutons on the middle shelf of your oven until golden, 8-10 mins. Once golden, remove from the oven and set aside.","While everything's in the oven, trim and halve the green beans. Halve the avocado and remove the stone. Use a tablespoon to scoop the flesh out onto a board. Cut into 1cm chunks. Quarter, core and thinly slice the apple lengthways (no need to peel).","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the green beans and stir-fry until starting to char, 2-3 mins. Turn the heat down to medium, add a splash of water and immediately cover with a lid or some foil. Cook until the beans are tender, 4-5 mins. Remove the pan from the heat and set aside.","In a large bowl, combine the cider vinegar, wholegrain mustard, honey and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper, then set the dressing aside. When the potatoes have cooked for 20 mins, remove them from the oven. Use the bottom of a bowl or pan to lightly crush each potato half. Drizzle the smashed potatoes with more oil and return to the top shelf until crispy and golden, 10-15 mins.","Once everything's ready, add the baby leaves, apple slices, avocado, green beans, smashed potatoes and croutons to the bowl of dressing and toss together. Share the salad out between your bowls. Scatter over the walnuts and blue cheese to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295d867683566cfd0604/step-7066ee00.jpg","caption":"Roast the Potatoes"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295d867683566cfd0604/step-42206f10.jpg","caption":"Make the Croutons"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295d867683566cfd0604/step-49ba9a20.jpg","caption":"Finish your Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295d867683566cfd0604/step-9e467930.jpg","caption":"Char-Steam the Beans"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295d867683566cfd0604/step-5c6ad540.jpg","caption":"Time to Get Dressed"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295d867683566cfd0604/step-303d2750.jpg","caption":"Assemble and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/apple-blue-cheese-and-walnut-market-salad-699f295d867683566cfd0604","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/apple-blue-cheese-and-walnut-market-salad-699f295d867683566cfd0604","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["350 g","Salad Potatoes"],["1","Ciabatta"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Avocado"],["1","Apple"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["10 g","Wholegrain Mustard"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["30 g","Crumbled Blue Cheese"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"],["30 ml","water"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chickpea-tahini-wraps","sourceId":"699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf","title":"Guinness® Caramelised Onion & Three Cheese Toastie","subtitle":"with Fresh Apple Salad and Wedges","time":35,"cost":22.51,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","british","handheld","cook","sandwich"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Bowl","Grater","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R19_W08_UK_V51436-3_Main_high-5725716e.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/guinness-r-caramelised-onion-and-three-cheese-toastie-699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["60 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["30 g","Red Leicester"],["1","Apple"],["2","Ciabatta"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["50 g","Cream Cheese"],["40 g","Guinness® Paste"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["0.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Onions"],["1.5 tbsp","Water"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["60 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["30 g","Red Leicester"],["1","Apple"],["2","Ciabatta"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["50 g","Cream Cheese"],["40 g","Guinness® Paste"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["0.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Onions"],["1.5 tbsp","Water"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69e603b0b2918f341e7a65b8","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60070bcc351ada1981143062","name":"Red Leicester","type":"red-leicester","family":"hard cheese","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Leicester","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c34ebf8b25eb9658b4567","name":"Apple","type":"apple","family":"apple","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Apple","marketLabel":"crisp apples x6","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"15 ml","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c54314dab71733f8b4567","name":"Cream Cheese","type":"cream-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cream Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69297a8d01ae5540a928936d","name":"Guinness® Paste","type":"guinness-paste","family":"none","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Guinness® Paste","marketLabel":"beef cooking concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"0.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"610d5147a6d0dbd6f1c32b40","name":"Sugar for the Onions","type":"sugar-for-the-onions-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Onions","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60265b61b28900118860eb0f","name":"Water","type":"water-1-tbsp","family":"other drink","amount":"1.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":1.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potatoes into 2cm wide wedges (no need to peel). Pop the wedges onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf until golden, 25-35 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, halve, peel and thinly slice the red onion. Grate the Cheddar and Red Leicester cheeses. Quarter, core and slice the apple (no need to peel). Halve the ciabattas. In a large bowl, combine the cider vinegar, sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Add the apple, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Set aside for later.","In a medium bowl, combine the cream cheese, grated Cheddar and Red Leicester cheeses. Season with pepper and mix until combined into a thick paste. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-low heat. Once hot, add the onion, season with salt and pepper and fry, stirring occasionally, until golden, 10-12 mins. Once golden, add the Guinness® paste, sugar and water for the onions (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and cook until thick and glossy, 1-2 mins more. Once glossy, pop the onion into a small bowl and set aside for later.","Spread the cheese mixture onto the base of each ciabatta, leaving a small border around the edge to prevent it from spilling out when pressed. Top with Guinness® caramelised onion. Sandwich shut with the ciabatta lids and press down firmly so the filling sticks together.","Give the (now empty) frying pan a quick clean, then add a drizzle of oil and return to medium-high heat. Once hot, add the sandwiches, pressing down with a spatula or a heavy-bottomed pan. Cook, pressing occasionally, until the bread is golden and toasted and the cheeses have melted, 3-4 mins per side.","When everything's ready, add the rocket to the apple bowl and toss to coat. Don't add the leaves too early or they'll go soggy! Carefully halve the toasties diagonally and share between serving plates. Serve the wedges and salad alongside."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf/step-34b24000.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf/step-b63a6410.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf/step-b99cad20.jpg","caption":"Caramelise the Onion"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf/step-81d94530.jpg","caption":"Get Cheesy"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf/step-8d7a1540.jpg","caption":"Toastie Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf/step-d91aa850.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/guinness-r-caramelised-onion-and-three-cheese-toastie-699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/guinness-r-caramelised-onion-and-three-cheese-toastie-699ef8014cb45e275aef6bcf","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"sandwich","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["60 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["30 g","Red Leicester"],["1","Apple"],["2","Ciabatta"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["50 g","Cream Cheese"],["40 g","Guinness® Paste"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["0.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Onions"],["1.5 tbsp","Water"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"teriyaki-tofu-wraps","sourceId":"699f295ee7bff1dd159be086","title":"Spicy Meat-Free Mince Chipotle Chilli Rice Bowl","subtitle":"with Bell Pepper, Tomato and Cheddar","time":30,"cost":21.99,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","very hot","latin-american-faves","dinner-bowls","latin american","rice","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Medium Saucepan","Lid","Sieve","Garlic Press","Pan","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R19_W46_UK_V43426-6_Main_R51_V43426-8_var_high-1cdd635d.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spicy-meat-free-mince-chipotle-chilli-rice-bowl-699f295ee7bff1dd159be086","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1 carton","Red Kidney Beans"],["150 g","Vegan Mince"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["20 g","Chipotle Paste"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["1","Intense™ Tomato"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["10 g","Butter"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1 carton","Red Kidney Beans"],["150 g","Vegan Mince"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["20 g","Chipotle Paste"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["1","Intense™ Tomato"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["10 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"55508011fd2cb96c628b456c","name":"Basmati Rice","type":"basmati rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basmati Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55508469fd2cb974658b4567","name":"Red Kidney Beans","type":"organic red kidney beans","family":"beans","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Kidney Beans","marketLabel":"beans equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"67fccaefa3ffaf7fe874d432","name":"Vegan Mince","type":"vegan-mince","family":"none","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegan Mince","marketLabel":"plant protein equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c89afa8e1c4145a37bc75f","name":"Mexican Style Spice Mix","type":"mexican-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mexican Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a70affd2cb95a598b456f","name":"Chipotle Paste","type":"chipotle paste","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chipotle Paste","marketLabel":"cooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55672166f8b25e412f8b4567","name":"Tomato Passata","type":"tomato passata","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Passata","marketLabel":"passata 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6964d09de6255ccadc13bd52","name":"Intense™ Tomato","type":"tomato-intense","family":"none","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Intense™ Tomato","marketLabel":"tomato cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69e602c74af8f3547a6539f1","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"57bec7a892eec9ca688b4568","name":"Water for the Rice","type":"water-for-the-rice-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"300 ml","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Rice","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Pour the water for the rice (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) into a medium saucepan with a tight-fitting lid. Stir in the rice and ¼ tsp salt and bring to the boil. Once boiling, turn the heat down to medium and cover with the lid. Leave to cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from the heat (still covered) and leave to the side for another 10 mins or until ready to serve (the rice will continue to cook in its own steam).","Meanwhile, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Slice into thin strips. Drain and rinse the kidney beans in a sieve.","Heat a large frying pan on medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. Once hot, add the meat-free mince and bell pepper to the pan. Use a spoon to break up the mince as it cooks. Cook until browned, 5-6 mins. Season with salt and pepper. Ensure the meat-free mince is piping hot throughout.","Stir in the garlic, Mexican style spice mix and chipotle paste (add less if you'd prefer things milder). Fry until fragrant, 30 secs. Add in the passata, veg stock paste, drained kidney beans, honey and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then lower the heat and simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins.","Meanwhile, cut the Intense™ tomato into 1cm chunks. Grate the Cheddar cheese. Once the chilli is ready, season with salt and pepper, stir in the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients), then remove from the heat.","Fluff up the rice and share between serving bowls. Top with the meat-free chilli. Spoon over the tomato chunks and sprinkle over the Cheddar to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295ee7bff1dd159be086/step-f8b66f00.jpg","caption":"Cook the Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295ee7bff1dd159be086/step-34c86810.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295ee7bff1dd159be086/step-d23f1420.jpg","caption":"Fry Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295ee7bff1dd159be086/step-7ad76930.jpg","caption":"Simmer Simmer"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295ee7bff1dd159be086/step-5be48440.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f295ee7bff1dd159be086/step-6c8f3c50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spicy-meat-free-mince-chipotle-chilli-rice-bowl-699f295ee7bff1dd159be086","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spicy-meat-free-mince-chipotle-chilli-rice-bowl-699f295ee7bff1dd159be086","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1 carton","Red Kidney Beans"],["150 g","Vegan Mince"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["20 g","Chipotle Paste"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["1","Intense™ Tomato"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["10 g","Butter"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"egg-spinach-wraps","sourceId":"699f2944867683566cfd05e8","title":"Family Favourite Chicken Tonkatsu Rice Bowl","subtitle":"For Adults: Add Pickled Veg Salad, Katsu Style Mayo and Ketjap Drizzle","time":25,"cost":27.37,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family","quick","egg(s) not included","family friendly","new","japanese","poultry","rice"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Kettle","Bowl","Rolling Pin","Baking Paper","Pan","Sieve","Lid","Large Saucepan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R08_W18_UK_F54561-4_edit_color_main_high-2ce6f296.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/family-favourite-chicken-tonkatsu-rice-bowl-699f2944867683566cfd05e8","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Sweet Potato"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["50 g","Breadcrumbs"],["150 g","Jasmine Rice"],["1","Avocado"],["22.5 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["20 ml","Sesame Oil"],["25 g","Korma Curry Paste"],["64 g","Mayonnaise"],["20 g","Ketjap Manis"],["1","Egg for Binding"],["0.25 tsp","Salt for the Breadcrumbs"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Sweet Potato"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["50 g","Breadcrumbs"],["150 g","Jasmine Rice"],["1","Avocado"],["22.5 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["20 ml","Sesame Oil"],["25 g","Korma Curry Paste"],["64 g","Mayonnaise"],["20 g","Ketjap Manis"],["1","Egg for Binding"],["0.25 tsp","Salt for the Breadcrumbs"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Honey"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"555082a2f8b25e56468b4568","name":"Sweet Potato","type":"sweet potato","family":"potato","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweet Potato","marketLabel":"sweet potatoes 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e56f8b25ed7288b4576","name":"British Chicken Breasts","type":"chicken-fillet","family":"chicken","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Chicken Breasts","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e2f42dc4b928197f136","name":"Breadcrumbs","type":"breadcrumbs","family":"breadcrumbs","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Breadcrumbs","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59b020d9c2880076673eb222","name":"Jasmine Rice","type":"jasmine-rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Jasmine Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550e278f8b25e56468b456f","name":"Avocado","type":"avocado","family":"avocado","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Avocado","marketLabel":"avocado each","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a68fa4dab71aa058b4568","name":"Rice Vinegar","type":"rice vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"22.5 ml","sourceAmount":22.5,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Rice Vinegar","marketLabel":"cooking vinegar equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6923f8b25ef53e8b4567","name":"Sesame Oil","type":"sesame oil","family":"oil","amount":"20 ml","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sesame Oil","marketLabel":"sesame oil 250ml","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5de10b3aa28b1766010e3f86","name":"Korma Curry Paste","type":"korma-curry-paste","family":"spice blend","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Korma Curry Paste","marketLabel":"curry paste jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9d234dab7162138b4568","name":"Mayonnaise","type":"mayonnaise-tbsp","family":"mayonnaise","amount":"64 g","sourceAmount":64,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mayonnaise","marketLabel":"mayonnaise 500ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"574eff80f8b25eab0d8b4567","name":"Ketjap Manis","type":"ketjap-manis","family":"sauce","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ketjap Manis","marketLabel":"Asian cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69c1e12ad795c2c9e4ffb757","name":"Egg for Binding","type":"egg-for-binding","family":"egg","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Egg for Binding","marketLabel":"medium eggs x12","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"627c173e7497c13c5c9b98a0","name":"Salt for the Breadcrumbs","type":"salt-for-the-breadcrumbs","family":"single spice","amount":"0.25 tsp","sourceAmount":0.25,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Salt for the Breadcrumbs","marketLabel":"table salt 750g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the sweet potato into 1cm chunks (no need to peel). Pop the sweet potato onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the middle shelf until golden and tender, 18-20 mins. Turn halfway through. Meanwhile, boil a half-full kettle.","Sandwich each chicken breast between two pieces of baking paper or cling film. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Pop onto a board, then give them a bash with a rolling pin or the bottom of a saucepan until they're 1-2 cm thick. Crack the egg (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) into a bowl and whisk. Put the breadcrumbs into another bowl, season with the salt (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and pepper. Dip the chicken into the egg and then the breadcrumbs, ensuring it's completely coated. Transfer to a clean plate and set aside for now. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken and discard any excess egg.","Pop a large frying pan on high heat and add enough oil to completely coat the bottom of the pan. You want the oil to be hot so the chicken fries properly - heat for 2-3 mins before you add the chicken. Once hot, carefully lay the chicken into the pan, reduce the heat to medium-high and fry until golden brown and cooked through, 8-10 mins total. Turn every 2-3 mins and adjust the heat if necessary. The chicken is cooked when no longer pink in the middle. Once cooked, transfer the chicken to a plate lined with kitchen paper.","Meanwhile, pour the boiled water into a large saucepan with ¼ tsp salt on high heat. Add the rice and cook for 12-13 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and pop back in the pan. Cover with a lid and leave to the side until ready to serve. While everything cooks, halve the avocado and remove the stone. Use a tablespoon to scoop the flesh out onto a board. Cut into 1cm chunks.","In a medium bowl, mix together the rice vinegar, sesame oil and sugar for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Make kid friendly: For adults, add your portion of avo to the dressing and toss together. For the kids, either leave the avo undressed or add to the dressing if they'd like it too! In a small bowl, mix together the korma curry paste (use the amount listed in the ingredients), mayo and honey (use the quantities listed in the ingredients).","When everything's ready, slice your chicken widthways into 1cm thick slices. Build your own: Bring everything to the table and everyone can add the ingredients they like best - jasmine rice, sweet potato chunks, avo, sliced chicken, curried mayo and ketjap drizzle."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2944867683566cfd05e8/step-a318b000.jpg","caption":"Roast the Sweet Potato"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2944867683566cfd05e8/step-0b95a610.jpg","caption":"Prep the Chicken"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2944867683566cfd05e8/step-807a0620.jpg","caption":"Get Frying"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2944867683566cfd05e8/step-576e4c30.jpg","caption":"Boil the Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2944867683566cfd05e8/step-bb03bd40.jpg","caption":"Add the Flavour"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2944867683566cfd05e8/step-bb9d5250.jpg","caption":"Build Your Own!"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/family-favourite-chicken-tonkatsu-rice-bowl-699f2944867683566cfd05e8","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/family-favourite-chicken-tonkatsu-rice-bowl-699f2944867683566cfd05e8","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Sweet Potato"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["50 g","Breadcrumbs"],["150 g","Jasmine Rice"],["1","Avocado"],["22.5 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["20 ml","Sesame Oil"],["25 g","Korma Curry Paste"],["64 g","Mayonnaise"],["20 g","Ketjap Manis"],["1","Egg for Binding"],["0.25 tsp","Salt for the Breadcrumbs"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"black-bean-salsa-wraps","sourceId":"699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e","title":"Creamy White Wine, Prawn and Chilli Spaghetti","subtitle":"with Italian Style Cheese, Leek and Peas","time":25,"cost":16.55,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","calorie smart","pescatarian","new","italian","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Grater","Kettle","Colander","Large Saucepan","Large Frying Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R41_W17_UK_QR54591-4_Main_high-894067cf.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-white-wine-prawn-and-chilli-spaghetti-699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Leek"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["180 g","Spaghetti"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Leek"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["180 g","Spaghetti"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a5e334dab71a9058b4567","name":"Leek","type":"leek","family":"leek","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Leek","marketLabel":"leeks 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373082f7d5496ac4a65cf3","name":"Spaghetti","type":"spaghetti (wheat)","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Spaghetti","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5fe8f8b25e1e268b4579","name":"Chilli Flakes","type":"chilli flakes","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chilli Flakes","marketLabel":"chilli flakes 45g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"691c9f53bc8059f9ea10a506","name":"White Wine Stock Powder","type":"white-wine-stock-powder","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"White Wine Stock Powder","marketLabel":"vegetable stock concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"150 ml","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a full kettle for the pasta. While it comes to the boil, trim the root and dark green leafy part from the leek and discard. Halve lengthways, then thinly slice. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press).","Pour the boiled water into a large saucepan with ½ tsp salt on high heat. Add the spaghetti and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 8 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","While the spaghetti cooks, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Drain the prawns. Once hot, add the leek to the pan and season with salt and pepper. Cook until the leek has softened, 5-6 mins. Stir occasionally. When the leek has 2-3 mins left, add the prawns to the pan and fry, 2-3mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw prawns.","Add the garlic, tomato puree and half the chilli flakes (add less if you'd prefer things milder) and fry for 30 secs. Stir in the water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and white wine stock powder. Bring to the boil, then lower the heat so the sauce simmers gently. Cook until the prawns are cooked through, 3-4 mins. The prawns are cooked when pink on the outside and opaque in the middle.","Once the prawns are cooked, stir in the creme fraiche, peas and Italian style cheese. Bring to the boil, then remove from the heat. Stir in the cooked spaghetti. Season with salt and pepper and add a splash of water if the sauce is a little too thick.","Share the prawn and chilli spaghetti out between your serving bowls. Sprinkle over the remaining chilli flakes, if you wish to."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e/step-cd27b900.jpg","caption":"Prep the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e/step-f3038010.jpg","caption":"Cook the Spaghetti"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e/step-637cd320.jpg","caption":"Time to Fry"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e/step-e5a6d630.jpg","caption":"Simmer the Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e/step-d95b7640.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e/step-f981b750.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-white-wine-prawn-and-chilli-spaghetti-699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-white-wine-prawn-and-chilli-spaghetti-699c6e19867683566cf8fc9e","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Leek"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["180 g","Spaghetti"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"red-lentil-tomato-soup-lunch","sourceId":"699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f","title":"Honey-Miso Green Beans and Sambal Corn Rice Bowl","subtitle":"with Avocado Slices, Crushed Peanuts and Sriracha Drizzle","time":25,"cost":21.02,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","medium spice","veggie","world-flavors","dinner-bowls","asian","rice"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Sieve","Garlic Press","Kettle","Lid","Bowl","Peeler","Baking Tray","Pan","Rolling Pin"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y24_R40_W34_UK_QV20259-7_MAIN_high-1ea9d4a7.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/honey-miso-tenderstem-r-and-sambal-corn-rice-bowl-699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["150 g","Jasmine Rice"],["1","Carrot"],["15 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["160 g","Green Beans"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["15 g","Miso Paste"],["15 g","Honey"],["15 g","Sambal Paste"],["1","Avocado"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["0.5 tbsp","Oil for Cooking"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["1 tbsp","Water for the Dressing"],["2 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["150 g","Jasmine Rice"],["1","Carrot"],["15 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["160 g","Green Beans"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["15 g","Miso Paste"],["15 g","Honey"],["15 g","Sambal Paste"],["1","Avocado"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["0.5 tbsp","Oil for Cooking"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["1 tbsp","Water for the Dressing"],["2 tbsp","Mayonnaise"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59b020d9c2880076673eb222","name":"Jasmine Rice","type":"jasmine-rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Jasmine Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5f284dab71a6058b4567","name":"Carrot","type":"carrot","family":"carrot","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Carrot","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a68fa4dab71aa058b4568","name":"Rice Vinegar","type":"rice vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"15 ml","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Rice Vinegar","marketLabel":"cooking vinegar equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555080c2f8b25e4d4c8b4568","name":"Green Beans","type":"green beans","family":"beans","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Green Beans","marketLabel":"green beans 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6de44dab71a6058b456a","name":"Sweetcorn","type":"sweetcorn","family":"corn","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweetcorn","marketLabel":"sweetcorn tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a63bffd2cb9ba4f8b4576","name":"Miso Paste","type":"miso-paste","family":"asian paste","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Miso Paste","marketLabel":"miso paste 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60accf96e728ee63dd0d01d2","name":"Sambal Paste","type":"sambal","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sambal Paste","marketLabel":"cooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550e278f8b25e56468b456f","name":"Avocado","type":"avocado","family":"avocado","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Avocado","marketLabel":"avocado each","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6877ced35a587f17f45951c6","name":"Salted Peanuts","type":"salted peanuts","family":"nut mix","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salted Peanuts","marketLabel":"table salt 750g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5c3f3eadc445fa4233599443","name":"Sriracha Sauce","type":"sriracha (anchovy)","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"16 ml","sourceAmount":16,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sriracha Sauce","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60f7ff6ae5a270ab7dbce1b7","name":"Oil for Cooking","type":"oil-for-cooking","family":"oil","amount":"0.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Oil for Cooking","marketLabel":"cooking oil","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e3416f081143769dd33ba49","name":"Sugar for the Pickle","type":"sugar-for-the-pickle-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Pickle","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6041fff60d3694c89afd756b","name":"Water for the Dressing","type":"water-for-the-dressing","family":"other drink","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Dressing","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbe487e8afb1b135f069bd2","name":"Mayonnaise","type":"mayonnaise-tbsp","family":"mayonnaise","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Mayonnaise","marketLabel":"mayonnaise 500ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Boil a half-full kettle. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Heat the oil (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) in a deep saucepan on medium heat. Once hot, add the garlic and fry for 1 min. Stir in the rice and cook until coated, 1 min. Add ¼ tsp salt and the boiled water and cook for 10-12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and pop back in the pan. Cover with a lid and leave to the side until ready to serve.","While the rice cooks, trim and peel the carrot. Use the peeler to peel long ribbons down the length of the carrot, stopping at the core. In a medium bowl, combine the rice vinegar and sugar for the pickle (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt, then add the carrot. Mix together well, then set aside to pickle. Trim the green beans. Drain the sweetcorn in a sieve.","Pop the green beans onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Roast on the middle shelf until tender and crispy, 10-12 mins. Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine the miso and honey with the water for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Set aside. If the measured honey is very thick, warm it briefly so it pours easily.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. Once hot, add the sweetcorn and cook until charred, 5-6 mins. Adjust the heat if necessary. Stir only twice during this time - you want the sweetcorn to pick up some nice colour. Once charred, add the sweetcorn to a small bowl. Stir in the sambal. Season with salt and pepper. Set aside.","Halve the avocado and remove the stone. Use a tablespoon to scoop the flesh out onto a board, face-down. Slice into 1cm thick slices. Crush the peanuts with a rolling pin or the base of a small saucepan. Once the green beans are cooked, add the honey-miso sauce to the beans and turn to coat. When the rice is cooked, stir through the pickling liquid from the carrot. Season with salt and pepper.","Share the rice between bowls. Top with the pickled carrot, sweetcorn and green beans in separate sections. Pour over the remaining sauce from the tray, then fan out the avocado in the centre. Drizzle mayonnaise (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) over the top and scatter on the peanuts. Finish with a drizzle of sriracha (add less if you'd prefer things milder)."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f/step-ff68e600.jpg","caption":"Cook the Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f/step-979c2310.jpg","caption":"Get Pickling"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f/step-ed7e3620.jpg","caption":"Roast the Beans"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f/step-e2517430.jpg","caption":"Time to Char"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f/step-4c672c40.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f/step-6bf1bf50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/honey-miso-tenderstem-r-and-sambal-corn-rice-bowl-699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/honey-miso-tenderstem-r-and-sambal-corn-rice-bowl-699f29bae7bff1dd159be17f","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["150 g","Jasmine Rice"],["1","Carrot"],["15 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["160 g","Green Beans"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["15 g","Miso Paste"],["15 g","Honey"],["15 g","Sambal Paste"],["1","Avocado"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["0.5 tbsp","Oil for Cooking"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["1 tbsp","Water for the Dressing"],["2 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"carrot-ginger-soup-lunch","sourceId":"699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f","title":"Fuss-Free Cheesy Pesto Chicken Breast Traybake","subtitle":"with Roasted Veg, Herby Potatoes and Balsamic Glaze","time":35,"cost":21.08,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","prepped in 10","high protein","mediterranean","sheet pan","calorie smart","healthy options","italian","poultry","other","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Medium Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y24_R45_W42_UK_R16281-4_Main_low-d87ad48b.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fuss-free-cheesy-pesto-chicken-breast-traybake-699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Red Onion"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Red Onion"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["1 tbsp","Honey"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"633c6597aa3f33c15c854bb0","name":"Mixed Herbs","type":"mixed-herbs","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mixed Herbs","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e56f8b25ed7288b4576","name":"British Chicken Breasts","type":"chicken-fillet","family":"chicken","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Chicken Breasts","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68c412723cfb117858763a9f","name":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","type":"basil-pesto-sauce","family":"none","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5f327c6560efd3453038c2a8","name":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","type":"sundried-tomato-paste-duplicate","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","marketLabel":"sun-dried tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6099506c9c6d58742c5645ca","name":"Balsamic Glaze","type":"balsamic-glaze","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 g","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Balsamic Glaze","marketLabel":"balsamic glaze equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potatoes into 2cm chunks (no need to peel). Pop the chunks onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil and sprinkle over the mixed herbs. Season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf until golden, 25-35 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Chop into 2cm chunks. Halve and peel the red onion, then cut each half into 4 wedges.","Add the pepper chunks, onion wedges and baby plum tomatoes to one side of another large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.","In a medium bowl, combine the chicken and pesto. Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat the chicken. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Add the chicken to the other side of the baking tray. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken.","Roast the chicken and veg on the middle shelf of your oven until the veg has softened and the chicken is slightly golden and cooked through, 16-18 mins. The chicken is cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","When everything's ready, drizzle the honey (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and sun-dried tomato paste over the roasted veg. Toss to coat evenly. Share the potato chunks and roasted veg between your serving bowls. Top with the pesto chicken and sprinkle over the hard Italian style cheese. Finish by drizzling over the balsamic glaze."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f/step-d389f100.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f/step-35d2a810.jpg","caption":"Prep the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f/step-959a7a20.jpg","caption":"Add the Flavour"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f/step-249ba730.jpg","caption":"Pesto is Besto"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f/step-c5104340.jpg","caption":"Get Roasting"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f/step-28bd8550.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fuss-free-cheesy-pesto-chicken-breast-traybake-699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fuss-free-cheesy-pesto-chicken-breast-traybake-699f2927e7bff1dd159be05f","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"other","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Red Onion"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"butternut-coconut-soup-lunch","sourceId":"699f293b867683566cfd05d7","title":"Yellow Thai Style Peanut Beef Noodles","subtitle":"with Green Beans, Carrot Ribbons and Lime","time":30,"cost":15.45,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","high protein","south/southeastasian","noodle-stir-fry","thai","beef","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Peeler","Kettle","Large Saucepan","Sieve","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R07_W50_UK_F13289-5_Main_high-c007f468.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/yellow-thai-style-peanut-beef-noodles-699f293b867683566cfd05d7","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["80 g","Green Beans"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lime"],["1","Carrot"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["30 g","Peanut Butter"],["45 g","Yellow Thai Style Paste"],["20 g","Ketjap Manis"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["200 ml","Boiled Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["80 g","Green Beans"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lime"],["1","Carrot"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["30 g","Peanut Butter"],["45 g","Yellow Thai Style Paste"],["20 g","Ketjap Manis"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["200 ml","Boiled Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"555080c2f8b25e4d4c8b4568","name":"Green Beans","type":"green beans","family":"beans","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Green Beans","marketLabel":"green beans 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5f284dab71a6058b4567","name":"Carrot","type":"carrot","family":"carrot","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Carrot","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373080f7d5496ac4a65cdc","name":"Egg Noodle Nest","type":"egg-noodle-nest","family":"other noodle","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Egg Noodle Nest","marketLabel":"egg noodles 4 nests","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c1c67fd2cb99f468b4567","name":"British Beef Mince","type":"beef mince","family":"beef","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Beef Mince","marketLabel":"5% fat beef mince 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683739cb42dc4b928197f417","name":"Peanut Butter","type":"peanut-butter","family":"peanut","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peanut Butter","marketLabel":"peanut butter 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6762b662afc243b64a9fbac6","name":"Yellow Thai Style Paste","type":"yellow-curry-paste","family":"spice blend","amount":"45 g","sourceAmount":45,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Yellow Thai Style Paste","marketLabel":"curry paste jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"574eff80f8b25eab0d8b4567","name":"Ketjap Manis","type":"ketjap-manis","family":"sauce","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ketjap Manis","marketLabel":"Asian cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"61f9682d7f9b41760f4d2296","name":"Boiled Water for the Sauce","type":"boiled-water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Boiled Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the noodles. Boil a half-full kettle for the sauce. Trim and halve the green beans. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the lime. Trim and peel the carrot. Use the peeler to peel long ribbons down the length of the carrot, stopping at the core.","Once your pan of water is boiling, add the noodles and green beans to the water. Cook until the beans are tender and the noodles are cooked, 4-5 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and run under cold water to stop the noodles sticking together.","Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan on medium-high heat (no oil). Once hot, add the beef mince and fry until browned, 5-6 mins. Use a spoon to break the mince up as it cooks. Once the mince is cooked, drain and discard any excess fat. Season with salt and pepper. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle. Add the carrot and fry until softened slightly, 2 mins more.","Add the garlic, peanut butter and yellow Thai style paste to the mince and fry for 1-2 mins more. Stir through the ketjap, sugar and boiled water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients), bring up to a boil and lower to a simmer and cook until thickened slightly, 2-3 mins.","Next, add the cooked noodles and a squeeze of half of the lime juice to the pan and toss everything together until well coated. Taste and season with salt, pepper and more lime juice if needed. Add a splash of water to loosen if needed.","Share your noodles between your bowls. Serve with any remaining lime wedges."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293b867683566cfd05d7/step-5c400f00.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293b867683566cfd05d7/step-11447310.jpg","caption":"Cook the Noodles and Beans"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293b867683566cfd05d7/step-251a5220.jpg","caption":"Fry Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293b867683566cfd05d7/step-cbd16730.jpg","caption":"Bring on the Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293b867683566cfd05d7/step-5eba2940.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699f293b867683566cfd05d7/step-5be94a50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/yellow-thai-style-peanut-beef-noodles-699f293b867683566cfd05d7","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/yellow-thai-style-peanut-beef-noodles-699f293b867683566cfd05d7","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["80 g","Green Beans"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lime"],["1","Carrot"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["30 g","Peanut Butter"],["45 g","Yellow Thai Style Paste"],["20 g","Ketjap Manis"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["200 ml","Boiled Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chicken-veg-soup-lunch","sourceId":"699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999","title":"Sticky Korma Spiced Halloumi Aloo Gobi Traybake","subtitle":"with Yoghurt Drizzle","time":45,"cost":9.75,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","prepped in 10","south/southeastasian","sheet pan","indian","other","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R28_W36_UK_V15986-6_Main_high-d89f6882.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/sticky-korma-spiced-halloumi-aloo-gobi-traybake-699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["300 g","Cauliflower Florets"],["1","Carrot"],["50 g","Korma Curry Paste"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["40 g","Mango Chutney"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["300 g","Cauliflower Florets"],["1","Carrot"],["50 g","Korma Curry Paste"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["40 g","Mango Chutney"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a5395e12c3e0807d6076ae2","name":"Cauliflower Florets","type":"cauliflower-florets","family":"cauliflower","amount":"300 g","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cauliflower Florets","marketLabel":"cauliflower","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5f284dab71a6058b4567","name":"Carrot","type":"carrot","family":"carrot","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Carrot","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5de10b3aa28b1766010e3f86","name":"Korma Curry Paste","type":"korma-curry-paste","family":"spice blend","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Korma Curry Paste","marketLabel":"curry paste jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55686e0bf8b25e15418b4567","name":"Halloumi","type":"halloumi","family":"hard cheese","amount":"225 g","sourceAmount":225,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Halloumi","marketLabel":"Cypriot halloumi 225g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55d366e84dab71542f8b4567","name":"Mango Chutney","type":"mango-chutney","family":"chutney","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mango Chutney","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a56e74dab71d76f8b4570","name":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","type":"natural-yoghurt","family":"yogurt","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","marketLabel":"yoghurts pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Meanwhile, chop the potatoes into 2cm chunks (no need to peel). Halve any thick cauliflower florets. Trim the carrot, then quarter lengthways (no need to peel). Chop widthways into small pieces.","Pop the potatoes, cauliflower florets and carrot onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil and season with salt and pepper. Squeeze over the korma curry paste, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary.","When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf until the potatoes are golden and veg is tender, 25-35 mins.","In the meantime, drain the halloumi, then cut it, widthways, into 3 slices per person. Place them into a small bowl of cold water and leave to soak.","When the veg is halfway through its cooking time, remove the halloumi slices from the water, pop them onto a plate lined with kitchen paper and pat them dry. Turn the veg, then add the halloumi slices to the baking tray. Return the tray to the middle shelf of your oven and bake until the veg are cooked and the halloumi is golden.","When everything's ready, remove your traybake from the oven, drizzle over the mango chutney and toss everything together. Share your korma roasted veg between your serving bowls. Top with the halloumi and drizzle over the yoghurt to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999/step-7488ff00.jpg","caption":"Prep Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999/step-fb0d4610.jpg","caption":"Traybake Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999/step-e2d32b20.jpg","caption":"Get Baked"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999/step-a52a2930.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999/step-73aa1c40.jpg","caption":"Add the Halloumi"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999/step-8fae2150.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/sticky-korma-spiced-halloumi-aloo-gobi-traybake-699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/sticky-korma-spiced-halloumi-aloo-gobi-traybake-699dc30be7df7da5bcf8d999","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"other","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["300 g","Cauliflower Florets"],["1","Carrot"],["50 g","Korma Curry Paste"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["40 g","Mango Chutney"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chickpea-tomato-soup-lunch","sourceId":"698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8","title":"Warm Beetroot, Carrot and Pomegranate Salad","subtitle":"with Zhoug Dressing and Greek Style Cheese","time":35,"cost":18.22,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","calorie smart","medium spice","taste of middle east","dinner-bowls","middle eastern","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Bowl","Sieve","Garlic Press"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R53_W03_UK_V34367-6_Main__5high-a8a649ac.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/warm-beetroot-carrot-and-pomegranate-salad-698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["250 g","Cooked Beetroot"],["1","Red Onion"],["2","Carrot"],["1 sachet","Ground Cumin"],["45 g","Zhoug Style Paste"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 carton","Lentils"],["1","Pomegranate"],["40 g","Wild Rocket"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["250 g","Cooked Beetroot"],["1","Red Onion"],["2","Carrot"],["1 sachet","Ground Cumin"],["45 g","Zhoug Style Paste"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 carton","Lentils"],["1","Pomegranate"],["40 g","Wild Rocket"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5d8b33f3e711c068cb7baa91","name":"Cooked Beetroot","type":"cooked-beetroot","family":"beet","amount":"250 g","sourceAmount":250,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cooked Beetroot","marketLabel":"fresh vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5f284dab71a6058b4567","name":"Carrot","type":"carrot","family":"carrot","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Carrot","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556827714dab71b7178b456c","name":"Ground Cumin","type":"ground cumin","family":"single spice","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ground Cumin","marketLabel":"ground cumin jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5d9dd7a4f6c5c64f571cc866","name":"Zhoug Style Paste","type":"zhoug-paste-50g","family":"spice blend","amount":"45 g","sourceAmount":45,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Zhoug Style Paste","marketLabel":"cooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"30 ml","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837abf9f7d5496ac4a68097","name":"Lentils","type":"lentils","family":"none","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lentils","marketLabel":"lentils equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d5f39fd2cb932078b4568","name":"Pomegranate","type":"pomegranate","family":"pomegranate","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Pomegranate","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Halve the beetroot, then cut each half into 3-4 wedges. Wear gloves when handling the beetroot to avoid staining your hands. Halve and peel the red onion, then cut each half into 4-5 wedges. Trim the carrots (no need to peel). Slice widthways diagonally into ½cm thick slices.","Pop the beetroot wedges, onion wedges and carrot slices onto a baking tray. Drizzle with oil and sprinkle over the ground cumin. Season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf until the carrots are tender and the beetroot has softened, 25-30 mins.","Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine the zhoug, cider vinegar, honey and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Drain and rinse the lentils in a sieve. Quarter the pomegranate. Remove the seeds from the white pith and pop the seeds into a bowl (discard the pith). Pat the outside of the pomegranate with the back of the spoon over a bowl to help release the seeds.","When the veg has about 5 mins left, remove from the oven. Add the lentils and garlic to the tray and toss with the veg. Return to the oven for the remaining time until the veg is cooked and the lentils have warmed through, 4-5 mins.","Once everything's finished cooking, give the veg a few mins to slightly cool, then add to the bowl with the zhoug dressing. Toss together until everything's nicely coated in the dressing. Add the rocket leaves, crumble in half the Greek style salad cheese and add half the pomegranate seeds. Mix well. Don't add the leaves too early or they'll go soggy. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed.","When everything's ready, share the roasted veg salad between your serving bowls. Crumble over the remaining Greek style salad cheese and sprinkle on the remaining pomegranate seeds to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8/step-c63a1400.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8/step-65680310.jpg","caption":"Into the Oven"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8/step-1f75e820.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8/step-029af730.jpg","caption":"Warm the Lentils"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8/step-f2065240.jpg","caption":"Dress to Impress"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8/step-bc0dc350.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/warm-beetroot-carrot-and-pomegranate-salad-698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/warm-beetroot-carrot-and-pomegranate-salad-698caac4ad45692e9b9ac0f8","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["250 g","Cooked Beetroot"],["1","Red Onion"],["2","Carrot"],["1 sachet","Ground Cumin"],["45 g","Zhoug Style Paste"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 carton","Lentils"],["1","Pomegranate"],["40 g","Wild Rocket"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"sweet-potato-lentil-soup-lunch","sourceId":"6996dcb9726255bc327964cb","title":"Chinese BBQ Style Glazed Salmon & Hoisin Fried Rice","subtitle":"with Smacked Cucumber, Peas and Spring Onion","time":30,"cost":20.39,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["pescatarian","chinese","seafood","rice","quick"],"requiredEquipment":["barbecue"],"sourceEquipment":["Oven dish","Sieve","Kettle","Lid","Large Saucepan","Bowl","Rolling Pin","Garlic Press","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R65_W07_UK_HVP52505-3_Main_HVP52505-SP-1-1_var_high-1afee175.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chinese-bbq-style-glazed-salmon-and-hoisin-fried-rice-6996dcb9726255bc327964cb","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Spring Onion"],["1","Lime"],["1","Baby Cucumber"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["75 g","Char Siu Paste"],["1 sachet","Chinese Five Spice"],["60 g","Hoisin Sauce"],["120 g","Peas"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Spring Onion"],["1","Lime"],["1","Baby Cucumber"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["75 g","Char Siu Paste"],["1 sachet","Chinese Five Spice"],["60 g","Hoisin Sauce"],["120 g","Peas"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"62fcaa09bd9a2478e193effe","name":"Salmon Fillets","type":"skin-on-salmon-fillet","family":"none","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salmon Fillets","marketLabel":"Scottish salmon fillets x2 240g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55508011fd2cb96c628b456c","name":"Basmati Rice","type":"basmati rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basmati Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6684fd2cb9ba598b4567","name":"Spring Onion","type":"spring onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Spring Onion","marketLabel":"spring onions bunch","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"62fcaa53bd9a2478e193f0b4","name":"Baby Cucumber","type":"baby-cucumber","family":"none","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Cucumber","marketLabel":"cucumber","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"20 ml","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"663b35115e4dcee2f12272ef","name":"Char Siu Paste","type":"char-sui-paste","family":"none","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Char Siu Paste","marketLabel":"cooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"57b1d87177d68d1f068b4567","name":"Chinese Five Spice","type":"chinese-5-spice","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chinese Five Spice","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5568784e4dab71d51e8b4569","name":"Hoisin Sauce","type":"hoisin-sauce","family":"asian paste","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Hoisin Sauce","marketLabel":"Asian cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"50 ml","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Lay the salmon fillets, skin-side down, onto a lined baking tray. Season with salt and pepper. When the oven is hot, roast the salmon on the top shelf until cooked through, 10-15 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw fish. It's cooked when opaque in the middle.","Meanwhile, boil a half-full kettle. Pour the boiled water into a large saucepan with ¼ tsp salt on high heat. Add the rice and cook for 10-12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and pop back in the pan. Cover with a lid and leave to the side to steam for later.","Meanwhile, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Trim and thinly slice the spring onion. Halve the lime. Trim the cucumber, then pop onto a board and use a rolling pin to gently smack it a few times until split. Cut into roughly 2cm chunks. In a small bowl, combine a good squeeze of lime, the sugar for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and half the soy sauce. Add the cucumber and toss to coat. Set aside for later.","About 5-10 mins before the salmon is ready, spoon over the char siu paste and return to the oven for the remaining time. Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Add the Chinese Five Spice, garlic, hoisin sauce, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) along with the remaining soy sauce to the pan. Simmer until thickened slightly, 1-2 mins.","Once thickened, stir the cooked rice and peas through the sauce until combined and piping hot. Add in a good squeeze of lime juice. Taste and season with salt, pepper and more lime if needed.","When everything's ready, share the salmon, hoisin fried rice and smacked cucumber in separate serving bowls. Sprinkle over the spring onion over the ribs and rice to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dcb9726255bc327964cb/step-79502a00.jpg","caption":"Roast the Salmon"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dcb9726255bc327964cb/step-99938a10.jpg","caption":"Boil the Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dcb9726255bc327964cb/step-d540cd20.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dcb9726255bc327964cb/step-db2e4230.jpg","caption":"Fried Rice Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dcb9726255bc327964cb/step-fe489440.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dcb9726255bc327964cb/step-0b76a550.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chinese-bbq-style-glazed-salmon-and-hoisin-fried-rice-6996dcb9726255bc327964cb","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chinese-bbq-style-glazed-salmon-and-hoisin-fried-rice-6996dcb9726255bc327964cb","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Spring Onion"],["1","Lime"],["1","Baby Cucumber"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["75 g","Char Siu Paste"],["1 sachet","Chinese Five Spice"],["60 g","Hoisin Sauce"],["120 g","Peas"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"slow-chicken-tomato-soup-lunch","sourceId":"6996dc92726255bc3279648f","title":"Speedy Southern Inspired Pork and Ranch Rice Bowl","subtitle":"with Charred Corn and Slaw","time":25,"cost":22.65,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","discovery","cuisine-spotlight","high protein","american","pork","rice"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Medium Saucepan","Lid","Bowl","Pan","Sieve","Aluminum Foil"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R11_W15_UK_QR53398-4_Main_high-1c18e47b.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-southern-inspired-pork-and-ranch-rice-bowl-6996dc92726255bc3279648f","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["2","British Pork Loin Steaks"],["120 g","Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix"],["40 g","Wild Rocket"],["30 g","Ranch Dressing"],["20 g","Butter"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["2","British Pork Loin Steaks"],["120 g","Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix"],["40 g","Wild Rocket"],["30 g","Ranch Dressing"],["20 g","Butter"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Honey"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59ad32ea2c3e08228606b422","name":"Central American Style Spice Mix","type":"central-american-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Central American Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55508011fd2cb96c628b456c","name":"Basmati Rice","type":"basmati rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basmati Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6de44dab71a6058b456a","name":"Sweetcorn","type":"sweetcorn","family":"corn","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweetcorn","marketLabel":"sweetcorn tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"30 ml","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fdb44e6d33c623a63344e97","name":"British Pork Loin Steaks","type":"pork-loin-steak","family":"pork","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Pork Loin Steaks","marketLabel":"pork cut equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5be4237630006c222055d042","name":"Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix","type":"coleslaw-mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"63ea4ab6b0694f59fe48da17","name":"Ranch Dressing","type":"ranch-dressing","family":"none","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ranch Dressing","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"57bec7a892eec9ca688b4568","name":"Water for the Rice","type":"water-for-the-rice-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"300 ml","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Rice","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Pop a deep saucepan (with a tight-fitting lid) on medium heat. Melt in the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). When the butter has melted, add the garlic and half the Central American style spice mix. Stir-fry for 1 min. Stir in the rice until coated, 1 min. Add ¼ tsp salt and the water for the rice (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and bring to the boil. Once boiling, turn the heat down to medium and cover with the lid. Leave to cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from the heat (still covered) and leave to the side for another 10 mins or until ready to serve (the rice will continue to cook in its own steam).","Meanwhile, drain the sweetcorn in a sieve. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. Once hot, add the sweetcorn and cook until charred, 5-6 mins. Adjust the heat if necessary. Stir only twice during this time - you want the sweetcorn to pick up some nice colour. Transfer the sweetcorn to a bowl. Give the frying pan a quick wipe clean.","In a large salad bowl, combine the cider vinegar with the sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Set aside.","Heat a drizzle of oil in the (now empty) frying pan on medium-high heat. Season the pork with salt and pepper. Sprinkle over the remaining Central American style spice mix. Once hot, add the pork steaks. Fry until browned, 2-3 mins on each side. Reduce the heat to medium and fry for an additional 4-6 mins, turning every couple of mins. Once cooked, remove to a plate and drizzle over the honey (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Cover with some foil to rest. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw pork. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","When everything's nearly ready, add the sweetcorn and sliced carrot and cabbage mix to the bowl with the dressing. Toss well to combine. Mix the rocket leaves through the salad. Once rested, thinly slice the pork steaks.","Divide the rice between bowls. Top the rice with the salad and pork steaks. Drizzle over the ranch dressing to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc92726255bc3279648f/step-f3f0ed00.jpg","caption":"Start the Garlic Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc92726255bc3279648f/step-45b8dd10.jpg","caption":"Char the Corn"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc92726255bc3279648f/step-058aa020.jpg","caption":"Make the Dressing"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc92726255bc3279648f/step-866ee930.jpg","caption":"Fry the Pork"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc92726255bc3279648f/step-8e92b040.jpg","caption":"Toss the Salad"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc92726255bc3279648f/step-a532e650.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-southern-inspired-pork-and-ranch-rice-bowl-6996dc92726255bc3279648f","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-southern-inspired-pork-and-ranch-rice-bowl-6996dc92726255bc3279648f","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["2","British Pork Loin Steaks"],["120 g","Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix"],["40 g","Wild Rocket"],["30 g","Ranch Dressing"],["20 g","Butter"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chicken-pesto-pasta-salad","sourceId":"697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1","title":"Halloumi, Roasted Butternut Squash and Ditali Pasta Salad","subtitle":"with Harissa Dressing, Walnuts and Greek Style Cheese","time":35,"cost":18.52,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["medium spice","mediterranean","dinner-bowls","veggie","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Bowl","Medium Saucepan","Baking Tray","Pan","Colander","Large Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R30_W25_UK_V36638-4_MAIN_V36638-AP-1-8_var_high-1eb76fe1.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/halloumi-roasted-butternut-squash-and-ditali-pasta-salad-697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Butternut Squash"],["1 sachet","Ground Cumin"],["90 g","Ditali Pasta"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["50 g","Harissa Paste"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Butternut Squash"],["1 sachet","Ground Cumin"],["90 g","Ditali Pasta"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["50 g","Harissa Paste"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a6345f8b25eee3e8b4567","name":"Butternut Squash","type":"butternut squash","family":"squash","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Butternut Squash","marketLabel":"butternut squash","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556827714dab71b7178b456c","name":"Ground Cumin","type":"ground cumin","family":"single spice","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ground Cumin","marketLabel":"ground cumin jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e82d9848b9dac04fc52","name":"Ditali Pasta","type":"ditali-pasta","family":"none","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ditali Pasta","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55686e0bf8b25e15418b4567","name":"Halloumi","type":"halloumi","family":"hard cheese","amount":"225 g","sourceAmount":225,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Halloumi","marketLabel":"Cypriot halloumi 225g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a56e74dab71d76f8b4570","name":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","type":"natural-yoghurt","family":"yogurt","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","marketLabel":"yoghurts pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c80fdf8b25e246c8b4567","name":"Harissa Paste","type":"rose-harissa-paste","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Harissa Paste","marketLabel":"harissa paste 130g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"15 ml","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69cd4a15a4f29fefb8a5caf7","name":"Walnuts","type":"walnuts","family":"nut mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Walnuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the ditali. Trim the butternut squash, halve lengthways, then scoop out the seeds (peel first if you prefer). Cut into 2cm chunks. Drain the halloumi, then cut it into 2 slices per person. Place them into a small bowl of cold water and leave to soak.","Pop the diced butternut onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil and season with salt and pepper. Sprinkle over the cumin, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf until golden and cooked through, 25-30 mins. Turn halfway through.","When boiling, add the ditali to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 10 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and rinse under cold water. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together. Sit the colander on top of the pan to fully drain and set aside. Meanwhile, remove the halloumi from the cold water, pop them onto a plate lined with kitchen paper and pat them dry. Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the halloumi and fry until golden, 2-3 mins each side.","While the halloumi cooks, halve the tomatoes. In a large bowl, combine the yoghurt, harissa paste (add less if you'd prefer things milder), cider vinegar, honey and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper, then set your dressing aside.","When everything's ready, add the tomatoes, cooked pasta, baby leaves and roasted butternut to the bowl of dressing. Crumble in half the Greek style salad cheese and add half the walnuts. Toss together so everything's well dressed. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed.","Share the salad between your serving bowls. Top with the halloumi. Scatter over the remaining cheese and walnuts to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1/step-f5e8c300.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1/step-63d4f010.jpg","caption":"Time to Roast"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1/step-1bb5c620.jpg","caption":"Cook the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1/step-b3a3bf30.jpg","caption":"Get Dressed"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1/step-f460a140.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1/step-17988f50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/halloumi-roasted-butternut-squash-and-ditali-pasta-salad-697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/halloumi-roasted-butternut-squash-and-ditali-pasta-salad-697a56edbcdfd65d69c378d1","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Butternut Squash"],["1 sachet","Ground Cumin"],["90 g","Ditali Pasta"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["50 g","Harissa Paste"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"tuna-tomato-pasta-lunch","sourceId":"698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd","title":"Spiced Smashed Chickpea and Chicken Tacos","subtitle":"with Creamy Slaw and Charred Corn Salsa","time":35,"cost":18.13,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["new","high protein","american","poultry","handheld","cook","wrap"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Zester","Sieve","Garlic Press","Bowl","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R20_W16_UK_V54216-3_Main_2_V54216-AP-1-3_var_high-944db8d8.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spiced-smashed-chickpea-and-chicken-tacos-698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1 bunch","Coriander"],["1","Lime"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["120 g","Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix"],["32 g","Mayonnaise"],["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"],["15 g","butter"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1 bunch","Coriander"],["1","Lime"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["120 g","Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix"],["32 g","Mayonnaise"],["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a5f54fd2cb99c598b4567","name":"Coriander","type":"coriander","family":"coriander","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Coriander","marketLabel":"fresh coriander 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6de44dab71a6058b456a","name":"Sweetcorn","type":"sweetcorn","family":"corn","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweetcorn","marketLabel":"sweetcorn tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68ecc674fa624b85e8848c26","name":"Baby Gem Lettuce","type":"baby gem lettuce","family":"salad mix","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Gem Lettuce","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5be4237630006c222055d042","name":"Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix","type":"coleslaw-mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9d234dab7162138b4568","name":"Mayonnaise","type":"mayonnaise-tbsp","family":"mayonnaise","amount":"32 g","sourceAmount":32,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mayonnaise","marketLabel":"mayonnaise 500ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6387fd2cb99c598b4568","name":"Chickpeas","type":"organic chickpeas","family":"canned chickpeas","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chickpeas","marketLabel":"chickpeas 400g, 240g drained","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59ad32ea2c3e08228606b422","name":"Central American Style Spice Mix","type":"central-american-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Central American Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683727bfd9848b9dac04fe03","name":"Plain Taco Tortillas","type":"plain-taco-tortilla","family":"none","amount":"6","sourceAmount":6,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Plain Taco Tortillas","marketLabel":"wraps or tortillas x8","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea605fc26d5313f23d2","name":"Diced British Chicken Breast","type":"chicken-breast-diced","family":"none","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced British Chicken Breast","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["If you don't have a microwave, heat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7 for the tortillas. Roughly chop the coriander (stalks and all). Zest and cut the lime into wedges. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Drain the sweetcorn in a sieve.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. Once hot, add the sweetcorn and cook until charred, 5-6 mins. Adjust the heat if necessary. Stir only twice during this time - you want the sweetcorn to pick up some nice colour. Transfer the charred corn to a medium bowl along with the coriander. Crumble in the Greek style salad cheese. Drizzle in some oil, squeeze in some lime juice and season with salt and pepper. Set the salsa aside for now.","Trim the baby gem, halve lengthways, then thinly slice. In a medium bowl, combine the sliced carrot and cabbage mix, mayonnaise and a squeeze of lime juice. Season with salt and pepper and set aside.","Next, drain and rinse the chickpeas in a sieve. Pop the (now empty) frying pan back on medium heat with a drizzle of oil. Once hot, add the chicken to the pan and season with salt and pepper. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Fry until golden brown on the outside and cooked through, 8-10 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle. Add the tomato puree, Central American style spice mix and garlic and fry for 30 secs. Add the chickpeas and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins.","Once the chickpeas have thickened, add 15 g butter and remove from the heat. Roughly mash with the back of a fork, then season with salt and pepper. Pile the tortillas (3 per person) onto a plate. Heat them through in the microwave, 850W: 50 secs / 750W: 1 min, until warm and soft. If you're using the oven, pop them into the oven to warm through, 1-2 mins.","When everything's ready, lay the tortillas onto your plates. To make your tacos, add the smashed chickpeas and chicken to the base of each tortilla, then top with the baby gem, slaw and charred corn salsa. Serve any remaining lime wedges on the side for squeezing over."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd/step-61662f00.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd/step-54d6eb10.jpg","caption":"Time to Salsa"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd/step-ba2d8d20.jpg","caption":"Make the Slaw"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd/step-98ea1230.jpg","caption":"Fry the Chickpeas"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd/step-507dd740.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd/step-663b7150.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spiced-smashed-chickpea-and-chicken-tacos-698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spiced-smashed-chickpea-and-chicken-tacos-698caacf8e0d10536157d3cd","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"wrap","shoppingIngredients":[["1 bunch","Coriander"],["1","Lime"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["120 g","Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix"],["32 g","Mayonnaise"],["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"],["15 g","butter"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"feta-spinach-pasta-lunch","sourceId":"698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c","title":"Cajun Spiced Vegetable Rice","subtitle":"with Roasted Sweet Potatoes, Peas and Soured Cream","time":35,"cost":21.12,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","latin-american-faves","dinner-bowls","very hot","cajunsk","rice","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Medium Saucepan","Lid","Baking Tray","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R51_W15_UK_V14081-20_Main_high-f2535265.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cajun-spiced-vegetable-rice-698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Onion"],["3","Garlic Clove"],["2","Sweet Potato"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["30 g","Butter"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Onion"],["3","Garlic Clove"],["2","Sweet Potato"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["30 g","Butter"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Honey"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a59324dab71626c8b4575","name":"Onion","type":"onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Onion","marketLabel":"brown onions 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"3","sourceAmount":3,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555082a2f8b25e56468b4568","name":"Sweet Potato","type":"sweet potato","family":"potato","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweet Potato","marketLabel":"sweet potatoes 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55508011fd2cb96c628b456c","name":"Basmati Rice","type":"basmati rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basmati Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5aba35df7918d5096b2f","name":"Cajun Spice Mix","type":"cajun-style-spice","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cajun Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68382535f7d5496ac4a6a740","name":"Soured Cream","type":"soured-cream","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soured Cream","marketLabel":"soured cream 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"57bec7a892eec9ca688b4568","name":"Water for the Rice","type":"water-for-the-rice-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"300 ml","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Rice","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 240°C/220°C fan/gas mark 9. Halve, peel and thinly slice the onion. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Heat a drizzle of oil in a deep saucepan (with a tight-fitting lid) on medium heat. Once hot, add half the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and allow to melt. Add the onion, season with salt and pepper and fry, stirring occasionally, until golden and soft, 8-10 mins.","Meanwhile, chop the sweet potatoes into 2cm chunks (no need to peel). Pop the sweet potatoes onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf until golden and tender, 18-20 mins. Turn halfway through. Meanwhile, once the onion has softened, add the sugar (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and half the garlic. Stir together and cook for 1 min more.","Stir the rice into the onion and garlic until coated, 1 min. Add ¼ tsp salt and the water for the rice (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and bring to the boil. Once boiling, turn the heat down to medium and cover with the lid. Leave to cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from the heat (still covered) and leave to the side for another 10 mins or until ready to serve (the rice will continue to cook in its own steam).","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, stir in the tomato puree, Cajun spice mix (add less if you'd prefer things milder) and remaining garlic. Cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Lower the heat to medium, then add the water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and veg stock paste. Simmer until thickened, 2-3 mins.","Once the sauce has thickened, stir the peas, cooked rice, honey and remaining butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) into the frying pan. Once roasted, stir the sweet potatoes through the rice. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed. Add a splash of water if it's a little dry.","When everything's ready, share the Cajun spiced rice between your bowls. Crumble over the Greek style salad cheese and top with a drizzle of soured cream. Scatter over the rocket leaves to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c/step-8a3a6400.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c/step-f3933110.jpg","caption":"Roast the Sweet Potatoes"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c/step-ff9eed20.jpg","caption":"Bring on the Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c/step-2afc0830.jpg","caption":"Make your Cajun Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c/step-54977340.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c/step-3374ab50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cajun-spiced-vegetable-rice-698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cajun-spiced-vegetable-rice-698e1ddf50ea5a6f74849d6c","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Onion"],["3","Garlic Clove"],["2","Sweet Potato"],["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["30 g","Butter"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["300 ml","Water for the Rice"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"roasted-veg-pasta-lunch","sourceId":"698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659","title":"Thai Yellow Style Prawn Noodle Soup","subtitle":"with Pak Choi and Tenderstem® Broccoli","time":20,"cost":17,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","medium spice","south/southeastasian","soup-stew","pescatarian","low carb","thai","seafood","soup"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Zester","Rolling Pin","Kettle","Sieve","Large Saucepan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R17_W03_UK_F14731-22_edit_prawns_Main__4high-f31a05d9.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/thai-yellow-style-prawn-noodle-soup-698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Pak Choi"],["80 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["1","Lime"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["1 sachet","Thai Style Spice Mix"],["45 g","Yellow Thai Style Paste"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["30 g","Peanut Butter"],["180 ml","Coconut Milk"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["200 ml","Water for the Soup"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Pak Choi"],["80 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["1","Lime"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["1 sachet","Thai Style Spice Mix"],["45 g","Yellow Thai Style Paste"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["30 g","Peanut Butter"],["180 ml","Coconut Milk"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["200 ml","Water for the Soup"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"697cbee6d608bbef6ca06f3f","name":"Pak Choi","type":"bok-choy","family":"vegetable mix","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Pak Choi","marketLabel":"pak choi x2","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a665afd2cb99c598b4569","name":"Tenderstem® Broccoli","type":"tenderstem-broccoli","family":"broccoli","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tenderstem® Broccoli","marketLabel":"broccoli head","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6877ced35a587f17f45951c6","name":"Salted Peanuts","type":"salted peanuts","family":"nut mix","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salted Peanuts","marketLabel":"table salt 750g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373080f7d5496ac4a65cdc","name":"Egg Noodle Nest","type":"egg-noodle-nest","family":"other noodle","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Egg Noodle Nest","marketLabel":"egg noodles 4 nests","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632e48e82e3a699175a1b012","name":"Thai Style Spice Mix","type":"thai-spice-blend","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Thai Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6762b662afc243b64a9fbac6","name":"Yellow Thai Style Paste","type":"yellow-curry-paste","family":"spice blend","amount":"45 g","sourceAmount":45,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Yellow Thai Style Paste","marketLabel":"curry paste jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"20 ml","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683739cb42dc4b928197f417","name":"Peanut Butter","type":"peanut-butter","family":"peanut","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peanut Butter","marketLabel":"peanut butter 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a62e1f8b25eef3e8b4567","name":"Coconut Milk","type":"coconut milk","family":"canned coconut milk","amount":"180 ml","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Coconut Milk","marketLabel":"coconut milk 400ml tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"63ed1e1ee1f41b99b9ea84a0","name":"Water for the Soup","type":"water-for-the-soup-100ml","family":"none","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Soup","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a full kettle for the noodles. Trim the pak choi, then thinly slice widthways. Halve the Tenderstem® broccoli widthways. Zest and cut the lime into wedges. Crush the peanuts with a rolling pin or the base of a small saucepan.","Pour the boiled water from your kettle into a saucepan with ½ tsp salt and bring back to the boil. When boiling, add the noodles and broccoli. Cook until tender, 4 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and run under cold water to stop them sticking together. Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in another large saucepan on medium-high heat. Drain the prawns. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw prawns.","Once the oil is hot, add the prawns. Season with salt and pepper and stir-fry for 2-3 mins. Add the Thai style spice mix (add less if you'd prefer things milder) and yellow Thai style paste. Stir-fry for 30 secs. Stir in the peanut butter, soy sauce and coconut milk. Mix well until combined. Add in the sugar and water for the soup (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then lower the heat and stir until everything's well combined.","Add the pak choi to your soup. Stir and cook until pak choi is tender and the prawns are cooked through, 3-4 mins. The prawns are cooked when pink on the outside and opaque in the middle.","Once the pak choi is cooked, add the cooked noodles and broccoli to the soup. Bring up to the boil again, then immediately remove from the heat. Add a splash of water if it's a little too thick - you want a soupy consistency! Squeeze in some lime juice from a lime wedge. Taste and add more salt, sugar and lime juice if needed.","Share the noodle soup between your bowls. Sprinkle over the peanuts and lime zest to finish. Garnish with any remaining lime wedges."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659/step-fa045900.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659/step-d0750010.jpg","caption":"Cook the Noodles and Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659/step-e3179220.jpg","caption":"Soup Up"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659/step-4fc24630.jpg","caption":"Add the Pak Choi"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659/step-61f67740.jpg","caption":"Combine and Stir"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659/step-41232650.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/thai-yellow-style-prawn-noodle-soup-698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/thai-yellow-style-prawn-noodle-soup-698caabaca20a4fa52b3d659","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"soup","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Pak Choi"],["80 g","Tenderstem® Broccoli"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["1","Lime"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["1 sachet","Thai Style Spice Mix"],["45 g","Yellow Thai Style Paste"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["30 g","Peanut Butter"],["180 ml","Coconut Milk"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["200 ml","Water for the Soup"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chickpea-pesto-pasta-lunch","sourceId":"69838f40cb2a0d32532c0c60","title":"Pronto Pizza Inspired Chorizo Quesadillas","subtitle":"with Oregano, Apple and Balsamic Baby Leaf Salad","time":15,"cost":19.25,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["super quick","mexican","handheld","quick","wrap"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R30_W07_UK_UQ50857-3_Main_high-aac6f655.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/pronto-pizza-inspired-chorizo-quesadillas-69838f40cb2a0d32532c0c60","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["150 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["60 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Dried Oregano"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["15","Chorizo Slices"],["1","Apple"],["48 g","Sweet Chilli Sauce"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"]],"sourceIngredients":[["150 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["60 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Dried Oregano"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["15","Chorizo Slices"],["1","Apple"],["48 g","Sweet Chilli Sauce"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"69146769623e0c85b6821082","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683727bfd9848b9dac04fe03","name":"Plain Taco Tortillas","type":"plain-taco-tortilla","family":"none","amount":"6","sourceAmount":6,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Plain Taco Tortillas","marketLabel":"wraps or tortillas x8","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550da144dab718e128b456e","name":"Dried Oregano","type":"dried oregano","family":"oregano","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Dried Oregano","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"656e68f02db9273db6a42986","name":"Chorizo Slices","type":"sliced-chorizo","family":"pork","amount":"15","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chorizo Slices","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c34ebf8b25eb9658b4567","name":"Apple","type":"apple","family":"apple","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Apple","marketLabel":"crisp apples x6","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55683f84fd2cb985278b4568","name":"Sweet Chilli Sauce","type":"sweet chilli sauce","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"48 g","sourceAmount":48,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweet Chilli Sauce","marketLabel":"sweet chilli sauce 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6099506c9c6d58742c5645ca","name":"Balsamic Glaze","type":"balsamic-glaze","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 g","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Balsamic Glaze","marketLabel":"balsamic glaze equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 240°C/220°C fan/gas mark 9. Grate the cheese. Lay half of the tortillas onto a lightly oiled baking tray.","Spread the tomato puree onto the tortillas on the baking tray. Sprinkle the oregano over. Top with the hard Italian style cheese, grated Cheddar and chorizo slices. Lay the remaining tortillas on top of the loaded tortillas. Sandwich shut. Lightly press down to keep them together.","Rub a little oil over the top of each quesadilla. Bake on the top shelf of your oven, 5-7 mins. Meanwhile, quarter, core and thinly slice the apple (no need to peel).","Quarter the quesadillas and share between your plates. Drizzle over the sweet chilli sauce. Serve the baby leaves alongside. Scatter the apple over the leaves. Drizzle over the balsamic glaze to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f40cb2a0d32532c0c60/step-74be7300.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f40cb2a0d32532c0c60/step-44079e10.jpg","caption":"Load Up"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f40cb2a0d32532c0c60/step-f1b08b20.jpg","caption":"Final Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f40cb2a0d32532c0c60/step-2db88130.jpg","caption":"Dinner's Ready!"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/pronto-pizza-inspired-chorizo-quesadillas-69838f40cb2a0d32532c0c60","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/pronto-pizza-inspired-chorizo-quesadillas-69838f40cb2a0d32532c0c60","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"wrap","shoppingIngredients":[["150 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["60 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Dried Oregano"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["15","Chorizo Slices"],["1","Apple"],["48 g","Sweet Chilli Sauce"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"tomato-basil-pasta-lunch","sourceId":"69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6","title":"Tender Teriyaki Roasted Aubergine and Fried Rice","subtitle":"with Vegetable Spring Rolls, Sweet Chilli and Smacked Cucumber Salad","time":40,"cost":22.28,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","pan-asian-plates","dinner-bowls","egg(s) not included","new","hellofresh specials","chinese","rice","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Baking Paper","Bowl","Rolling Pin","Garlic Press","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R80_W15_UK_SSFV43478-6_Main_high-96220dfd.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/tender-teriyaki-roasted-aubergine-and-fried-rice-69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Aubergine"],["4","Vegetable Spring Rolls"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Cucumber"],["40 ml","Soy Sauce"],["10 g","Roasted White Sesame Seeds"],["22.5 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["50 g","Teriyaki Sauce"],["1 pouch","Steamed Basmati Rice"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Ketjap Manis"],["64 g","Sweet Chilli Sauce"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1","Egg"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Aubergine"],["4","Vegetable Spring Rolls"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Cucumber"],["40 ml","Soy Sauce"],["10 g","Roasted White Sesame Seeds"],["22.5 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["50 g","Teriyaki Sauce"],["1 pouch","Steamed Basmati Rice"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Ketjap Manis"],["64 g","Sweet Chilli Sauce"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1","Egg"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a6363fd2cb959598b4570","name":"Aubergine","type":"aubergine","family":"aubergine","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Aubergine","marketLabel":"aubergine","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fa942dc4b928197f184","name":"Vegetable Spring Rolls","type":"vegetable-spring-rolls","family":"none","amount":"4","sourceAmount":4,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Spring Rolls","marketLabel":"vegetable spring rolls pack","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a54f4fd2cb9324b8b4573","name":"Cucumber","type":"cucumber","family":"cucumber","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cucumber","marketLabel":"cucumber","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"40 ml","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69c5046e9bc4efe70fc4f9ee","name":"Roasted White Sesame Seeds","type":"roasted-white-sesame-seeds","family":"sesame seed","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Roasted White Sesame Seeds","marketLabel":"sesame seeds 100g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a68fa4dab71aa058b4568","name":"Rice Vinegar","type":"rice vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"22.5 ml","sourceAmount":22.5,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Rice Vinegar","marketLabel":"cooking vinegar equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"67f0611cb777f3317f54763f","name":"Teriyaki Sauce","type":"teriyaki-sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Teriyaki Sauce","marketLabel":"teriyaki sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a573a15c28800429a6eeac2","name":"Steamed Basmati Rice","type":"steamed-basmati-rice","family":"rice","amount":"1 pouch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"pouch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Steamed Basmati Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"574eff80f8b25eab0d8b4567","name":"Ketjap Manis","type":"ketjap-manis","family":"sauce","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ketjap Manis","marketLabel":"Asian cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55683f84fd2cb985278b4568","name":"Sweet Chilli Sauce","type":"sweet chilli sauce","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"64 g","sourceAmount":64,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweet Chilli Sauce","marketLabel":"sweet chilli sauce 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fc0f772688281450b8bd085","name":"Egg","type":"egg","family":"egg","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Egg","marketLabel":"medium eggs x12","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"50 ml","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Halve the aubergine lengthways, keeping the stem attached. Score the flesh deeply in a criss-cross pattern, taking care not to cut through the skin. Put the aubergine halves, skin-side down, onto a large lined baking tray. Drizzle with oil and season with salt and pepper. When the oven is hot, roast the aubergine on the top shelf until golden brown and soft, 25-28 mins.","Meanwhile, remove the spring rolls from the packing and pop onto another baking tray. When the aubergine has 15 mins remaining, bake the spring rolls on the middle shelf until golden and piping hot, 12-14 mins. Meanwhile, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Trim the cucumber, then pop onto a board and use a rolling pin to gently smack it a few times until split. Cut into roughly 2cm chunks. In a medium bowl, combine half the soy sauce, half the sesame seeds, the rice vinegar and sugar for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Add the cucumber and toss together. Set aside.","In a medium bowl, whisk the egg (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) until combined and season with a pinch of salt and pepper. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Pour the egg into the frying pan and cook for 30 secs without stirring, then gently stir, making sure the egg doesn't stick to the bottom of the pan, 2-3 mins. Once cooked, remove from the pan to a bowl and set aside for now. Ensure egg whites are fully cooked.","When the aubergine has 2-3 mins remaining, drizzle over the teriyaki sauce and spread evenly over the cut sides. Return to the oven until sticky and glazed, 2-3 mins. Return the (now empty) frying pan to medium-high heat with a knob of butter or a drizzle of oil if you'd prefer. Once melted, add the garlic and fry until fragrant, 1 min.","Break the rice up in the packet, then add the rice and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) to the garlic and fry until softened, 2-3 mins. Stir in peas, remaining soy sauce, ketjap manis and half the sweet chilli sauce to the pan and fry, stirring occasionally, until the sauce has absorbed into the rice, 2-3 mins. Stir in the cooked egg, then remove from the heat.","Spoon your fried rice into a small ramekin or bowl. Press down with a spoon, then carefully turn the rice out onto your plate. Repeat with the remaining rice. Serve the scored aubergine and sesame cucumber salad on the side. Sprinkle the remaining sesame seeds over the aubergine. Serve the spring rolls with the remaining sweet chilli sauce for dipping."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6/step-8d906100.jpg","caption":"Roast the Sweet Potato"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6/step-70d88a10.jpg","caption":"Prep the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6/step-96155e20.jpg","caption":"Fry the Egg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6/step-25df3230.jpg","caption":"Make the Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6/step-aaba6640.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6/step-3fdfd250.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/tender-teriyaki-roasted-aubergine-and-fried-rice-69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/tender-teriyaki-roasted-aubergine-and-fried-rice-69838f82cb2a0d32532c0da6","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Aubergine"],["4","Vegetable Spring Rolls"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Cucumber"],["40 ml","Soy Sauce"],["10 g","Roasted White Sesame Seeds"],["22.5 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["50 g","Teriyaki Sauce"],["1 pouch","Steamed Basmati Rice"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Ketjap Manis"],["64 g","Sweet Chilli Sauce"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1","Egg"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"teriyaki-tofu-rice-lunch","sourceId":"69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7","title":"Spicy Veg, Chickpea and Couscous Halloumi Salad","subtitle":"with Veggie 'Nduja and Yoghurt","time":35,"cost":17.04,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","very hot","mediterranean","dinner-bowls","high protein","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Bowl","Sieve","Baking Tray","Garlic Press","Medium Saucepan","Lid","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R42_W13_UK_V34360-3_editCheese_Main_high-010484c9.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spicy-veg-chickpea-and-couscous-halloumi-salad-69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Courgette"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["40 g","Vegan ‘Nduja"],["120 g","Couscous"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["1","Lemon"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Courgette"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["40 g","Vegan ‘Nduja"],["120 g","Couscous"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["1","Lemon"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6387fd2cb99c598b4568","name":"Chickpeas","type":"organic chickpeas","family":"canned chickpeas","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chickpeas","marketLabel":"chickpeas 400g, 240g drained","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"633c6597aa3f33c15c854bb0","name":"Mixed Herbs","type":"mixed-herbs","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mixed Herbs","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55686e0bf8b25e15418b4567","name":"Halloumi","type":"halloumi","family":"hard cheese","amount":"225 g","sourceAmount":225,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Halloumi","marketLabel":"Cypriot halloumi 225g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"64ad6bee48c7b9302c3330bc","name":"Vegan ‘Nduja","type":"vegan-nduja","family":"none","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegan ‘Nduja","marketLabel":"plant protein equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837302fd9848b9dac04ffc1","name":"Couscous","type":"couscous-duplicate","family":"grains","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Couscous","marketLabel":"couscous 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e96f8b25e1e268b4578","name":"Mint","type":"mint","family":"mint","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mint","marketLabel":"fresh mint 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a56e74dab71d76f8b4570","name":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","type":"natural-yoghurt","family":"yogurt","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","marketLabel":"yoghurts pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"616ef1f4cfc8aa52d7b2bd62","name":"Water for the Couscous","type":"water-for-the-couscous","family":"other drink","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Couscous","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Trim the courgette and slice into 1cm thick rounds. Halve the baby plum tomatoes. Halve and peel the red onion, then cut each half into 3 wedges. Drain and rinse the chickpeas in a sieve, then dry thoroughly with kitchen paper. Drain the halloumi, then cut it into 2cm chunks. Place them into a small bowl of cold water and leave to soak.","Spread the chickpeas on a large baking tray. Add the courgette, onion and baby plum tomatoes to the baking tray and drizzle with oil. Sprinkle over the mixed herbs and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then spread out in a single layer. When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf of your oven until softened and browned, 18-20 mins. Turn halfway through. Meanwhile, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press).","Put a deep saucepan (with a tight-fitting lid) on medium heat with a drizzle of oil. Once hot, add the garlic and half the vegan 'Nduja. Fry for 30 secs. Stir in the couscous until coated, 30 secs. Stir in the veg stock paste and water for the couscous (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and bring to the boil. When boiling, remove from the heat, stir in the couscous and pop a lid on the pan. Leave to the side for 8-10 mins or until ready to serve.","Remove the halloumi cubes from the cold water, pop them onto a plate lined with kitchen paper and pat them dry. Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the halloumi and fry until golden, 6-7 mins. While everything cooks, halve the lemon. Pick the mint leaves from their stalks and roughly chop (discard the stalks). In a large bowl, mix together a good squeeze of lemon juice, sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper, then set aside for now. In a small bowl, mix together the Greek style yoghurt and remaining vegan 'Nduja (add less if you'd prefer things milder).","When everything's ready, add the couscous, roasted veg, chickpeas and half the mint to the lemon dressing and toss together. Cut any remaining lemon into wedges.","Share the warm salad between your serving bowls. Top with the halloumi cubes, drizzle over the veggie 'Nduja yoghurt and finish by sprinkling over the remaining mint. Top with any remaining lemon wedges for squeezing over."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7/step-4a128100.jpg","caption":"Prep the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7/step-a6955b10.jpg","caption":"Get Roasting"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7/step-dd0abd20.jpg","caption":"Cook the Couscous"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7/step-7b291030.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7/step-b62afa40.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7/step-1b98e650.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spicy-veg-chickpea-and-couscous-halloumi-salad-69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spicy-veg-chickpea-and-couscous-halloumi-salad-69838f5060fdaa1d855477a7","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Courgette"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["40 g","Vegan ‘Nduja"],["120 g","Couscous"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["1","Lemon"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chicken-fajita-rice-lunch","sourceId":"69710d37933a02843ffb63e3","title":"Halloumi, Falafel, Houmous and Paprika Butter","subtitle":"with Chips, Garlic Bread and Cucumber Tomato Salad","time":40,"cost":22.63,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["taste of middle east","classic-plates","veggie","middle eastern","other","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Bowl","Baking Tray","Garlic Press","Pan","Small sauce pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R49_W13_UK_V21092-9_Main_F1_V21092-AP-1-1_var_high-7f86096a.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/halloumi-falafel-houmous-and-paprika-butter-69710d37933a02843ffb63e3","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["1","Medium Tomato"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1","Baby Cucumber"],["12 ml","Red Wine Vinegar"],["160 g","Falafel"],["15 g","Honey"],["25 g","Red Pepper Chilli Jelly"],["1 sachet","Smoked Paprika"],["20 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["100 g","Houmous"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["30 g","Butter"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["1","Medium Tomato"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1","Baby Cucumber"],["12 ml","Red Wine Vinegar"],["160 g","Falafel"],["15 g","Honey"],["25 g","Red Pepper Chilli Jelly"],["1 sachet","Smoked Paprika"],["20 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["100 g","Houmous"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["30 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55686e0bf8b25e15418b4567","name":"Halloumi","type":"halloumi","family":"hard cheese","amount":"225 g","sourceAmount":225,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Halloumi","marketLabel":"Cypriot halloumi 225g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60070aba8e7046341a491fcb","name":"Medium Tomato","type":"medium-tomato","family":"tomato","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Medium Tomato","marketLabel":"tomatoes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"62fcaa53bd9a2478e193f0b4","name":"Baby Cucumber","type":"baby-cucumber","family":"none","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Cucumber","marketLabel":"cucumber","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555ca1774dab7190138b4568","name":"Red Wine Vinegar","type":"red wine vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 ml","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Wine Vinegar","marketLabel":"cooking vinegar equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"67a943a32828101973144375","name":"Falafel","type":"falafel","family":"none","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Falafel","priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59159a3f2310a84f8641c5f3","name":"Red Pepper Chilli Jelly","type":"red-pepper-chilli-jelly","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Pepper Chilli Jelly","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea6da082ea161fce4e2","name":"Smoked Paprika","type":"smoked-paprika","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Smoked Paprika","marketLabel":"paprika jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"64938f3cf855bec59c8fd364","name":"Houmous","type":"houmous","family":"hummus","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Houmous","marketLabel":"hummus 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"602fb8be9c479d367f798aee","name":"Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread","type":"olive-oil-for-the-garlic-bread-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potatoes lengthways into 1cm slices, then chop into 1cm wide chips (no need to peel). Pop the chips onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, bake on the top shelf until golden, 25-30 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, drain the halloumi, then cut it into 2-3 slices per person. Place them into a small bowl of cold water and leave to soak. Cut the tomato into 1cm chunks. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the ciabatta. Trim the cucumber and slice into 1cm thick rounds.","In a large bowl, combine the red wine vinegar, sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Add the tomato chunks and cucumber rounds. Toss to coat in the dressing, then set aside.","Place the falafels on a plate and microwave, 800W: 75 secs / 900W: 45 secs / 1000W: 30 secs. If you don't have a microwave, place the falafels onto a baking tray and bake on the middle shelf until golden brown, 5-8 mins. Lay the ciabatta halves onto your board, cut-side up. Spread over the garlic and drizzle with the olive oil for the garlic bread (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Add the bread to the falafel tray and bake until golden, 4-5 mins. When ready, drizzle the honey over the falafels and turn to glaze. If your honey has hardened, pop it in a bowl of hot water for 1 min. Remove the halloumi slices from the cold water, pop them onto a plate lined with kitchen paper and pat them dry.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the halloumi and fry until golden, 2-3 mins each side. When everything's nearly ready, add the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients), red pepper chilli jelly and smoked paprika to a small saucepan on medium heat. Warm to melt the butter, 1 min. Stir the sauce well to combine. Just before serving, add the baby leaves to the cucumber and tomato bowl. Toss to coat in the dressing. Don't add the leaves too early or they'll go soggy.","Spoon a large dollop of houmous onto each of your serving plates. Place your halloumi and falafels on top and drizzle over the paprika butter. Share the chips and salad between serving plates and pop the garlic bread alongside for dipping and scooping."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d37933a02843ffb63e3/step-f1496500.jpg","caption":"Make the Chips"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d37933a02843ffb63e3/step-8a10f310.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d37933a02843ffb63e3/step-36c6b220.jpg","caption":"Make the Dressing"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d37933a02843ffb63e3/step-3b2ef430.jpg","caption":"Fry the Falafels"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d37933a02843ffb63e3/step-211d0340.jpg","caption":"Make your Paprika Butter"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d37933a02843ffb63e3/step-a33e4550.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/halloumi-falafel-houmous-and-paprika-butter-69710d37933a02843ffb63e3","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/halloumi-falafel-houmous-and-paprika-butter-69710d37933a02843ffb63e3","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"other","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["1","Medium Tomato"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1","Baby Cucumber"],["12 ml","Red Wine Vinegar"],["160 g","Falafel"],["15 g","Honey"],["25 g","Red Pepper Chilli Jelly"],["1 sachet","Smoked Paprika"],["20 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["100 g","Houmous"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["30 g","Butter"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"salmon-cucumber-rice-lunch","sourceId":"6967ce37850f974aa212e221","title":"Warming Spiced Charred Courgette, Lentil and Salmon Salad","subtitle":"with Roasted Sweet Potato and Homemade Croutons","time":45,"cost":20.33,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["discovery","world-flavors","dinner-bowls","pescatarian","caribbean","seafood","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Sieve","Bowl","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R14_W43_UK_V34667-3_edit_salmon_Main_high-24204af3.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/warming-spiced-charred-courgette-lentil-and-salmon-salad-6967ce37850f974aa212e221","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Sweet Potato"],["1 sachet","Caribbean Style Jerk"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1 carton","Lentils"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Courgette"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["30 g","Honey"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Sweet Potato"],["1 sachet","Caribbean Style Jerk"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1 carton","Lentils"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Courgette"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["30 g","Honey"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"555082a2f8b25e56468b4568","name":"Sweet Potato","type":"sweet potato","family":"potato","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweet Potato","marketLabel":"sweet potatoes 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58ada222043c3c07d63856e2","name":"Caribbean Style Jerk","type":"jerk-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Caribbean Style Jerk","marketLabel":"jerk seasoning equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837abf9f7d5496ac4a68097","name":"Lentils","type":"lentils","family":"none","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lentils","marketLabel":"lentils equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"30 ml","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"62fcaa09bd9a2478e193effe","name":"Salmon Fillets","type":"skin-on-salmon-fillet","family":"none","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salmon Fillets","marketLabel":"Scottish salmon fillets x2 240g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the sweet potato into 2cm chunks (no need to peel). Put the sweet potato chunks onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil and season with salt and pepper. Sprinkle over half the Caribbean style jerk, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. Turn halfway through. When the oven is hot, roast on the middle shelf until golden, 30-40 mins.","Meanwhile, tear the ciabatta into roughly 2cm chunks. Pop the ciabatta onto another baking tray in a single layer. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Set aside. Drain and rinse the lentils in a sieve. Halve the baby plum tomatoes. Trim the courgette and slice into 1cm thick rounds.","In a large bowl, combine the cider vinegar, honey and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Mix in the remaining Caribbean style jerk, then season with salt and pepper. If the measured honey is very thick, warm it briefly so it pours easily. Add the lentils and tomatoes to the dressing bowl and mix together. Set aside.","When the sweet potato has 15 mins roasting time remaining, lay the salmon fillets, skin-side down, onto a lined baking tray. Season with salt and pepper. Roast the salmon on the top shelf until cooked through, 10-15 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw fish. The fish is cooked when opaque in the middle. Pop the ciabatta tray onto the bottom shelf and bake until the croutons are golden, 10-12 mins.","In the meantime, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. Once hot, add the courgette and cook until charred, 3-4 mins each side. Cook in batches if necessary. Once cooked, season with salt and pepper, then remove from the heat and set aside.","Once ready, mix the sweet potato, croutons, charred courgette and rocket into the dressing bowl. Crumble in half the Greek style salad cheese and mix together. Taste and season with more salt and pepper if needed, then share between your serving bowls. Top with a salmon fillet. Crumble over the remaining cheese to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce37850f974aa212e221/step-66e2f000.jpg","caption":"Roast the Sweet Potato"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce37850f974aa212e221/step-d1ef5810.jpg","caption":"Prep the Rest"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce37850f974aa212e221/step-f3400520.jpg","caption":"Make the Dressing"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce37850f974aa212e221/step-174ad630.jpg","caption":"Bake the Croutons"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce37850f974aa212e221/step-762bb940.jpg","caption":"Char the Courgette"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce37850f974aa212e221/step-43a0b150.jpg","caption":"Assemble and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/warming-spiced-charred-courgette-lentil-and-salmon-salad-6967ce37850f974aa212e221","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/warming-spiced-charred-courgette-lentil-and-salmon-salad-6967ce37850f974aa212e221","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Sweet Potato"],["1 sachet","Caribbean Style Jerk"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1 carton","Lentils"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Courgette"],["30 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["30 g","Honey"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"chickpea-curry-rice-lunch","sourceId":"6967ce2d850f974aa212e212","title":"Crispy Smashed Sprout Chicken Caesar Style Salad","subtitle":"with Garlic Butter, Dried Cranberries, Ciabatta Croutons and Baby Gem","time":35,"cost":26.98,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["high protein","low carb","mothers-day","american","poultry","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Kettle","Medium Saucepan","Aluminum Foil","Bowl","Garlic Press","Colander","Kitchen Shears"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R49_W05_UK_V48826-3_Main_edit_chicken__high-64d21d5a.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/crispy-smashed-sprout-chicken-caesar-style-salad-6967ce2d850f974aa212e212","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["200 g","Brussels Sprouts"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["64 g","Mayonnaise"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["10 g","Wholegrain Mustard"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["30 g","Dried Cranberries"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["20 g","Butter"],["1.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["200 g","Brussels Sprouts"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["64 g","Mayonnaise"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["10 g","Wholegrain Mustard"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["30 g","Dried Cranberries"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["20 g","Butter"],["1.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a5e56f8b25ed7288b4576","name":"British Chicken Breasts","type":"chicken-fillet","family":"chicken","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Chicken Breasts","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"562690884dab71190f8b4567","name":"Brussels Sprouts","type":"brussels sprouts","family":"brussel sprout","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Brussels Sprouts","priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68ecc674fa624b85e8848c26","name":"Baby Gem Lettuce","type":"baby gem lettuce","family":"salad mix","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Gem Lettuce","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9d234dab7162138b4568","name":"Mayonnaise","type":"mayonnaise-tbsp","family":"mayonnaise","amount":"64 g","sourceAmount":64,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mayonnaise","marketLabel":"mayonnaise 500ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"15 ml","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c147a4dab71ac398b4567","name":"Wholegrain Mustard","type":"wholegrain mustard","family":"mustard","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wholegrain Mustard","marketLabel":"mustard 185g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55d34c9e79a23c465f8b4568","name":"Dried Cranberries","type":"dried cranberries","family":"fruit mix","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Dried Cranberries","marketLabel":"berries 300g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308142dc4b928197f3b3","name":"Crispy Onions","type":"crispy-onions","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Crispy Onions","marketLabel":"crispy onions 75g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":1.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Lay the chicken onto a baking tray, drizzle with oil and season. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. When the oven is hot, roast the chicken on the top shelf of your oven until cooked through, 25-30 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle. Remove the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) from your fridge and leave to one side to soften. Boil a full kettle. Trim the Brussels sprouts. Pour the boiled water into a medium saucepan with ¼ tsp salt and bring back to the boil. Add the Brussels sprouts and cook until tender, 6-8 mins.","Meanwhile, pop half the garlic (unpeeled) into a small piece of foil with a drizzle of oil and scrunch to enclose it. Roast the parcel until soft, 10-12 mins. Tear the ciabatta into roughly 2cm chunks. Pop the ciabatta onto a baking tray in a single layer. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat well. Bake the croutons on the middle shelf of your oven until golden, 8-10 mins, then remove from the oven and set aside.","Next, peel and grate the remaining garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve and peel the red onion, then cut each half into roughly 3cm wedges. Once the butter has softened slightly, pop into a small bowl and add the grated garlic. Use a fork to mash the garlic into the butter. Season with salt and pepper. Once the sprouts are cooked, drain in a colander.","Add the Brussels sprouts and onion wedges to a baking tray. Spread out in a single layer, then crush each sprout with the bottom of a cup. Drizzle with oil and season with salt and pepper. Roast on the top shelf until golden, 15-20 mins. Once the sprouts are cooked, add the garlic butter to the tray. Toss to coat the sprouts and onion in the butter.","Meanwhile, trim the baby gem, separate the leaves, then tear into bite-sized pieces. Once the roasted garlic has cooled, cut the end with scissors, squeeze it out of the skin and mash with a fork. In a large bowl, combine the mayo, cider vinegar, mustard (add less if you'd prefer), roasted garlic, half the hard Italian style cheese and the olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper.","When everything's ready, slice the chicken into 2cm thick slices. Add the baby gem, dried cranberries and roasted red onion to the Caesar style dressing. Toss together, then add the croutons and toss again. Share the salad between your serving bowls. Top with the sliced chicken and sprouts. Sprinkle over the remaining cheese and scatter over the crispy onions to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2d850f974aa212e212/step-8936b800.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2d850f974aa212e212/step-958c6110.jpg","caption":"Bake the Croutons"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2d850f974aa212e212/step-55f8f220.jpg","caption":"Make the Garlic Butter"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2d850f974aa212e212/step-e2c90430.jpg","caption":"Smash the Sprouts"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2d850f974aa212e212/step-544e8840.jpg","caption":"Time to Get Dressed"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2d850f974aa212e212/step-f2125450.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/crispy-smashed-sprout-chicken-caesar-style-salad-6967ce2d850f974aa212e212","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl