ue,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e74d9848b9dac04fc4a","name":"Walnuts","type":"walnuts","family":"nut mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Walnuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6061f8b25ed7288b4577","name":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","type":"pancetta","family":"pork","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"610d5147a6d0dbd6f1c32b40","name":"Sugar for the Onions","type":"sugar-for-the-onions-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Onions","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60f9470be5a270ab7dbce1b8","name":"Plain Flour","type":"plain-flour-1-tbsp","family":"flour","amount":"1.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":1.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Plain Flour","marketLabel":"plain flour 1.5kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"63ed1e1ee1f41b99b9ea84a0","name":"Water for the Soup","type":"water-for-the-soup-100ml","family":"none","amount":"400 ml","sourceAmount":400,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Soup","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Halve, peel and thinly slice the onions. Heat the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) in a large saucepan on medium-low heat. Once melted, add the onions and bacon, season with salt and pepper and fry, stirring occasionally, until golden, 23-25 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw meat. Cook bacon thoroughly. Add the sugar for the onions (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and cook until caramelised, 1-2 mins more.","Meanwhile, grate the Cheddar cheese. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Quarter, core and thinly slice the apple (no need to peel). Cut the ciabattas into 1cm slices.","In a large bowl, combine the cider vinegar, sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper.","Stir the garlic into the onions and fry for 1 min more. Next, stir in the flour (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and cook until it forms a paste, 1-2 mins - you've made a roux! Stir in the water for the soup (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) a little at a time, followed by the red wine stock paste, miso paste and dried thyme. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins.","Meanwhile, preheat your grill to high. Pop the ciabatta slices onto a medium baking tray. Drizzle with oil and sprinkle over the grated cheese. Grill until the bread is golden and the cheese has melted, 3-5 mins. Taste and season the soup if needed. Add a splash of water if it's a little too thick. Add the apple and baby leaves to the cider vinegar dressing and toss together.","Ladle the soup into your serving bowls. Top with the cheesy ciabatta toasts. Serve the apple and baby leaf salad alongside. Sprinkle the walnut pieces over the salad to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693adbedc92924105eca72e5/step-cac53600.jpg","caption":"Slow Cook the Onions"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693adbedc92924105eca72e5/step-2d673a10.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693adbedc92924105eca72e5/step-99850920.jpg","caption":"Make the Dressing"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693adbedc92924105eca72e5/step-a0deb830.jpg","caption":"Add the Flavour"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693adbedc92924105eca72e5/step-0c4d7d40.jpg","caption":"Final Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693adbedc92924105eca72e5/step-bf526e50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/french-onion-style-bacon-soup-and-cheesy-ciabatta-693adbedc92924105eca72e5","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/french-onion-style-bacon-soup-and-cheesy-ciabatta-693adbedc92924105eca72e5","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"sandwich","shoppingIngredients":[["4","Onion"],["130 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Apple"],["2","Ciabatta"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["15 g","Miso Paste"],["1 sachet","Dried Thyme"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["30 g","Butter"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Onions"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["400 ml","Water for the Soup"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work.","prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true},{"id":"lunch-hf-698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba","sourceId":"698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba","title":"Baked Camembert and Caramelised Onion Open Baguette","subtitle":"with Pommes Frites and Bistro Style Salad","time":45,"cost":20.29,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","classic-euro-dishes","handhelds","high protein","hellofresh specials","french","sandwich","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Pan","Garlic Press","Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R80_W41_UK_SUV45354-3_Main_high-4c96fe7f.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/baked-camembert-and-caramelised-onion-open-baguette-698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1","Onion"],["1","Apple"],["1","SlooOW Stone Oven White Baguette"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1 bunch","Chives"],["30 g","Onion Marmalade"],["250 g","French Camembert"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["20 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["15 g","Honey"],["20 g","Butter"],["1 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["as needed","olive oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1","Onion"],["1","Apple"],["1","SlooOW Stone Oven White Baguette"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1 bunch","Chives"],["30 g","Onion Marmalade"],["250 g","French Camembert"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["20 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["15 g","Honey"],["20 g","Butter"],["1 tbsp","Mayonnaise"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a59324dab71626c8b4575","name":"Onion","type":"onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Onion","marketLabel":"brown onions 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c34ebf8b25eb9658b4567","name":"Apple","type":"apple","family":"apple","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Apple","marketLabel":"crisp apples x6","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e2f42dc4b928197f137","name":"SlooOW Stone Oven White Baguette","type":"slooow-stone-oven-white-baguette","family":"none","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"SlooOW Stone Oven White Baguette","marketLabel":"bakery product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555cabbffd2cb92f6c8b456b","name":"Chives","type":"chives","family":"chive","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chives","marketLabel":"fresh chives 20g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5852bce27d69bf2b3f5a65e1","name":"Onion Marmalade","type":"original-onion-marmalade","family":"fruit preserves","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Onion Marmalade","marketLabel":"onion preserve equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5bcee5c9ae08b5419e33c772","name":"French Camembert","type":"french-camembert","family":"soft-ripened cheese","amount":"250 g","sourceAmount":250,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"French Camembert","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e74d9848b9dac04fc4a","name":"Walnuts","type":"walnuts","family":"nut mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Walnuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6099506c9c6d58742c5645ca","name":"Balsamic Glaze","type":"balsamic-glaze","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 g","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Balsamic Glaze","marketLabel":"balsamic glaze equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbe487e8afb1b135f069bd2","name":"Mayonnaise","type":"mayonnaise-tbsp","family":"mayonnaise","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Mayonnaise","marketLabel":"mayonnaise 500ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potatoes lengthways into 1cm slices, then chop into thin 1cm wide fries (no need to peel). Pop the fries onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, bake on the top shelf until golden, 25-30 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, halve, peel and thinly slice the onion. Quarter, core and thinly slice the apple (no need to peel). Heat a large frying pan on medium heat. Add the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and allow to melt, then add the onion and two thirds of the apple slices. Season with salt and pepper and fry, stirring occasionally, until the onion is golden and the apple has softened, 10-12 mins.","Meanwhile, pop the baguette onto a baking tray and bake on the middle shelf of your oven until toasted and golden, 8-10 mins. Next, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Roughly chop the chives (use scissors if easier). Once the onion and apple are caramelised and golden, stir in the garlic and onion marmalade. Fry for 1 min more, then remove from the heat.","Once the baguette is ready, remove from the oven, allow to cool for a few minutes, then slice in half lengthways. Spread the onion and apple mixture over the cut sides of the baguette. Cut the Camembert into slices. Lay them onto the baguette halves, then sprinkle over the walnuts. Pop the baguette halves back into the oven until the cheese has melted, 5-6 mins.","Meanwhile, pop the baby leaf mix and remaining apple into a medium bowl. Drizzle over the balsamic glaze and some olive oil, then season with salt and pepper and toss together.","Once ready, cut the baguettes in half and transfer to your plates. Drizzle over the honey and sprinkle with half the chives. If the measured honey is very thick, warm it briefly so it pours easily. Mix the remaining chives through the salad. Serve the open baguettes with the frites and salad alongside, along with the mayo (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) for dipping."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba/step-5207fb00.jpg","caption":"Make the Pommes Frites"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba/step-9373c910.jpg","caption":"Caramelise the Onion and Apple"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba/step-31ee5b20.jpg","caption":"Bake the Bread"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba/step-2fb27c30.jpg","caption":"Load the Baguette"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba/step-eee84b40.jpg","caption":"Assemble the Salad"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba/step-07788a50.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/baked-camembert-and-caramelised-onion-open-baguette-698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/baked-camembert-and-caramelised-onion-open-baguette-698caafb8e0d10536157d4ba","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"sandwich","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1","Onion"],["1","Apple"],["1","SlooOW Stone Oven White Baguette"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1 bunch","Chives"],["30 g","Onion Marmalade"],["250 g","French Camembert"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["20 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["15 g","Honey"],["20 g","Butter"],["1 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["as needed","olive oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-6996dc97726255bc32796495","sourceId":"6996dc97726255bc32796495","title":"Southwest Style Spiced Beef Penne","subtitle":"with Crispy Tortilla Chip Topping","time":25,"cost":17.46,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["discovery","cuisine-spotlight","quick","tex-mex","beef","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Kettle","Colander","Large Saucepan","Pan","Oven dish"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R12_W15_UK_QR54006-4_Main_high-abd6316a.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/southwest-style-spiced-beef-penne-6996dc97726255bc32796495","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["180 g","Penne Pasta"],["1","Courgette"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["10 g","Beef Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["200 g","Tortilla Chips"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["180 g","Penne Pasta"],["1","Courgette"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["10 g","Beef Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["200 g","Tortilla Chips"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"6879961b7299475a5b057874","name":"Penne Pasta","type":"penne-wheat","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Penne Pasta","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c1c67fd2cb99f468b4567","name":"British Beef Mince","type":"beef mince","family":"beef","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Beef Mince","marketLabel":"5% fat beef mince 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60002d416cea0c18f31958a1","name":"Beef Stock Paste","type":"beef-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Beef Stock Paste","marketLabel":"beef stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c89afa8e1c4145a37bc75f","name":"Mexican Style Spice Mix","type":"mexican-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mexican Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"674dd52a40f14c951049d634","name":"Tortilla Chips","type":"tortilla-chips","family":"none","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tortilla Chips","marketLabel":"tortilla product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Boil a full kettle. Pour the boiled water into a large saucepan with ½ tsp salt on high heat. Add the penne to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Meanwhile, trim the courgette, then halve lengthways. Slice widthways into 1cm thick pieces.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the beef mince and courgette. Fry until the mince has browned, 5-6 mins. Use a spoon to break up the mince as it cooks. When the mince has browned, drain and discard any excess fat. Season with salt and pepper. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Add the tomato puree, beef stock paste, Mexican style spice mix, creme fraiche, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) to the beef. Simmer, 3-4 mins. Season with salt and pepper. Meanwhile, lightly crush the tortilla chips in their bag. When the pasta is cooked, stir it into the Mexican spiced sauce.","Transfer the pasta to an appropriately sized ovenproof dish. Top with the crushed tortillas and sprinkle over the hard Italian style cheese. Add to the top shelf of the oven and bake until the cheese has melted, 5-8 mins.","Share the pasta bake between your serving bowls. Top with the rocket and drizzle over some oil to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc97726255bc32796495/step-76a2f500.jpg","caption":"Boil the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc97726255bc32796495/step-43db1610.jpg","caption":"Prep Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc97726255bc32796495/step-64a86e20.jpg","caption":"Get Frying"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc97726255bc32796495/step-6dd4f430.jpg","caption":"Build the Flavour"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc97726255bc32796495/step-56b26e40.jpg","caption":"Final Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dc97726255bc32796495/step-3758be50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/southwest-style-spiced-beef-penne-6996dc97726255bc32796495","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/southwest-style-spiced-beef-penne-6996dc97726255bc32796495","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["180 g","Penne Pasta"],["1","Courgette"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["10 g","Beef Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["200 g","Tortilla Chips"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-6996dce2726255bc32796525","sourceId":"6996dce2726255bc32796525","title":"Clean Machine Super Green Pesto Salmon Orzo","subtitle":"with Asparagus, Peas and Balsamic Drizzle","time":25,"cost":21.51,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","pescatarian","daddy’s dishes","italian","seafood","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Large Saucepan","Baking Paper","Garlic Press","Sieve","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R43_W20_UK_V17524-5_MAIN__12V17524-AP-1-1_var_high-0c57cdd1.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/primavera-salmon-pesto-orzo-6996dce2726255bc32796525","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["180 g","Orzo"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["60 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["180 g","Orzo"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["60 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"6837308242dc4b928197f3bc","name":"Orzo","type":"orzo","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Orzo","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a58da4dab71d76f8b4573","name":"Asparagus","type":"asparagus-bundles","family":"asparagus","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Asparagus","marketLabel":"fresh vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68c412723cfb117858763a9f","name":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","type":"basil-pesto-sauce","family":"none","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6099506c9c6d58742c5645ca","name":"Balsamic Glaze","type":"balsamic-glaze","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 g","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Balsamic Glaze","marketLabel":"balsamic glaze equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"62fcaa09bd9a2478e193effe","name":"Salmon Fillets","type":"skin-on-salmon-fillet","family":"none","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salmon Fillets","marketLabel":"Scottish salmon fillets x2 240g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt. Lay the salmon fillets, skin-side down, onto a lined baking tray. Season with salt and pepper. When the oven is hot, roast the salmon on the top shelf until cooked through, 10-15 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw fish. It's cooked when opaque in the middle. Meanwhile, when boiling, add the orzo to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 10 mins.","Meanwhile, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Trim the asparagus and cut into thirds.","The pasta has 3 mins cook time remaining, add the asparagus to the orzo and cook until tender, 2-3 mins. Once cooked, drain the pasta and asparagus in a sieve and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop the orzo sticking together.","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the garlic and fry until fragrant, 30 secs. Stir the creme fraiche, veg stock paste, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) into the pan. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins.","Once the sauce has thickened, stir the peas into the pan. Stir through the pesto, cheese and butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) until the cheese and butter have melted. Stir the cooked orzo and asparagus into the sauce until piping hot. Season with salt and pepper. Add a splash of water if you feel it needs it.","Share the creamy pesto orzo between your serving bowls. Top with the salmon. Drizzle over the balsamic glaze. Scrub Daddy's Top Scissors, Paper, Scrub - swap rock for sponge, but lose at best of three and you're washing up."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dce2726255bc32796525/step-ccf19600.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dce2726255bc32796525/step-93003e10.jpg","caption":"Prep the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dce2726255bc32796525/step-e1880c20.jpg","caption":"Blanch the Asparagus"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dce2726255bc32796525/step-95ffbd30.jpg","caption":"Creamy Sauce Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dce2726255bc32796525/step-66ed4740.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6996dce2726255bc32796525/step-795e0a50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/primavera-salmon-pesto-orzo-6996dce2726255bc32796525","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/primavera-salmon-pesto-orzo-6996dce2726255bc32796525","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["180 g","Orzo"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["15 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["60 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-698cab108e0d10536157d52c","sourceId":"698cab108e0d10536157d52c","title":"Black Sesame Crusted Salmon and Teriyaki Noodles","subtitle":"with Edamame, Green Beans and Sriracha Drizzle","time":25,"cost":15.23,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","calorie smart","pescatarian","high protein","healthy options","new","japanese","seafood","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Kettle","Baking Tray","Baking Paper","Sieve","Medium Saucepan","Large Frying Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R21_W16_UK_QR54219-3_RAN_HA_MAIN__Mainhigh-1d730815.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/black-sesame-crusted-salmon-and-teriyaki-noodles-698cab108e0d10536157d52c","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Lime"],["5 g","Black Sesame Seeds"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["80 g","Fresh Edamame Beans"],["100 g","Teriyaki Sauce"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Lime"],["5 g","Black Sesame Seeds"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["80 g","Fresh Edamame Beans"],["100 g","Teriyaki Sauce"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Honey"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"555080c2f8b25e4d4c8b4568","name":"Green Beans","type":"green beans","family":"beans","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Green Beans","marketLabel":"green beans 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837abf9f7d5496ac4a68089","name":"Black Sesame Seeds","type":"black-sesame-seeds","family":"sesame seed","amount":"5 g","sourceAmount":5,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Black Sesame Seeds","marketLabel":"sesame seeds 100g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"62fcaa09bd9a2478e193effe","name":"Salmon Fillets","type":"skin-on-salmon-fillet","family":"none","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salmon Fillets","marketLabel":"Scottish salmon fillets x2 240g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373080f7d5496ac4a65cdc","name":"Egg Noodle Nest","type":"egg-noodle-nest","family":"other noodle","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Egg Noodle Nest","marketLabel":"egg noodles 4 nests","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6908bfe548e7b2ec1b0ec551","name":"Fresh Edamame Beans","type":"fresh-edamame-beans","family":"none","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Fresh Edamame Beans","marketLabel":"fresh green vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"67f0611cb777f3317f54763f","name":"Teriyaki Sauce","type":"teriyaki-sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Teriyaki Sauce","marketLabel":"teriyaki sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"10 ml","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5c3f3eadc445fa4233599443","name":"Sriracha Sauce","type":"sriracha (anchovy)","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"16 ml","sourceAmount":16,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sriracha Sauce","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Boil a full kettle for the noodles. While it comes to the boil, trim and halve the green beans. Cut the lime into wedges.","Pour the black sesame seeds onto a plate. Firmly press the salmon fillets, flesh-side down, into the seeds. Ensure they stick evenly. Lay the salmon fillets, skin-side down, onto a lined baking tray. Drizzle over some oil and season with salt and pepper. When the oven is hot, roast the salmon on the top shelf until cooked through, 10-15 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw fish. It's cooked when opaque in the middle.","Meanwhile, pour the boiled water from your kettle into a medium saucepan with ½ tsp salt and bring to the boil. Add the noodles and green beans and cook until tender, 4 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and run under cold water to stop the noodles sticking together.","Once the noodles and beans are cooked and drained, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the edamame and stir-fry until warmed through, 30 secs.","Next, add the teriyaki sauce, soy sauce, honey (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and cooked noodles to the edamame. Mix well so the noodles are coated in the sauce. Cook until heated through, 1 min, then remove from the heat. Squeeze in some lime juice. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed.","Share the noodles out between your bowls and lay the sesame crusted salmon fillets on top. Drizzle over the sriracha sauce. Serve any remaining lime wedges on the side for squeezing over."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698cab108e0d10536157d52c/step-1936ea00.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698cab108e0d10536157d52c/step-fcb40910.jpg","caption":"Bake the Salmon"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698cab108e0d10536157d52c/step-dfa2b620.jpg","caption":"Cook the Noodles and Beans"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698cab108e0d10536157d52c/step-3204cd30.jpg","caption":"Time for Edamame"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698cab108e0d10536157d52c/step-57816340.jpg","caption":"Mix Together"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698cab108e0d10536157d52c/step-0b503250.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/black-sesame-crusted-salmon-and-teriyaki-noodles-698cab108e0d10536157d52c","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/black-sesame-crusted-salmon-and-teriyaki-noodles-698cab108e0d10536157d52c","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Lime"],["5 g","Black Sesame Seeds"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["80 g","Fresh Edamame Beans"],["100 g","Teriyaki Sauce"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630","sourceId":"698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630","title":"Creamy Mexican Style Spiced Orzo","subtitle":"with Spinach, Peas and Greek Style Cheese","time":25,"cost":15.16,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","quick","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","italian","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Sieve","Medium Saucepan","Kettle","Garlic Press","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R51_W50_UK_V17531-5_Main_high-26f1b21f.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-mexican-style-spiced-orzo-698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["180 g","Orzo"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["180 g","Orzo"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"6837308242dc4b928197f3bc","name":"Orzo","type":"orzo","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Orzo","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c89afa8e1c4145a37bc75f","name":"Mexican Style Spice Mix","type":"mexican-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mexican Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5f327c6560efd3453038c2a8","name":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","type":"sundried-tomato-paste-duplicate","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","marketLabel":"sun-dried tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a full kettle. Pour the boiled water into a medium saucepan with ½ tsp salt and bring to a boil. Add the orzo to the water and cook until tender, 10 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Meanwhile, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press).","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium heat. Once hot, add the garlic, Mexican style spice mix and tomato puree. Cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.","Add the veg stock paste, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) to the pan. Stir to combine, bring to the boil and simmer, 1 min. Add the peas and spinach to the pan a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins.","Stir the creme fraiche and sun-dried tomato paste into the sauce until combined. Bring to the boil, then remove from the heat. Once cooked, add the orzo to the pan and toss to coat in the sauce. Stir through the hard Italian style cheese until melted. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed. Add a splash of water if it's a little too thick.","When ready, share the creamy orzo between your bowls. Crumble over the Greek style salad cheese to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630/step-2ea73f00.jpg","caption":"Cook the Orzo"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630/step-ba000a10.jpg","caption":"Prep the Garlic"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630/step-1a1fe520.jpg","caption":"Bring on the Flavour"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630/step-5467b430.jpg","caption":"Simmer and Stir"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630/step-bfe56c40.jpg","caption":"Add the Rest"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630/step-a1b26350.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-mexican-style-spiced-orzo-698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-mexican-style-spiced-orzo-698caab1ca20a4fa52b3d630","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["180 g","Orzo"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Mexican Style Spice Mix"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Peas"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-698caabc8e0d10536157d36d","sourceId":"698caabc8e0d10536157d36d","title":"Easy Peasy Chicken, Bacon and Pea Pesto Spaghetti","subtitle":"with Cavolo Nero and Italian Style Cheese","time":15,"cost":20.49,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["super quick","family friendly","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","high protein","italian","poultry","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Medium Saucepan","Kettle","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R13_W17_UK_UQ16085-19_Main_Add_Chicken_Breast_diced_edit_high-89d20368.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/easy-peasy-chicken-bacon-and-pea-pesto-spaghetti-698caabc8e0d10536157d36d","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["180 g","Spaghetti"],["100 g","Chopped Cavolo Nero"],["60 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["120 g","Peas"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"]],"sourceIngredients":[["180 g","Spaghetti"],["100 g","Chopped Cavolo Nero"],["60 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["120 g","Peas"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"68373082f7d5496ac4a65cf3","name":"Spaghetti","type":"spaghetti (wheat)","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Spaghetti","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"61b09940e08a1c53e11dc537","name":"Chopped Cavolo Nero","type":"chopped-cavolo-nero","family":"kale","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chopped Cavolo Nero","marketLabel":"curly kale 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6061f8b25ed7288b4577","name":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","type":"pancetta","family":"pork","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea605fc26d5313f23d2","name":"Diced British Chicken Breast","type":"chicken-breast-diced","family":"none","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced British Chicken Breast","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68c412723cfb117858763a9f","name":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","type":"basil-pesto-sauce","family":"none","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a full kettle. Pour it into a saucepan with ½ tsp salt on high heat. Boil the spaghetti, 8 mins. When the pasta has boiled for 5 mins, add the cavolo nero. Once cooked, drain and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through.","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan on medium-high heat. Fry the chicken and bacon, 5-6 mins. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw meat. Cook bacon thoroughly.","Next, drain any excess fat from the pan. Pop back on medium-high heat (no need to clean). Stir in the veg stock paste, creme fraiche and water (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Simmer, 3-4 mins. Cook so there's no pink in the middle of the chicken. Stir the cooked pasta and cavolo nero into the sauce. Mix to combine. Remove from the heat.","Stir the peas, pesto and two thirds of the hard Italian style cheese into the pasta. Toss to coat. Share between your bowls. Sprinkle over the remaining cheese to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabc8e0d10536157d36d/step-02f7b200.jpg","caption":"Cook Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabc8e0d10536157d36d/step-5f7ab210.jpg","caption":"Fry Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabc8e0d10536157d36d/step-93b43b20.jpg","caption":"Sauce Up"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/698caabc8e0d10536157d36d/step-a8bcbc30.jpg","caption":"Dinner's Ready!"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/easy-peasy-chicken-bacon-and-pea-pesto-spaghetti-698caabc8e0d10536157d36d","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/easy-peasy-chicken-bacon-and-pea-pesto-spaghetti-698caabc8e0d10536157d36d","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["180 g","Spaghetti"],["100 g","Chopped Cavolo Nero"],["60 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["120 g","Peas"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-69710d02933a02843ffb6395","sourceId":"69710d02933a02843ffb6395","title":"Creamy Garlicky Mussel and Prawn Linguine","subtitle":"with Balsamic Dressed Salad","time":30,"cost":28.06,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["pescatarian","high protein","french","seafood","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Large Bowl","Garlic Press","Colander","Large Saucepan","Lid"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R23_W06_UK_R52248-3_Main_4_52248-AP-1-1_var_high-c3c9e900.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-garlicky-mussel-and-prawn-linguine-69710d02933a02843ffb6395","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Echalion Shallot"],["1 bunch","Flat Leaf Parsley"],["4","Garlic Clove"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["500 g","Mussels"],["180 g","Linguine"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["30 g","Butter"],["as needed","olive oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Echalion Shallot"],["1 bunch","Flat Leaf Parsley"],["4","Garlic Clove"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["500 g","Mussels"],["180 g","Linguine"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["30 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5568817d4dab71121f8b4568","name":"Echalion Shallot","type":"echalion shallot","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Echalion Shallot","marketLabel":"brown onions 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5904fd2cb9324b8b4575","name":"Flat Leaf Parsley","type":"flat leaf parsley","family":"parsley","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Flat Leaf Parsley","marketLabel":"fresh parsley 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"4","sourceAmount":4,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68c938b57def2b4cd5cdcb50","name":"Mussels","type":"mussels","family":"none","amount":"500 g","sourceAmount":500,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mussels","marketLabel":"shellfish equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373081d9848b9dac050010","name":"Linguine","type":"linguine","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Linguine","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6099506c9c6d58742c5645ca","name":"Balsamic Glaze","type":"balsamic-glaze","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 g","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Balsamic Glaze","marketLabel":"balsamic glaze equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the pasta. Halve, peel and chop the shallot into small pieces. Roughly chop the parsley (stalks and all). Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the baby plum tomatoes. Put the tomatoes and baby leaves in a large bowl and set aside for later. Drain and rinse the mussels in a colander. Discard any broken shell pieces. If you prefer your mussels shelled, carefully open the shells and gently pick out the mussels. Otherwise, if you're happy to serve them with shells, leave them as is. Drain the prawns in their packet. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw prawns.","When your pan of water is boiling, add the linguine to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in another large saucepan with a tight-fitting lid on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the shallot and cook until softened, 3-4 mins. Add the garlic and fry for 30 secs.","Stir the water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients), vegetable stock paste, drained prawns and mussels into the shallot pan. Bring to the boil. Pop a lid on and cook until piping hot, 5-6 mins. The prawns are cooked when pink on the outside and opaque in the middle. When the mussels and prawns are cooked, using a slotted spoon, carefully remove the mussels and prawns from the sauce and transfer to a medium bowl. Cover to keep warm. Mussels served in shell, beware of sharp edges or broken shell. Discard any unopened mussels. Ensure they're piping hot throughout.","Stir the creme fraiche, butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and half the parsley into the saucepan with the sauce. Simmer until piping hot, 1-2 mins. Stir the drained linguine and grated hard Italian style cheese into the sauce until well combined. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed. Add a splash of water if you feel it needs it.","When everything's ready, add the balsamic glaze and a drizzle of olive oil to the tomatoes and leaves. Toss together. Share the creamy linguine between your bowls. Top with the mussels, prawns and remaining parsley. Serve the salad on the side."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d02933a02843ffb6395/step-0d06f000.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d02933a02843ffb6395/step-82bcff10.jpg","caption":"Linguine Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d02933a02843ffb6395/step-9b39fb20.jpg","caption":"Start the Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d02933a02843ffb6395/step-0393c530.jpg","caption":"Flex those Mussels"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d02933a02843ffb6395/step-5f668f40.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d02933a02843ffb6395/step-8f20ff50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-garlicky-mussel-and-prawn-linguine-69710d02933a02843ffb6395","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-garlicky-mussel-and-prawn-linguine-69710d02933a02843ffb6395","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Echalion Shallot"],["1 bunch","Flat Leaf Parsley"],["4","Garlic Clove"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["500 g","Mussels"],["180 g","Linguine"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["30 g","Butter"],["as needed","olive oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1","sourceId":"69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1","title":"Creamy Lemon Honey Chicken Breast Linguine","subtitle":"with Baby Spinach, Peas and Cheese","time":30,"cost":18.45,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","easter","high protein","italian","poultry","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Zester","Garlic Press","Large Saucepan","Bowl","Baking Tray","Colander","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R15_W15_UK_F1964-15_MT_Main_F1964-SP-1-15_var_high-93f0cb7a.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-lemon-honey-chicken-breast-linguine-69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["0.5","Lemon"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["180 g","Linguine"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["100 g","Baby Spinach"],["120 g","Peas"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["0.5","Lemon"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["180 g","Linguine"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["100 g","Baby Spinach"],["120 g","Peas"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"0.5","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea605fc26d5313f23d2","name":"Diced British Chicken Breast","type":"chicken-breast-diced","family":"none","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced British Chicken Breast","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373081d9848b9dac050010","name":"Linguine","type":"linguine","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Linguine","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60002d898c8c0a188200a96d","name":"Chicken Stock Paste","type":"chicken-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chicken Stock Paste","marketLabel":"chicken stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the linguine. Zest and halve the lemon. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press).","Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. In a bowl, add the chicken, honey (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) a drizzle of oil, season with salt and pepper, mix to combine. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Pop the chicken onto a lined tray. When the oven is hot, bake the chicken on the top shelf until slightly golden and cooked through, 12-15 mins.","While the chicken cooks, add the linguine to the pan of boiling water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. When the pasta is cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Return the (now empty) frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. Add the garlic and fry for 30 secs. Add the lemon zest, chicken stock paste and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) to the pan. Bring to the boil, then lower the heat and simmer until the sauce has reduced slightly, 3-4 mins. Add the spinach a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins. Add a good squeeze of lemon juice, then stir through the peas, creme fraiche and hard Italian style cheese until piping hot and melted, 2-3 mins. Add the cooked pasta to the sauce. Toss together to coat well.","Share the creamy linguine between your bowls and top with the chicken."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1/step-c4cbe300.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1/step-6d4e2a10.jpg","caption":"Season the Chicken"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1/step-236d6f20.jpg","caption":"Into the Oven"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1/step-14ed9f30.jpg","caption":"Cook the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1/step-9efbdb40.jpg","caption":"Start the Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1/step-2e836150.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-lemon-honey-chicken-breast-linguine-69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-lemon-honey-chicken-breast-linguine-69838f49a9a0ce52d27f07f1","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["0.5","Lemon"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["180 g","Linguine"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["100 g","Baby Spinach"],["120 g","Peas"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-69710d38384e652ce6a5004b","sourceId":"69710d38384e652ce6a5004b","title":"Fragrant Yellow Thai Style Halloumi Curry & Sticky Rice","subtitle":"with Baby Corn, Pea Pods, Chilli and Lime","time":30,"cost":16.51,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","new","south/southeastasian","dinner-bowls","medium spice","thai","rice","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Sieve","Medium Saucepan","Kettle","Lid","Pan","Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R28_W27_UK_V38179-3_Main_high-c236a6cb.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fragrant-yellow-thai-style-halloumi-curry-and-sticky-rice-69710d38384e652ce6a5004b","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["150 g","Sushi Rice"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["60 g","Baby Corn"],["80 g","Young Pea Pods"],["1","Lime"],["1","Red Chilli"],["1 sachet","Thai Style Spice Mix"],["45 g","Yellow Thai Style Paste"],["180 ml","Coconut Milk"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["300 ml","Boiled Water for the Rice"],["1 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"]],"sourceIngredients":[["150 g","Sushi Rice"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["60 g","Baby Corn"],["80 g","Young Pea Pods"],["1","Lime"],["1","Red Chilli"],["1 sachet","Thai Style Spice Mix"],["45 g","Yellow Thai Style Paste"],["180 ml","Coconut Milk"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["300 ml","Boiled Water for the Rice"],["1 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"610cfdedaa24686fa96b6f52","name":"Sushi Rice","type":"sushi-rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sushi Rice","marketLabel":"rice equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55686e0bf8b25e15418b4567","name":"Halloumi","type":"halloumi","family":"hard cheese","amount":"225 g","sourceAmount":225,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Halloumi","marketLabel":"Cypriot halloumi 225g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556876f2fd2cb983298b4569","name":"Baby Corn","type":"baby corn","family":"corn","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Corn","marketLabel":"fresh vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"66d08ea0a3a9934710b37319","name":"Young Pea Pods","type":"young-pea-pods","family":"none","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Young Pea Pods","marketLabel":"fresh green vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"597f3bd22c3e0823ee548883","name":"Red Chilli","type":"red-chilli","family":"chili","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Chilli","marketLabel":"red chillies x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632e48e82e3a699175a1b012","name":"Thai Style Spice Mix","type":"thai-spice-blend","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Thai Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6762b662afc243b64a9fbac6","name":"Yellow Thai Style Paste","type":"yellow-curry-paste","family":"spice blend","amount":"45 g","sourceAmount":45,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Yellow Thai Style Paste","marketLabel":"curry paste jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a62e1f8b25eef3e8b4567","name":"Coconut Milk","type":"coconut milk","family":"canned coconut milk","amount":"180 ml","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Coconut Milk","marketLabel":"coconut milk 400ml tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"10 ml","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"61f967e87f9b41760f4d2294","name":"Boiled Water for the Rice","type":"boiled-water-for-the-rice-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"300 ml","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Boiled Water for the Rice","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60f9470be5a270ab7dbce1b8","name":"Plain Flour","type":"plain-flour-1-tbsp","family":"flour","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Plain Flour","marketLabel":"plain flour 1.5kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Drain the halloumi, then cut it into 2cm chunks. Place them into a small bowl of cold water and leave to soak. Boil a half-full kettle. Thoroughly rinse the sushi rice under cold water in a sieve until it runs clear.","Pour the boiled water for the rice (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) into a medium saucepan, bring back to the boil on high heat. Stir in the sushi rice and turn the heat down to low.","Meanwhile, remove the halloumi from the cold water, pop them onto a plate lined with kitchen paper and pat dry. Heat a large non-stick frying pan on high heat with a drizzle of oil. Once hot, fry the halloumi, 6-7 mins. Turn frequently.","While the halloumi fries, halve the baby corn lengthways, then halve again widthways. Halve the pea pods widthways. Cut the lime into quarters. Thinly slice the red chilli. Once the halloumi is crispy, pop it in a bowl and set aside for later. Put the (now empty) pan back on medium-high heat with a drizzle more oil. Once hot, add the Thai style spice mix, baby corn, pea pods and half the chilli. Stir-fry until starting to go tender, 1-2 mins.","Once the veg is slightly tender, stir in the yellow Thai style paste and stir-fry until fragrant, 30 secs. Stir in the coconut milk, soy, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to a boil, then lower the heat and simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins. Once thickened, remove from the heat. Stir in the halloumi and squeeze in some lime juice. Taste and season with salt, pepper and more lime juice if you feel it needs it.","When everything's ready, press your rice into small bowls, then carefully turn out onto the centre of your serving plates. Spoon the halloumi curry around the rice. Sprinkle over the remaining chilli (add less if you'd prefer things milder). Serve any remaining lime wedges alongside for squeezing over."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d38384e652ce6a5004b/step-276e9c00.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d38384e652ce6a5004b/step-ecd95010.jpg","caption":"Cook the Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d38384e652ce6a5004b/step-83bb2320.jpg","caption":"Fry the Halloumi"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d38384e652ce6a5004b/step-71499f30.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d38384e652ce6a5004b/step-6235db40.jpg","caption":"Add the Flavour"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d38384e652ce6a5004b/step-a94ef250.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fragrant-yellow-thai-style-halloumi-curry-and-sticky-rice-69710d38384e652ce6a5004b","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fragrant-yellow-thai-style-halloumi-curry-and-sticky-rice-69710d38384e652ce6a5004b","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["150 g","Sushi Rice"],["225 g","Halloumi"],["60 g","Baby Corn"],["80 g","Young Pea Pods"],["1","Lime"],["1","Red Chilli"],["1 sachet","Thai Style Spice Mix"],["45 g","Yellow Thai Style Paste"],["180 ml","Coconut Milk"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["300 ml","Boiled Water for the Rice"],["1 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0","sourceId":"697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0","title":"Creamy Salmon, King Prawn and Dill Linguine","subtitle":"with Peas and Baby Leaf Salad","time":35,"cost":17.69,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["pescatarian","regional-specialty","pasta-noodles","high protein","customer favourites","hellofresh specials","british","seafood","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Zester","Garlic Press","Large Saucepan","Baking Tray","Baking Paper","Colander","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R45_W30_UK_SU11799-12_Main_high-ebe68b43.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-salmon-king-prawn-and-dill-linguine-697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 bunch","Dill"],["0.5","Lemon"],["300 g","Salmon Fillets"],["180 g","Linguine"],["120 g","Peas"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","olive oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 bunch","Dill"],["0.5","Lemon"],["300 g","Salmon Fillets"],["180 g","Linguine"],["120 g","Peas"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555081a74dab718e128b4568","name":"Dill","type":"dill","family":"dill","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Dill","marketLabel":"herb equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"0.5","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e285ffbe63f0f7cad20bdac","name":"Salmon Fillets","type":"salmon-fillet","family":"Fish","amount":"300 g","sourceAmount":300,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salmon Fillets","marketLabel":"Scottish salmon fillets x2 240g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373081d9848b9dac050010","name":"Linguine","type":"linguine","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Linguine","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the linguine. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Roughly chop the dill (stalks and all). Zest and halve the lemon (use the amount listed in the ingredients).","Lay the salmon fillets, skin-side down, onto a lined baking tray. Drizzle with oil, then season with salt and pepper. Sprinkle over the lemon zest. When the oven is hot, roast the salmon on the top shelf until cooked through, 10-15 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw fish. It's cooked when opaque in the middle. Once cooked, remove from your oven.","While the salmon bakes, add the linguine to the pan of boiling water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Add the peas for the final min of cooking. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","While the pasta cooks, drain the prawns. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the prawns. Season with salt and pepper and stir-fry for 4-5 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw prawns. They're cooked when pink on the outside and opaque in the middle. Add the garlic and fry for 30 secs. Stir in the veg stock paste and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients), then bring to the boil. Simmer until reduced slightly, 2-3 mins.","Stir the creme fraiche into the sauce, bring back to the boil, then remove from the heat. Stir through three quarters of the dill and add a squeeze of lemon juice. Season with salt and pepper. Add the cooked peas and pasta to your pan of creamy sauce, then stir to combine. Taste and add more salt, pepper and lemon juice if needed.","Once the salmon is cooked, gently peel off and discard the skin. Using a fork, flake the fish into bite-sized pieces. Add the flaked salmon to your creamy pasta and gently stir to combine. Add a splash of water if it's a little thick. Share the pasta between your bowls and sprinkle over the remaining dill. Serve the baby leaf salad on the side, drizzling a little olive oil over the leaves to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0/step-f161d800.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0/step-30b46210.jpg","caption":"Bake the Salmon"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0/step-0553b720.jpg","caption":"Pasta Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0/step-585a2730.jpg","caption":"Make your Prawn Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0/step-93a98140.jpg","caption":"Combine and Stir"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0/step-2b469c50.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-salmon-king-prawn-and-dill-linguine-697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-salmon-king-prawn-and-dill-linguine-697a57105e3727e7e580e9e0","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 bunch","Dill"],["0.5","Lemon"],["300 g","Salmon Fillets"],["180 g","Linguine"],["120 g","Peas"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","olive oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-69710d40384e652ce6a50061","sourceId":"69710d40384e652ce6a50061","title":"Pesto Pulled Chicken Orzo","subtitle":"with Spinach, Peas and Cheese","time":45,"cost":17.7,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["calorie smart","classic-euro-dishes","dinner-bowls","high protein","healthy options","low carb","european","poultry","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Large Saucepan","Garlic Press","Lid"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R58_W13_UK_R39487-8_Main_high-2a8f7ae7.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/pesto-pulled-chicken-orzo-69710d40384e652ce6a50061","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["120 g","Orzo"],["20 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["120 g","Peas"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["600 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["120 g","Orzo"],["20 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["120 g","Peas"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["600 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a5e56f8b25ed7288b4576","name":"British Chicken Breasts","type":"chicken-fillet","family":"chicken","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Chicken Breasts","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59ad32ea2c3e08228606b422","name":"Central American Style Spice Mix","type":"central-american-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Central American Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308242dc4b928197f3bc","name":"Orzo","type":"orzo","family":"other noodle","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Orzo","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60002d898c8c0a188200a96d","name":"Chicken Stock Paste","type":"chicken-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chicken Stock Paste","marketLabel":"chicken stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68c412723cfb117858763a9f","name":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","type":"basil-pesto-sauce","family":"none","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"600 ml","sourceAmount":600,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Heat a large saucepan on medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. Once hot, add the chicken breasts and cook for 2 mins on each side, until browned all over. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken. Once cooked, remove the chicken to a plate and set aside.","While the chicken fries, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Once you've removed the chicken from the saucepan, add the garlic and Central American style spice mix to the pan with a drizzle of oil if needed and season with salt and pepper. Fry for 1 min. Add the orzo to the pan and stir until coated, 1 min.","Pour the water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) into the saucepan. Add the chicken stock paste and season with salt and pepper. Bring to the boil, then lower the heat to medium. Return the chicken to the pan. Cover the pan with a lid. Simmer until the chicken is cooked, 15-20 mins, stirring halfway. The chicken is cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Once the chicken and orzo are cooked, add the spinach to the pan a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins. Next, stir in the peas.","Once cooked, remove the pan from the heat and transfer the chicken to a plate. Use two forks to shred the chicken into small pieces. Add the pulled chicken back to the pan. Stir in the pesto and hard Italian style cheese. Taste the sauce and season with salt and pepper if needed.","Share your pulled chicken and pesto orzo between your serving bowls."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d40384e652ce6a50061/step-6f4a9900.jpg","caption":"Brown the Chicken"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d40384e652ce6a50061/step-c22a7a10.jpg","caption":"Fry the Garlic"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d40384e652ce6a50061/step-bfb96120.jpg","caption":"Simmer Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d40384e652ce6a50061/step-e43b8730.jpg","caption":"Add the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d40384e652ce6a50061/step-adc6b740.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d40384e652ce6a50061/step-2b85ef50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/pesto-pulled-chicken-orzo-69710d40384e652ce6a50061","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/pesto-pulled-chicken-orzo-69710d40384e652ce6a50061","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["120 g","Orzo"],["20 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["120 g","Peas"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["600 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890","sourceId":"697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890","title":"Spanakopita Inspired Creamy Prawn, Lemon and Dill Orzo","subtitle":"with Courgette, Peas and Greek Style Cheese","time":25,"cost":20.35,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","pescatarian","high protein","greek","seafood","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Pan","Large Saucepan","Colander"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R17_W12_UK_QV32191-3_edit_Main_prawns_edit_high-60d0a85c.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spanakopita-inspired-creamy-prawn-lemon-and-dill-orzo-697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lemon"],["1","Leek"],["1","Courgette"],["1 bunch","Dill"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["180 g","Orzo"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lemon"],["1","Leek"],["1","Courgette"],["1 bunch","Dill"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["180 g","Orzo"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e334dab71a9058b4567","name":"Leek","type":"leek","family":"leek","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Leek","marketLabel":"leeks 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555081a74dab718e128b4568","name":"Dill","type":"dill","family":"dill","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Dill","marketLabel":"herb equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308242dc4b928197f3bc","name":"Orzo","type":"orzo","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Orzo","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"691c9f53bc8059f9ea10a506","name":"White Wine Stock Powder","type":"white-wine-stock-powder","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"White Wine Stock Powder","marketLabel":"vegetable stock concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"150 ml","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the lemon and cut into wedges. Trim the root and dark green leafy part from the leek and discard. Halve lengthways, then thinly slice. Trim the courgette, then quarter lengthways. Chop widthways into 1cm pieces. Roughly chop the dill (stalks and all).","Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the orzo. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Drain the prawns. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw prawns. Once the pan is hot, add the prawns, courgette and leek. Fry until the prawns are cooked and the veg has browned on the outside and softened, 6-7 mins. The prawns are cooked when pink on the outside and opaque in the middle.","While the prawns and veg cook, and once boiling, add the orzo to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 10 mins. Once the veg has softened and the prawns are cooked, add the garlic to the frying pan and fry for 1 min more.","Stir the creme fraiche, white wine stock powder and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) into the veg. Bring to a boil, then lower the heat and simmer until thickened slightly, 2-3 mins. Meanwhile, once your orzo is cooked, drain in a colander. Transfer your orzo back into the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Once the sauce has thickened, stir in the peas and Italian style cheese. Stir in the cooked orzo and half the dill. Add a splash more water if you feel it needs it. Squeeze in some lemon juice, then remove from the heat. Season with salt and pepper.","Share the pasta between your bowls. Crumble over the Greek style salad cheese and sprinkle on the remaining dill. Serve with any remaining lemon wedges on the side for squeezing over."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890/step-8f2f6a00.jpg","caption":"Start the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890/step-c308a710.jpg","caption":"Fry the Prawns and Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890/step-12db4e20.jpg","caption":"Cook the Orzo"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890/step-58b48b30.jpg","caption":"Simmer the Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890/step-9bd52c40.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890/step-e4fea150.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spanakopita-inspired-creamy-prawn-lemon-and-dill-orzo-697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spanakopita-inspired-creamy-prawn-lemon-and-dill-orzo-697a56c1bcdfd65d69c37890","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lemon"],["1","Leek"],["1","Courgette"],["1 bunch","Dill"],["160 g","King Prawns"],["180 g","Orzo"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["120 g","Peas"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["150 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-69710d36933a02843ffb63e1","sourceId":"69710d36933a02843ffb63e1","title":"Chermoula Chicken & Courgette on Couscous","subtitle":"with Pickled Onion, Coriander Yoghurt and Pineapple Chutney","time":25,"cost":27.71,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","world-flavors","dinner-bowls","under 650 kcal","medium spice","high protein","calorie smart","healthy options","fusion","grain"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Bowl","Garlic Press","Kettle","Medium Saucepan","Lid","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R28_W32_UK_QV40761-3_edit_Main_high-b7f2ab56.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chermoula-chicken-and-courgette-on-couscous-69710d36933a02843ffb63e1","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Red Onion"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["12 ml","Red Wine Vinegar"],["1","Courgette"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["120 g","Couscous"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1 bunch","Coriander"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["40 g","Pineapple Chutney"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Red Onion"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["12 ml","Red Wine Vinegar"],["1","Courgette"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["120 g","Couscous"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1 bunch","Coriander"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["40 g","Pineapple Chutney"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555ca1774dab7190138b4568","name":"Red Wine Vinegar","type":"red wine vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 ml","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Wine Vinegar","marketLabel":"cooking vinegar equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea605fc26d5313f23d2","name":"Diced British Chicken Breast","type":"chicken-breast-diced","family":"none","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced British Chicken Breast","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"566af3d3f8b25e717b8b4567","name":"Chermoula Spice Mix","type":"chermoula-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chermoula Spice Mix","marketLabel":"chermoula seasoning","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837302fd9848b9dac04ffc1","name":"Couscous","type":"couscous-duplicate","family":"grains","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Couscous","marketLabel":"couscous 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5f54fd2cb99c598b4567","name":"Coriander","type":"coriander","family":"coriander","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Coriander","marketLabel":"fresh coriander 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a56e74dab71d76f8b4570","name":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","type":"natural-yoghurt","family":"yogurt","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","marketLabel":"yoghurts pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"672cce33b88de70de2e9fef6","name":"Pineapple Chutney","type":"pineapple-chutney","family":"none","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Pineapple Chutney","marketLabel":"chutney jar equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e3416f081143769dd33ba49","name":"Sugar for the Pickle","type":"sugar-for-the-pickle-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Pickle","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"616ef1f4cfc8aa52d7b2bd62","name":"Water for the Couscous","type":"water-for-the-couscous","family":"other drink","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Couscous","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a full kettle for the couscous. Halve, peel and thinly slice the red onion. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). In a medium bowl, combine the red wine vinegar and sugar for the pickle (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Add a third of the sliced onion. Mix and set aside.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a deep saucepan (with a tight-fitting lid) on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the remaining onion to the pan and stir-fry until softened, 4-5 mins. Add the garlic and half the chermoula and fry for 1 min more. Stir in the couscous until coated, 30 secs. Stir in the veg stock paste and water for the couscous (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and bring to the boil. When boiling, remove from the heat, stir in the couscous and pop a lid on the pan. Leave to the side for 8-10 mins or until ready to serve.","Meanwhile, trim the courgette and halve it lengthways. Chop widthways into 1cm slices. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. When hot, add the diced chicken and courgette and cook, 8-10 mins total. Turn only every couple of mins. Sprinkle over the remaining chermoula. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw meat. Cook so there's no pink in the middle. Once cooked, season with salt and pepper, then remove to a bowl and wipe out the pan.","While the chicken fries, halve the baby plum tomatoes. Roughly chop the coriander (stalks and all).","In a small bowl, mix half the coriander with the Greek style yoghurt. Season with salt and pepper.","Fluff up the couscous with a fork and stir through the tomatoes and remaining coriander. Share between bowls. Top with your courgette and chicken. Drizzle over the coriander yoghurt and pineapple chutney. Scatter over the pickled onion."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d36933a02843ffb63e1/step-1897e200.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d36933a02843ffb63e1/step-bca9d410.jpg","caption":"Cook the Onion"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d36933a02843ffb63e1/step-198fe220.jpg","caption":"Fry Up"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d36933a02843ffb63e1/step-fef4a430.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d36933a02843ffb63e1/step-5cc77640.jpg","caption":"Mix the Yoghurt"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d36933a02843ffb63e1/step-fc363250.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chermoula-chicken-and-courgette-on-couscous-69710d36933a02843ffb63e1","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chermoula-chicken-and-courgette-on-couscous-69710d36933a02843ffb63e1","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"grain","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Red Onion"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["12 ml","Red Wine Vinegar"],["1","Courgette"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["120 g","Couscous"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1 bunch","Coriander"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["40 g","Pineapple Chutney"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab","sourceId":"697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab","title":"One Pot Tandoori Chicken and Curried Couscous","subtitle":"with Carrot & Coriander Raita and Flaked Almonds","time":25,"cost":22.46,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","calorie smart","high protein","healthy options","new","fusion","poultry","grain"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Bowl","Large Saucepan","Lid"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R55_W14_UK_QR54594-3_Main_high-d38b5c13.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/one-pot-tandoori-chicken-and-curried-couscous-697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Courgette"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Tandoori Masala Mix"],["50 g","Korma Curry Paste"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Couscous"],["1","Carrot"],["1 bunch","Coriander"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["2","Medium Tomato"],["15 g","Toasted Flaked Almonds"],["10 g","Butter"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Courgette"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Tandoori Masala Mix"],["50 g","Korma Curry Paste"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Couscous"],["1","Carrot"],["1 bunch","Coriander"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["2","Medium Tomato"],["15 g","Toasted Flaked Almonds"],["10 g","Butter"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea605fc26d5313f23d2","name":"Diced British Chicken Breast","type":"chicken-breast-diced","family":"none","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced British Chicken Breast","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"62fcaa4abd9a2478e193f089","name":"Tandoori Masala Mix","type":"tandoori-masala-mix","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tandoori Masala Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5de10b3aa28b1766010e3f86","name":"Korma Curry Paste","type":"korma-curry-paste","family":"spice blend","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Korma Curry Paste","marketLabel":"curry paste jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837302fd9848b9dac04ffc1","name":"Couscous","type":"couscous-duplicate","family":"grains","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Couscous","marketLabel":"couscous 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5f284dab71a6058b4567","name":"Carrot","type":"carrot","family":"carrot","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Carrot","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5f54fd2cb99c598b4567","name":"Coriander","type":"coriander","family":"coriander","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Coriander","marketLabel":"fresh coriander 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a56e74dab71d76f8b4570","name":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","type":"natural-yoghurt","family":"yogurt","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","marketLabel":"yoghurts pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60070aba8e7046341a491fcb","name":"Medium Tomato","type":"medium-tomato","family":"tomato","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Medium Tomato","marketLabel":"tomatoes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308042dc4b928197f3a9","name":"Toasted Flaked Almonds","type":"toasted-flaked-almonds","family":"none","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Toasted Flaked Almonds","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"616ef1f4cfc8aa52d7b2bd62","name":"Water for the Couscous","type":"water-for-the-couscous","family":"other drink","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Couscous","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Trim the courgette, then quarter lengthways. Chop widthways into 1cm pieces. Pop the chicken into a bowl with the tandoori masala mix. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Drizzle over some oil, season with salt and pepper and mix so the chicken is well coated in the spice. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large saucepan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the chicken and courgette to the pan. Fry until the chicken is golden brown on the outside and cooked through, 8-10 mins. The chicken is cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Next, add the korma curry paste and fry, 1 min. Stir in the veg stock paste, butter and water for the couscous (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and bring to the boil. When boiling, remove from the heat, stir in the couscous and pop a lid on the pan. Leave to the side for 8-10 mins or until ready to serve.","Meanwhile, trim the carrot, then coarsely grate (no need to peel). Roughly chop the coriander (stalks and all). In a small bowl, combine the yoghurt, carrot and half the coriander. Season with salt and pepper, then set your raita aside. Cut the tomatoes into 1cm chunks.","Once the couscous is ready, fluff it up with a fork. Stir in the tomatoes and the remaining coriander. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed.","Share the couscous out between your bowls. Dollop on the raita and sprinkle over the almonds to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab/step-dd600800.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab/step-e1d5ca10.jpg","caption":"Time to Fry"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab/step-6fbde820.jpg","caption":"Add the Couscous"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab/step-b0145330.jpg","caption":"Make the Raita"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab/step-932f5140.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab/step-c00e8d50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/one-pot-tandoori-chicken-and-curried-couscous-697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/one-pot-tandoori-chicken-and-curried-couscous-697a56f35e3727e7e580e9ab","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"grain","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Courgette"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Tandoori Masala Mix"],["50 g","Korma Curry Paste"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["120 g","Couscous"],["1","Carrot"],["1 bunch","Coriander"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["2","Medium Tomato"],["15 g","Toasted Flaked Almonds"],["10 g","Butter"],["200 ml","Water for the Couscous"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-697a57279629deb2e47d7d58","sourceId":"697a57279629deb2e47d7d58","title":"Mama's Spaghetti, Bacon and Beef Meatballs","subtitle":"with Italian Style Cheese and Balsamic Tomato Salad","time":40,"cost":26.34,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["mediterranean","pasta-noodles","high protein","family friendly","italian","pork","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Bowl","Garlic Press","Large Saucepan","Baking Tray","Colander","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R17_W14_UK_R34861-AP-1-6_VAR_edit_Main_high-3fbea78c.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/mamas-spaghetti-bacon-and-beef-meatballs-697a57279629deb2e47d7d58","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["3","Garlic Clove"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["180 g","Spaghetti"],["10 g","Breadcrumbs"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["0.25 tsp","Salt for the Breadcrumbs"],["2 tbsp","Water for the Breadcrumbs"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["3","Garlic Clove"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["180 g","Spaghetti"],["10 g","Breadcrumbs"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["0.25 tsp","Salt for the Breadcrumbs"],["2 tbsp","Water for the Breadcrumbs"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"3","sourceAmount":3,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373082f7d5496ac4a65cf3","name":"Spaghetti","type":"spaghetti (wheat)","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Spaghetti","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e2f42dc4b928197f136","name":"Breadcrumbs","type":"breadcrumbs","family":"breadcrumbs","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Breadcrumbs","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c1c67fd2cb99f468b4567","name":"British Beef Mince","type":"beef mince","family":"beef","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Beef Mince","marketLabel":"5% fat beef mince 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55672166f8b25e412f8b4567","name":"Tomato Passata","type":"tomato passata","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Passata","marketLabel":"passata 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a4fc599c288003649295c52","name":"Red Wine Stock Paste","type":"red-wine-stock-pot","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"28 g","sourceAmount":28,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Wine Stock Paste","marketLabel":"beef cooking concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"633c6597aa3f33c15c854bb0","name":"Mixed Herbs","type":"mixed-herbs","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mixed Herbs","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6099506c9c6d58742c5645ca","name":"Balsamic Glaze","type":"balsamic-glaze","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 g","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Balsamic Glaze","marketLabel":"balsamic glaze equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6061f8b25ed7288b4577","name":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","type":"pancetta","family":"pork","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"627c173e7497c13c5c9b98a0","name":"Salt for the Breadcrumbs","type":"salt-for-the-breadcrumbs","family":"single spice","amount":"0.25 tsp","sourceAmount":0.25,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Salt for the Breadcrumbs","marketLabel":"table salt 750g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"602e86649c479d367f798aeb","name":"Water for the Breadcrumbs","type":"water-for-the-breadcrumbs-1-tbsp","family":"other drink","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Breadcrumbs","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the spaghetti. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the baby plum tomatoes and pop them into a large bowl. Drizzle over some oil, season with salt and pepper, mix together and set aside for now. When boiling, add the spaghetti to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 8 mins.","Kids’ step: While the pasta cooks, in another large bowl, combine the breadcrumbs, salt and water for the breadcrumbs (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Add the beef mince and half the garlic. Season with pepper and mix together with your hands. Roll into evenly-sized balls, 5 per person, then pop onto a large baking tray. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince.","When the oven is hot, bake the meatballs on the top shelf until browned on the outside and cooked through, 12-15 mins. The meatballs are cooked when no longer pink in the middle. Meanwhile, once the pasta is cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium heat. Once hot, add the bacon lardons. Stir-fry until golden, 4-5 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw meat. Cook bacon thoroughly. Add the remaining garlic and fry for 30 secs. Next, stir in the passata, red wine stock paste, mixed herbs, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then lower the heat and simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins. Once thickened, stir in the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) until melted. Season with salt and pepper, then remove from the heat.","Once the meatballs are ready, pop the sauce back on medium heat and stir in the meatballs. Cook until piping hot, then remove from the heat. Kids’ step: Next, stir in half the hard Italian style cheese, then toss the cooked spaghetti through the sauce so it's nicely coated. Taste and add more salt and pepper if needed.","Share the spaghetti and meatballs between your serving bowls. Sprinkle over the remaining hard Italian style cheese. Kids’ step: Add the baby leaves to the bowl of tomatoes and toss together. Serve the salad on the side, drizzling over the balsamic glaze to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57279629deb2e47d7d58/step-e201fb00.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57279629deb2e47d7d58/step-4bb05310.jpg","caption":"Shape the Meatballs"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57279629deb2e47d7d58/step-a191d220.jpg","caption":"Time to Bake"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57279629deb2e47d7d58/step-0d39d130.jpg","caption":"Make the Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57279629deb2e47d7d58/step-e4277140.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57279629deb2e47d7d58/step-bf897450.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/mamas-spaghetti-bacon-and-beef-meatballs-697a57279629deb2e47d7d58","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/mamas-spaghetti-bacon-and-beef-meatballs-697a57279629deb2e47d7d58","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["3","Garlic Clove"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["180 g","Spaghetti"],["10 g","Breadcrumbs"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["0.25 tsp","Salt for the Breadcrumbs"],["2 tbsp","Water for the Breadcrumbs"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["100 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a","sourceId":"697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a","title":"Warm Pesto Roasted Winter Veg Salad","subtitle":"with Oregano Potato Chunks, Croutons and Greek Style Salad Cheese","time":40,"cost":16.19,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["calorie smart","veggie","mediterranean","dinner-bowls","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Bowl","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R53_W45_UK_V12775-34_Main_high-fa677d2d.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/warm-pesto-roasted-winter-veg-salad-697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Baking Potato"],["1 sachet","Dried Oregano"],["12 ml","Balsamic Vinegar"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1","Courgette"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["0.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Baking Potato"],["1 sachet","Dried Oregano"],["12 ml","Balsamic Vinegar"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1","Courgette"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["0.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"556857824dab717e1d8b4569","name":"Baking Potato","type":"baking-potato","family":"potato","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baking Potato","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550da144dab718e128b456e","name":"Dried Oregano","type":"dried oregano","family":"oregano","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Dried Oregano","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550927ef8b25e4d4c8b456c","name":"Balsamic Vinegar","type":"balsamic vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 ml","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Balsamic Vinegar","marketLabel":"balsamic vinegar 250ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68c412723cfb117858763a9f","name":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","type":"basil-pesto-sauce","family":"none","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"0.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potato into 2cm chunks (no need to peel). Pop the chunks onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, sprinkle over the dried oregano, then season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf until golden, 25-35 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine the balsamic vinegar, pesto, sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper - this is your pesto dressing. Halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Slice into thin strips. Pop the sliced pepper and baby plum tomatoes onto one side of another large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat.","Roast the veg on the middle shelf until soft and slightly charred, 15-18 mins. Meanwhile, tear the ciabatta into roughly 2cm chunks. When the veg has 10 mins left of roasting time, add the ciabatta chunks onto the other side of the veg tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat well. Return the tray to the middle shelf and bake until golden, 8-10 mins.","While everything roasts, trim the courgette and slice into 1cm thick rounds. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. When hot, add the courgette and cook until charred, 3-4 mins. Season with salt and pepper. Turn only every couple of mins - this will result in the courgette picking up some nice colour. Once cooked, remove from the heat.","When everything's ready, add the roasted veg, croutons and charred courgette to the bowl of pesto dressing and toss to coat. Just before serving, add the baby leaves and toss to combine. Don't add the leaves too early or they'll go soggy. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed.","Share the roasted veg salad between your bowls. Crumble over the Greek style salad cheese."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a/step-b53fd800.jpg","caption":"Roast the Potato"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a/step-37e5d610.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a/step-3f2cb720.jpg","caption":"Roast the Pepper"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a/step-8a5eef30.jpg","caption":"Char your Courgette"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a/step-277a5640.jpg","caption":"Toss the Salad"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a/step-31e71450.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/warm-pesto-roasted-winter-veg-salad-697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/warm-pesto-roasted-winter-veg-salad-697a57299629deb2e47d7d5a","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Baking Potato"],["1 sachet","Dried Oregano"],["12 ml","Balsamic Vinegar"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Ciabatta"],["1","Courgette"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["0.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a","sourceId":"697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a","title":"Oven-Baked Pesto Risotto Verde and Asparagus","subtitle":"with Marinated Charred Courgette and Cheese","time":45,"cost":20.74,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","regional-specialty","pasta-noodles","easter","british","rice","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Large Oven-Proof Pan","Garlic Press","Kettle","Lid","Bowl","Zester","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R19_W14_UK_V19694-7_MT_Main_high-eaba9f7f.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/oven-baked-pesto-risotto-verde-and-asparagus-697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Onion"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["20 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["1","Courgette"],["1","Lemon"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["600 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil"],["20 g","Butter"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Onion"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["20 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["1","Courgette"],["1","Lemon"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["600 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil"],["20 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a59324dab71626c8b4575","name":"Onion","type":"onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Onion","marketLabel":"brown onions 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5992fd2cb95a598b456a","name":"Risotto Rice","type":"risotto-rice","family":"rice","amount":"175 g","sourceAmount":175,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Risotto Rice","marketLabel":"risotto rice 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"633c6597aa3f33c15c854bb0","name":"Mixed Herbs","type":"mixed-herbs","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mixed Herbs","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a58da4dab71d76f8b4573","name":"Asparagus","type":"asparagus-bundles","family":"asparagus","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Asparagus","marketLabel":"fresh vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68c412723cfb117858763a9f","name":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","type":"basil-pesto-sauce","family":"none","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"61f968097f9b41760f4d2295","name":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","type":"boiled-water-for-the-risotto-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"600 ml","sourceAmount":600,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556833d64dab711e1c8b4569","name":"Olive Oil","type":"olive-oil-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Boil a full kettle. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve, peel and chop the onion into small pieces. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large, wide-bottomed ovenproof pan on medium heat. If you don't have an ovenproof pan, use a normal pan and transfer to an ovenproof dish before baking. If you prefer hob cooking your risotto, skip the oven and just use a normal pan.","Add the onion to the ovenproof pan and stir-fry until softened, 4-5 mins. Stir through the risotto rice, garlic and mixed herbs. Stir and cook until the edges of the rice are translucent, 1-2 mins. Stir in the boiled water for the risotto (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and veg stock paste. Bring back up to the boil, then pop a lid on the pan (or cover with foil). Bake on the middle shelf of your oven until the rice is cooked and the water has been absorbed, 25-30 mins. For hob cooking, pour in 2p: 800ml, 3p: 1200ml, 4p: 1600ml of boiled water a third at a time, stirring each time until the stock has been absorbed, 20-25 mins.","Meanwhile, trim the courgette, then quarter lengthways. Chop into 1cm chunks. Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan on high heat. When hot, add the courgette and cook until charred, 6-8 mins total. Turn only every couple of mins. While the courgette is frying, zest and cut the lemon into wedges. Transfer your charred courgette into a medium-sized bowl, add a good squeeze of lemon juice, lemon zest and the sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season and set aside to marinate.","Trim the bottom 2cm from the asparagus and discard. Chop into thirds. Heat a drizzle of oil in the now-empty frying pan on medium heat. Once hot, add the asparagus and season with salt and pepper. Fry for 1 min, then add a splash of water and immediately cover with a lid or some foil. Cook until the asparagus is tender, 4-6 mins, then remove from the heat.","When the risotto is cooked, remove it from the oven and stir through the pesto, hard Italian style cheese and butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed. Stir through the marinated courgette. Add a splash of water to loosen the risotto to your desired consistency. Taste and season with salt, pepper and more lemon juice if you feel it needs it.","Share your risotto between your serving plates. Scatter the asparagus on top of your risotto to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a/step-8a4ab200.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a/step-602d6510.jpg","caption":"Risotto Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a/step-b4f96020.jpg","caption":"Marinate your Courgette"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a/step-8e674330.jpg","caption":"Prepare the Asparagus"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a/step-2ca53940.jpg","caption":"Finish the Risotto"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a/step-092d2950.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/oven-baked-pesto-risotto-verde-and-asparagus-697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/oven-baked-pesto-risotto-verde-and-asparagus-697a56da5e3727e7e580e98a","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Onion"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["20 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["1","Courgette"],["1","Lemon"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["600 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil"],["20 g","Butter"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3","sourceId":"69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3","title":"Cajun Spiced Halloumi & Black Bean Burrito Bowl","subtitle":"with Soured Cream and Smashed Avocado","time":20,"cost":20.21,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["high protein","veggie","quick","very hot","new","hellofresh specials","mexican","wrap"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Bowl","Sieve","Zester","Grater","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R80_W13_UK_SVP55128-3_Main_high-63151ecf.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cajun-spiced-halloumi-and-black-bean-burrito-bowl-69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["225 g","Halloumi"],["1 carton","Black Beans"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Lime"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["50 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["15 g","Honey"],["1 pouch","Steamed Basmati Rice"],["150 g","Smashed Avocado"],["100 ml","Water for the Beans"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["225 g","Halloumi"],["1 carton","Black Beans"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Lime"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["50 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["15 g","Honey"],["1 pouch","Steamed Basmati Rice"],["150 g","Smashed Avocado"],["100 ml","Water for the Beans"],["1 tsp","Sugar"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"55686e0bf8b25e15418b4567","name":"Halloumi","type":"halloumi","family":"hard cheese","amount":"225 g","sourceAmount":225,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Halloumi","marketLabel":"Cypriot halloumi 225g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5720c9df4dab71f02a8b4568","name":"Black Beans","type":"black beans","family":"beans","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Black Beans","marketLabel":"black beans tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68382535f7d5496ac4a6a740","name":"Soured Cream","type":"soured-cream","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soured Cream","marketLabel":"soured cream 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69146769623e0c85b6821082","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5fe8f8b25e1e268b4579","name":"Chilli Flakes","type":"chilli flakes","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chilli Flakes","marketLabel":"chilli flakes 45g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a4fc599c288003649295c52","name":"Red Wine Stock Paste","type":"red-wine-stock-pot","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"28 g","sourceAmount":28,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Wine Stock Paste","marketLabel":"beef cooking concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5aba35df7918d5096b2f","name":"Cajun Spice Mix","type":"cajun-style-spice","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cajun Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a573a15c28800429a6eeac2","name":"Steamed Basmati Rice","type":"steamed-basmati-rice","family":"rice","amount":"1 pouch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"pouch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Steamed Basmati Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e285e8f144ad0555416175d","name":"Smashed Avocado","type":"guacamole","family":"avocado","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Smashed Avocado","marketLabel":"avocado each","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb2ca688281450b8bd071","name":"Water for the Beans","type":"water-for-the-beans-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Beans","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Drain the halloumi, then cut it into 3 slices per person. Place them into a small bowl of cold water and leave to soak. Drain and rinse the black beans in a sieve. Add to a medium bowl, then mash half of them with the back of a fork.","Halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Chop into 1cm chunks. Zest the whole lime, then juice one half and cut the other half into wedges. In another small bowl, stir half the lime zest through the soured cream. Grate the Cheddar cheese.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the sliced pepper and fry until just soft, 3-4 mins. Continue to stir while it cooks. Add the mashed and whole black beans, half the chilli flakes and the tomato puree to the pan. Season with salt and pepper. Stir-fry for 1 min. Add the red wine stock paste, water for the beans and sugar (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then simmer until the sauce has thickened, 2-3 mins. Stir in the lime juice. Transfer the beans into the bowl used to mash them and set aside.","Remove the halloumi slices from the cold water, pop them onto a plate lined with kitchen paper and pat them dry. Wipe out the pan used for the beans and pepper.","Heat the frying pan used for the beans on medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. Once hot, add the halloumi and fry until golden, 2-3 mins on each side. When you flip the halloumi, add the Cajun spice mix (add less if you'd prefer things milder) and honey to the pan. Turn to coat. When everything's nearly ready, cook the rice according to pack instructions.","Tip the rice out into a medium bowl, then stir through the remaining lime zest. Share the zesty rice between your serving bowls. Top with the fried black beans, Cajun spiced halloumi and a dollop of smashed avocado in separate sections. Drizzle the lime soured cream over everything and sprinkle over the cheese. Garnish with the remaining chilli flakes and a lime wedge."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3/step-2a06e400.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3/step-91cce910.jpg","caption":"Prep the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3/step-544c7220.jpg","caption":"Fry the Veg and Beans"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3/step-02f08e30.jpg","caption":"Prep the Halloumi"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3/step-131a8940.jpg","caption":"Fry the Halloumi"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3/step-6e262650.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cajun-spiced-halloumi-and-black-bean-burrito-bowl-69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cajun-spiced-halloumi-and-black-bean-burrito-bowl-69710d5e384e652ce6a500b3","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"wrap","shoppingIngredients":[["225 g","Halloumi"],["1 carton","Black Beans"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Lime"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["50 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["15 g","Honey"],["1 pouch","Steamed Basmati Rice"],["150 g","Smashed Avocado"],["100 ml","Water for the Beans"],["1 tsp","Sugar"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-69710d6384d22895b02c9309","sourceId":"69710d6384d22895b02c9309","title":"Prawn and Tomato Linguine","subtitle":"with Charred Courgette, Asparagus and Chilli","time":20,"cost":13.76,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["high protein","quick","calorie smart","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","medium spice","pescatarian","healthy options","italian","seafood","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Grater","Large Saucepan","Bowl","Pan","Colander"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R15_W07_UK_QL3781-36_Main_high-d8d6f5e9.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/prawn-and-tomato-linguine-69710d6384d22895b02c9309","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Courgette"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["180 g","Linguine"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Courgette"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["180 g","Linguine"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a58da4dab71d76f8b4573","name":"Asparagus","type":"asparagus-bundles","family":"asparagus","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Asparagus","marketLabel":"fresh vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69146769623e0c85b6821082","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373081d9848b9dac050010","name":"Linguine","type":"linguine","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Linguine","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5fe8f8b25e1e268b4579","name":"Chilli Flakes","type":"chilli flakes","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chilli Flakes","marketLabel":"chilli flakes 45g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55672166f8b25e412f8b4567","name":"Tomato Passata","type":"tomato passata","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Passata","marketLabel":"passata 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5f327c6560efd3453038c2a8","name":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","type":"sundried-tomato-paste-duplicate","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","marketLabel":"sun-dried tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the pasta. Trim the courgette, then slice into 1cm thick rounds. Trim the bottom 2cm from the asparagus and discard. Cut into thirds. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Grate the cheese.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. When hot, add the courgette and cook until charred, 3-4 mins each side. Once cooked, season with salt and pepper, then transfer the courgette to a bowl.","When your pan of water is boiling, add the linguine and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Add the asparagus to the pan for the last 4 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander. Pop back into the pan, drizzle with oil and stir through to stop the pasta sticking together.","Meanwhile, put the (now empty) frying pan on medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. Once hot, add the garlic and half the chilli flakes (add less if you'd prefer things milder) and cook, stirring, for 1 min. Stir in the passata, sun-dried tomato paste, veg stock paste and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then simmer until thickened, 4-5 mins. In the meantime, drain the prawns. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw prawns.","Once thickened, stir the prawns into the sauce and cook for 5-6 mins. The prawns are cooked when pink on the outside and opaque in the middle. Meanwhile, roughly chop the charred courgette rounds. In a small bowl, mix together the chopped courgette and the remaining chilli flakes (add less if you'd prefer things milder).","Add the cooked pasta, asparagus, cheese and half the charred courgette mixture to the sauce. Mix well to combine, then season to taste with salt and pepper. Add a splash of water if it's a little thick. Share the prawn linguine between your bowls, then spoon over the remaining charred courgette mixture to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d6384d22895b02c9309/step-c7965400.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d6384d22895b02c9309/step-3c286310.jpg","caption":"Char the Courgette"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d6384d22895b02c9309/step-0568bc20.jpg","caption":"Cook the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d6384d22895b02c9309/step-e7285730.jpg","caption":"Make your Tomato Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d6384d22895b02c9309/step-6917b440.jpg","caption":"Add the Prawns"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/69710d6384d22895b02c9309/step-c9b49850.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/prawn-and-tomato-linguine-69710d6384d22895b02c9309","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/prawn-and-tomato-linguine-69710d6384d22895b02c9309","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Courgette"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["180 g","Linguine"],["1 sachet","Chilli Flakes"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-6967ce6f850f974aa212e290","sourceId":"6967ce6f850f974aa212e290","title":"Speedy Mexican Inspired Chicken Nacho Salad","subtitle":"with Charred Corn, Avocado and Cheese","time":15,"cost":21.85,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["super quick","new","mexican","poultry","salad","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Pan","Zester","Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R45_W12_UK_UQ52495-3_edit_chicken_Main_high-8f905454.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-mexican-inspired-chicken-nacho-salad-6967ce6f850f974aa212e290","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["1","Avocado"],["1","Medium Tomato"],["1","Lime"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["200 g","Tortilla Chips"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["30 g","Hot Sauce"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["1","Avocado"],["1","Medium Tomato"],["1","Lime"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["200 g","Tortilla Chips"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["30 g","Hot Sauce"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6de44dab71a6058b456a","name":"Sweetcorn","type":"sweetcorn","family":"corn","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweetcorn","marketLabel":"sweetcorn tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550e278f8b25e56468b456f","name":"Avocado","type":"avocado","family":"avocado","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Avocado","marketLabel":"avocado each","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60070aba8e7046341a491fcb","name":"Medium Tomato","type":"medium-tomato","family":"tomato","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Medium Tomato","marketLabel":"tomatoes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68382535f7d5496ac4a6a740","name":"Soured Cream","type":"soured-cream","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soured Cream","marketLabel":"soured cream 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"674dd52a40f14c951049d634","name":"Tortilla Chips","type":"tortilla-chips","family":"none","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tortilla Chips","marketLabel":"tortilla product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e285e8c281b6b2b4a03982b","name":"Hot Sauce","type":"hot-sauce","family":"asian paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Hot Sauce","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e56f8b25ed7288b4576","name":"British Chicken Breasts","type":"chicken-fillet","family":"chicken","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Chicken Breasts","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 240°C/220°C fan/gas mark 9. Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan on high heat. Once hot, lay the chicken into the pan. Season with salt and pepper. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Fry, 3-4 mins. Turn, cook for 1 min more. Transfer the chicken to a baking tray. Roast on the top shelf of the oven, 12-15 mins. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw meat. Cook so there's no pink in the middle.","Meanwhile, halve the pepper. Chop into 1cm chunks. Drain the sweetcorn. Put the frying pan back on medium-high with a drizzle of oil. Add the sweetcorn and pepper. Cook, 5-6 mins. Stir only twice during this time - you want the sweetcorn and pepper to pick up some nicecolour. Halve the avocado and remove the stone. Cut into 1cm chunks. Cut the tomato into 1cm chunks. Zest and halve the lime.","In a small bowl, combine the soured cream with half the lime juice, a pinch of lime zest, honey and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Use your hands to crush the tortilla chips into bite-sized pieces.","Slice the chicken into 1cm thick slices. In a large bowl, combine the tortilla chips, avocado, tomato, corn, pepper and rocket leaves. Toss together to evenly coat. Share the tortilla salad between bowls. Top with the sliced chicken, cheese and hot sauce."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6f850f974aa212e290/step-dff57400.jpg","caption":"Get Frying"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6f850f974aa212e290/step-937e9810.jpg","caption":"Finish the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6f850f974aa212e290/step-e524af20.jpg","caption":"Stir Dressing"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6f850f974aa212e290/step-56b25730.jpg","caption":"Dinner's Ready!"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-mexican-inspired-chicken-nacho-salad-6967ce6f850f974aa212e290","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-mexican-inspired-chicken-nacho-salad-6967ce6f850f974aa212e290","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["1","Avocado"],["1","Medium Tomato"],["1","Lime"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["200 g","Tortilla Chips"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["30 g","Hot Sauce"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":true,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484","sourceId":"695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484","title":"Orzo Bacon Mac and Cheese","subtitle":"with Sweet Potato, Spinach and Sriracha","time":35,"cost":23.99,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["pasta-noodles","north american","six-nations","new","american","pork","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Large Saucepan","Bowl","Pan","Sieve","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R19_W11_UK_V17501-6_Main_V17501-AP-1-1_var_high-8b0bc9e9.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/orzo-bacon-mac-and-cheese-695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","Sweet Potato"],["1 sachet","Roasted Spice and Herb Blend"],["25 g","Breadcrumbs"],["180 g","Orzo"],["60 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["10 g","Dijon Mustard"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["200 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","Sweet Potato"],["1 sachet","Roasted Spice and Herb Blend"],["25 g","Breadcrumbs"],["180 g","Orzo"],["60 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["10 g","Dijon Mustard"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["200 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"555082a2f8b25e56468b4568","name":"Sweet Potato","type":"sweet potato","family":"potato","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweet Potato","marketLabel":"sweet potatoes 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6304d66eff08c9e5b584e015","name":"Roasted Spice and Herb Blend","type":"roasted-spice-and-herb-blend","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Roasted Spice and Herb Blend","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e2f42dc4b928197f136","name":"Breadcrumbs","type":"breadcrumbs","family":"breadcrumbs","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Breadcrumbs","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308242dc4b928197f3bc","name":"Orzo","type":"orzo","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Orzo","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69146769623e0c85b6821082","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"60 g","sourceAmount":60,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6061f8b25ed7288b4577","name":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","type":"pancetta","family":"pork","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550925ef8b25e56468b456b","name":"Dijon Mustard","type":"dijon-mustard","family":"mustard","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Dijon Mustard","marketLabel":"mustard 185g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5c3f3eadc445fa4233599443","name":"Sriracha Sauce","type":"sriracha (anchovy)","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"16 ml","sourceAmount":16,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sriracha Sauce","marketLabel":"table sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60f9470be5a270ab7dbce1b8","name":"Plain Flour","type":"plain-flour-1-tbsp","family":"flour","amount":"1.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":1.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Plain Flour","marketLabel":"plain flour 1.5kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp of salt for the orzo. Cut the sweet potatoes into 1-2cm chunks (no need to peel). Pop the sweet potato chunks onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil and season with salt and pepper. Sprinkle over the roasted spice and herb blend, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast the sweet potatoes on the top shelf until golden, 18-20 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the breadcrumbs. Season with salt and pepper and fry, stirring regularly, until lightly toasted, 3-4 mins. Watch it like a hawk, as they can burn easily. Once cooked, transfer the toasted crumbs to a small bowl. Set aside.","When your water is boiling, add the orzo to the pan and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 10 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and pop back into the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together. While the orzo cooks, grate the Cheddar cheese.","Give the (now empty) frying pan a wipe, then return to medium-heat. Melt the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Once hot, fry the bacon lardons, 4-5 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw meat. Cook bacon thoroughly. Stir in the flour (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Cook until it forms a paste, 1-2 mins - you've made a roux! Pour in the water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) a little at a time, followed by the veg stock paste. Bring to the boil, stir and simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins. Once thickened, stir in the creme fraiche. Add the Dijon mustard (add less if you'd prefer), Cheddar and hard Italian style cheese. Stir until combined and melted. Season with salt and pepper.","When the sweet potatoes are ready, remove from the oven. Stir the sweet potatoes into the cheesy sauce along with the cooked orzo. Add the spinach a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins. Remove from the heat. Add a splash of water if it's a little thick. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed.","When ready, share the bacon and sweet potato orzo mac and cheese between your serving bowls. Sprinkle over the crumbs and drizzle over the sriracha."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484/step-fec09000.jpg","caption":"Roast the Sweet Potatoes"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484/step-fd632f10.jpg","caption":"Oh Crumbs"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484/step-a50e7820.jpg","caption":"Cook the Orzo"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484/step-b9bf6630.jpg","caption":"Get Cheesy"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484/step-ba923540.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484/step-2b0cf250.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/orzo-bacon-mac-and-cheese-695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/orzo-bacon-mac-and-cheese-695ea1c230d8e7c0c7666484","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["2","Sweet Potato"],["1 sachet","Roasted Spice and Herb Blend"],["25 g","Breadcrumbs"],["180 g","Orzo"],["60 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["10 g","Dijon Mustard"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["16 ml","Sriracha Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["200 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511","sourceId":"6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511","title":"Oven-Baked Salmon and Lemon Risotto","subtitle":"with Peas and Spinach","time":40,"cost":16.56,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["prepped in 10","world-flavors","pasta-noodles","pescatarian","high protein","fusion","seafood","rice","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Zester","Garlic Press","Kettle","Large Oven-Proof Pan","Lid","Baking Tray","Baking Paper"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF211011_R04_W47_UK_R10408-2_MB_Main_high-1e2bc3a4.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/oven-baked-salmon-and-lemon-risotto-6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Echalion Shallot"],["1","Lemon"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["20 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["120 g","Peas"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["600 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"],["15 g","butter"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Echalion Shallot"],["1","Lemon"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["20 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["120 g","Peas"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["600 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5568817d4dab71121f8b4568","name":"Echalion Shallot","type":"echalion shallot","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Echalion Shallot","marketLabel":"brown onions 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5992fd2cb95a598b456a","name":"Risotto Rice","type":"risotto-rice","family":"rice","amount":"175 g","sourceAmount":175,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Risotto Rice","marketLabel":"risotto rice 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"62fcaa09bd9a2478e193effe","name":"Salmon Fillets","type":"skin-on-salmon-fillet","family":"none","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salmon Fillets","marketLabel":"Scottish salmon fillets x2 240g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"61f968097f9b41760f4d2295","name":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","type":"boiled-water-for-the-risotto-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"600 ml","sourceAmount":600,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Boil a full kettle. Halve, peel and thinly slice the shallot. Zest and halve the lemon. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press).","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large, wide-bottomed ovenproof pan on medium heat. If you don't have an ovenproof pan, use a normal pan and transfer to an ovenproof dish before baking. Once hot, add the shallot. Fry until softened, 4-5 mins. Next, stir in the garlic and cook for 1 min more. Add the risotto rice, stir and cook until the edges of the rice are translucent, 1-2 mins. If you prefer hob cooking your risotto, just use a normal pan.","Stir the boiled water for the risotto (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and vegetable stock paste into the rice. Bring back up to the boil, then pop a lid on the pan (or cover with foil). Bake on the middle shelf of your oven until the rice is cooked and the water has been absorbed, 25-30 mins. For hob cooking, pour in 2p: 800ml, 3p: 1200ml, 4p: 1600ml of boiled water a third at a time, stirring each time until the stock has been absorbed, 20-25 mins.","Meanwhile, lay the salmon fillets, skin-side down, onto a lined baking tray. Season with salt and pepper. Roast the salmon on the top shelf until cooked through, 10-15 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw fish. It's cooked when opaque in the middle.","When the risotto has 5 mins left, stir in the spinach and peas. Return to the oven for the remaining 5 mins so the spinach is wilted and piping hot. When the risotto is cooked, remove it from the oven and stir through the hard Italian style cheese, 15 g butter, a squeeze of lemon juice and half the lemon zest. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed. Add a splash of water to loosen the risotto to your desired consistency.","Serve the risotto in bowls topped with the salmon. Sprinkle over the remaining lemon zest, and serve with a lemon wedge alongside for squeezing over."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511/step-1e328a00.jpg","caption":"Prep Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511/step-7809c910.jpg","caption":"Start your Risotto"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511/step-5a89d520.jpg","caption":"Time to Bake"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511/step-5e771c30.jpg","caption":"Roast the Salmon"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511/step-1f471740.jpg","caption":"Bring on the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511/step-ff0a5250.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/oven-baked-salmon-and-lemon-risotto-6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/oven-baked-salmon-and-lemon-risotto-6967ce6a6a9c9fe912717511","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Echalion Shallot"],["1","Lemon"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["20 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["200 g","Salmon Fillets"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["120 g","Peas"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["600 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"],["15 g","butter"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641","sourceId":"6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641","title":"Bulgogi King Prawn Noodles","subtitle":"with Lime, Green Beans and Pepper","time":25,"cost":10.58,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","pescatarian","quick","calorie smart","pan-asian-plates","noodle-stir-fry","scout approved","korean","seafood","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Sieve","Large Saucepan","Zester","Garlic Press","Large Frying Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R23_W46_UK_R14914-11_Main_high-c4785e70.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/bulgogi-king-prawn-noodles-6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lime"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["150 g","Bulgogi Sauce"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"]],"sourceIngredients":[["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lime"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["150 g","Bulgogi Sauce"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"68373080f7d5496ac4a65cdc","name":"Egg Noodle Nest","type":"egg-noodle-nest","family":"other noodle","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Egg Noodle Nest","marketLabel":"egg noodles 4 nests","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555080c2f8b25e4d4c8b4568","name":"Green Beans","type":"green beans","family":"beans","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Green Beans","marketLabel":"green beans 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e285e6f6425aa364d7a1bcc","name":"Bulgogi Sauce","type":"bulgogi-sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bulgogi Sauce","marketLabel":"Asian cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"10 ml","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"50 ml","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the noodles. When boiling, add the noodles to the water and cook until tender, 4 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and run under cold water to stop them sticking together.","Meanwhile, trim the green beans, then cut into thirds. Halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Slice into thin strips. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Zest the lime, then cut into wedges. Drain the prawns. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw prawns.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the green beans and sliced pepper, stir-fry until tender, 4-5 mins. Stir in the garlic and stir-fry until fragrant, 30 secs.","Stir the bulgogi, soy sauce and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) into the veg, then bring to the boil. Stir in the prawns and cook for another 5-6 mins until the veg is tender and the prawns are cooked through. The prawns are cooked when pink on the outside and opaque in the middle.","Once the prawns are cooked, add the noodles and a squeeze of lime juice to the sauce. Toss to coat the noodles in the sauce, stirring frequently until everything is piping hot, 1-2 mins. Taste and add more salt, pepper and lime juice if needed. Add a splash of water if you feel it needs it.","Share the bulgogi prawn noodles between your bowls. Sprinkle over the lime zest and serve any remaining lime wedges alongside for squeezing over."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641/step-b918e700.jpg","caption":"Oodles of Noodles"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641/step-171fb610.jpg","caption":"Prep Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641/step-1028fb20.jpg","caption":"Stir-Fry the Garlic"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641/step-7d3d1330.jpg","caption":"Flavour Town"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641/step-f1c5e640.jpg","caption":"Noodle Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641/step-55ab2250.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/bulgogi-king-prawn-noodles-6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/bulgogi-king-prawn-noodles-6967ce2fd936c3797e0f5641","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["125 g","Egg Noodle Nest"],["80 g","Green Beans"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lime"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["150 g","Bulgogi Sauce"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["50 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-693ada61c92924105eca7127","sourceId":"693ada61c92924105eca7127","title":"Honeyed Goat's Cheese and Ciabatta Toasts","subtitle":"with Bacon, Beetroot and Walnut Potato Salad","time":35,"cost":18.24,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["classic-euro-dishes","dinner-bowls","discovery","french","pork","sandwich","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R13_W08_UK_V22089-11_Main_V22089-AP-1-1_var_high-b51a12c5.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/honeyed-goats-cheese-and-ciabatta-toasts-693ada61c92924105eca7127","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Ciabatta"],["250 g","Cooked Beetroot"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["10 g","Wholegrain Mustard"],["30 g","Honey"],["75 g","Goat's Cheese"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Ciabatta"],["250 g","Cooked Beetroot"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["10 g","Wholegrain Mustard"],["30 g","Honey"],["75 g","Goat's Cheese"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5d8b33f3e711c068cb7baa91","name":"Cooked Beetroot","type":"cooked-beetroot","family":"beet","amount":"250 g","sourceAmount":250,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cooked Beetroot","marketLabel":"fresh vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55b8eb44ae9270ec308b4567","name":"Cider Vinegar","type":"cider vinegar","family":"vinegar","amount":"15 ml","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cider Vinegar","marketLabel":"cider vinegar 350ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c147a4dab71ac398b4567","name":"Wholegrain Mustard","type":"wholegrain mustard","family":"mustard","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wholegrain Mustard","marketLabel":"mustard 185g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69008edb29be8924040c8492","name":"Goat's Cheese","type":"goat's cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Goat's Cheese","marketLabel":"porridge oats 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e74d9848b9dac04fc4a","name":"Walnuts","type":"walnuts","family":"nut mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Walnuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6061f8b25ed7288b4577","name":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","type":"pancetta","family":"pork","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Smoked Bacon Lardons","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potatoes into 2cm chunks (no need to peel). Halve and peel the red onion, then cut each half into 3 wedges. Pop the potatoes and onion onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf until golden, 25-35 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, slice your ciabatta roll widthways into 6 slices. Place your ciabatta slices onto a medium baking tray, drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat well. When the potatoes have 10 mins left, bake on the middle shelf until golden, 8-10 mins. At the same time, remove the potato tray from the oven and scatter over the bacon lardons. Return to the oven to roast for the remaining time. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw meat. Cook bacon thoroughly.","While everything bakes, chop each beetroot into 2cm chunks. Wear gloves when handling the beetroot to avoid staining your hands. In a large bowl, add the cider vinegar, wholegrain mustard, olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and half the honey. If the measured honey is very thick, warm it briefly so it pours easily. Season with salt and pepper and mix well.","Once your ciabatta toasts have finished cooking, remove from the oven and spread your goat's cheese over the top of each slice.","Add your beetroot, bacon, roasted potatoes, onion and baby leaves to your dressing and toss well to coat. Don't add the leaves too early or they'll go soggy.","Share your salad between your bowls. Top with your toasts and drizzle over the remaining honey. Sprinkle over the walnuts to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693ada61c92924105eca7127/step-b7b78800.jpg","caption":"Roast the Potatoes"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693ada61c92924105eca7127/step-64b45610.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693ada61c92924105eca7127/step-039f1b20.jpg","caption":"Mix Things Up"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693ada61c92924105eca7127/step-7a354c30.jpg","caption":"Cheese Please"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693ada61c92924105eca7127/step-38646b40.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693ada61c92924105eca7127/step-de7f3e50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/honeyed-goats-cheese-and-ciabatta-toasts-693ada61c92924105eca7127","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/honeyed-goats-cheese-and-ciabatta-toasts-693ada61c92924105eca7127","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"sandwich","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Ciabatta"],["250 g","Cooked Beetroot"],["15 ml","Cider Vinegar"],["10 g","Wholegrain Mustard"],["30 g","Honey"],["75 g","Goat's Cheese"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["20 g","Walnuts"],["90 g","British Smoked Bacon Lardons"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53","sourceId":"695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53","title":"Chicken, Courgette, Pea and Mint Salad","subtitle":"with Greek Style Cheese, Croutons, Pickled Onions and Yoghurt Drizzle","time":40,"cost":31.59,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["classic-euro-dishes","dinner-bowls","medium spice","high protein","european","poultry","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Bowl","Baking Tray","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R52_W47_UK_V40633-5_editChicken_Main_2_high-334d9fba.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chicken-courgette-pea-and-mint-salad-695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Baking Potato"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Courgette"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lemon"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["1","Ciabatta"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["120 g","Peas"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Baking Potato"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Courgette"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lemon"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["1","Ciabatta"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["120 g","Peas"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"556857824dab717e1d8b4569","name":"Baking Potato","type":"baking-potato","family":"potato","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baking Potato","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"566af3d3f8b25e717b8b4567","name":"Chermoula Spice Mix","type":"chermoula-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chermoula Spice Mix","marketLabel":"chermoula seasoning","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e96f8b25e1e268b4578","name":"Mint","type":"mint","family":"mint","amount":"1 bunch","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"bunch(es)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mint","marketLabel":"fresh mint 30g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea605fc26d5313f23d2","name":"Diced British Chicken Breast","type":"chicken-breast-diced","family":"none","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced British Chicken Breast","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a56e74dab71d76f8b4570","name":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","type":"natural-yoghurt","family":"yogurt","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Natural Yoghurt","marketLabel":"yoghurts pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e3416f081143769dd33ba49","name":"Sugar for the Pickle","type":"sugar-for-the-pickle-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Pickle","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":1.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potato into 2cm chunks (no need to peel). Pop the chunks onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, sprinkle over the chermoula spice mix, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, roast on the top shelf until golden, 25-35 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, halve and peel the red onion. Cut half the onion into wedges and thinly slice the remaining half. Trim the courgette and slice into 1cm thick rounds. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the lemon. Add the onion wedges to the potato tray and roast for the remaining time until golden, 18-20 mins.","Meanwhile, pop the thinly sliced onion into a large bowl. Squeeze in the lemon juice and add the sugar for the pickle (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Add a pinch of salt, mix together and set aside to pickle. Pick the mint leaves from their stalks and roughly chop (discard the stalks).","Tear the ciabatta into roughly 2cm chunks. Pop the ciabatta onto a baking tray in a single layer. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat well. Bake the croutons on the middle shelf until golden, 8-10 mins, then remove from the oven and set aside.","While everything's roasting, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. When hot, add the chicken and courgette and cook until fry, 8-10 mins. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw meat. Cook so there's no pink in the middle. Once charred, lower the heat to medium and stir in the garlic. Fry until fragrant, 30 secs more. Remove from the heat.","When everything's ready, add the honey and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) to the bowl of pickled onion and mix well. Add the chicken, peas, cooked potatoes and veg, ciabatta croutons, baby leaves and mint to the bowl. Mix well until completely combined. Share the salad between your serving bowls. Drizzle over the Greek style yoghurt and crumble over the Greek style salad cheese to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53/step-19fd7700.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53/step-dc304310.jpg","caption":"Prep Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53/step-59f1f120.jpg","caption":"In a Pickle"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53/step-211de630.jpg","caption":"Into the Oven"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53/step-03784c40.jpg","caption":"Cook the Chicken and Courgette"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53/step-8415d550.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chicken-courgette-pea-and-mint-salad-695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/chicken-courgette-pea-and-mint-salad-695ea1d22a2e2effad18aa53","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Baking Potato"],["1 sachet","Chermoula Spice Mix"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Courgette"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["1","Lemon"],["1 bunch","Mint"],["1","Ciabatta"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["120 g","Peas"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["75 g","Greek Style Natural Yoghurt"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["1.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-695ea21830d8e7c0c76664fe","sourceId":"695ea21830d8e7c0c76664fe","title":"Creamed Cajun Chicken, Chorizo and Corn Rice Bowl","subtitle":"with Spinach, Rice and Peas","time":15,"cost":26.42,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["super quick","high protein","world-flavors","dinner-bowls","medium spice","american","poultry","rice","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Kettle","Large Saucepan","Large Frying Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R14_W31_UK_UQ25431-4_Main_F1_Add_diced_chorizo_to_the_stew_edit_high-1c5dd8c6.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamed-cajun-chicken-chorizo-and-corn-rice-bowl-695ea21830d8e7c0c76664fe","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["120 g","Peas"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["100 ml","Water"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["10 g","Butter"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["150 g","Basmati Rice"],["120 g","Peas"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["30 g","Tomato Puree"],["1 sachet","Cajun Spice Mix"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["90 g","Diced Chorizo"],["100 ml","Water"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["10 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"55508011fd2cb96c628b456c","name":"Basmati Rice","type":"basmati rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basmati Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556d6384fd2cb954078b4567","name":"Peas","type":"peas","family":"peas","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peas","marketLabel":"garden peas 910g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea605fc26d5313f23d2","name":"Diced British Chicken Breast","type":"chicken-breast-diced","family":"none","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced British Chicken Breast","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6de44dab71a6058b456a","name":"Sweetcorn","type":"sweetcorn","family":"corn","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweetcorn","marketLabel":"sweetcorn tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a708af8b25ef93e8b4567","name":"Tomato Puree","type":"tomato-puree","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Puree","marketLabel":"tomato puree 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5aba35df7918d5096b2f","name":"Cajun Spice Mix","type":"cajun-style-spice","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Cajun Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60002d898c8c0a188200a96d","name":"Chicken Stock Paste","type":"chicken-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chicken Stock Paste","marketLabel":"chicken stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"66ab6339f66002bbd100b304","name":"Diced Chorizo","type":"chorizo-diced","family":"none","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced Chorizo","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"57484fa04dab7170318b4567","name":"Water","type":"water-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a half-full kettle. Pour it into a saucepan with ¼ tsp salt on high heat. Boil the rice, 10-12 mins. Once cooked, drain and pop back in the pan. Stir through the peas and cover.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, fry the chorizo, chicken and sweetcorn, 8-10 mins. Season with salt and pepper. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw meat. Cook so there's no pink in the middle. Add the tomato puree and Cajun spice mix. Fry for 1 min more.","Stir through the creme fraiche, chicken stock paste and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Simmer, 2-3 mins. Add the spinach in handfuls, making sure it's piping hot, 1-2 mins. Remove from the heat. Stir through the honey and butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) until melted.","Share the rice and peas between bowls. Top with the chicken and chorizo"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea21830d8e7c0c76664fe/step-d30b9700.jpg","caption":"Rice Time"},{"src":"