at once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30","sourceId":"695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30","title":"Meat-Free Chicken and Charred Corn Veggie Tacos","subtitle":"with Chipotle Soured Cream, Tomato Lime Salsa, Cheese and Wedges","time":35,"cost":17.98,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","latin-american-faves","handhelds","medium spice","new","hellofresh specials","mexican","wrap","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Bowl","Sieve","Aluminum Foil","Large Saucepan","Garlic Press","Grater","Small Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R80_W11_UK_SSFV45918-3_Main_QC_high-14bc2ffa.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fable-mushroom-chipotle-soured-cream-and-charred-corn-veggie-tacos-695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Lime"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["160 g","Plant-Based Soy Protein Chicken Pieces"],["20 g","Chipotle Paste"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["15 g","Honey"],["4","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"],["30 ml","water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Lime"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["160 g","Plant-Based Soy Protein Chicken Pieces"],["20 g","Chipotle Paste"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["15 g","Honey"],["4","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a39929ec9fd0814815939c2","name":"Potatoes","type":"potatoes","family":"potato","amount":"450 g","sourceAmount":450,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Potatoes","marketLabel":"potatoes 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6de44dab71a6058b456a","name":"Sweetcorn","type":"sweetcorn","family":"corn","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweetcorn","marketLabel":"sweetcorn tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"125 g","sourceAmount":125,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69146769623e0c85b6821082","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6745f3cd989edba91be2f0d8","name":"Plant-Based Soy Protein Chicken Pieces","type":"vegan-chicken-pieces","family":"none","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Plant-Based Soy Protein Chicken Pieces","priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a70affd2cb95a598b456f","name":"Chipotle Paste","type":"chipotle paste","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chipotle Paste","marketLabel":"cooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68382535f7d5496ac4a6a740","name":"Soured Cream","type":"soured-cream","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soured Cream","marketLabel":"soured cream 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59ad32ea2c3e08228606b422","name":"Central American Style Spice Mix","type":"central-american-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Central American Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683727bfd9848b9dac04fe03","name":"Plain Taco Tortillas","type":"plain-taco-tortilla","family":"none","amount":"4","sourceAmount":4.002,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Plain Taco Tortillas","marketLabel":"wraps or tortillas x8","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56b23e4ef8b25e4c2d8b4567","name":"Baby Leaf Mix","type":"premium baby leaf mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Leaf Mix","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb425688281450b8bd079","name":"Sugar for the Dressing","type":"sugar-for-the-dressing-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Dressing","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potatoes lengthways into 1cm slices, then chop into 1cm wide chips (no need to peel). Pop the chips onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary. When the oven is hot, bake on the top shelf until golden, 25-30 mins. Turn halfway through.","Meanwhile, drain the sweetcorn in a sieve. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. Once hot, add the sweetcorn and cook until charred, 5-6 mins. Adjust the heat if necessary. Stir only twice during this time - you want the sweetcorn to pick up some nice colour. Once charred, transfer to a bowl and cover with foil to keep warm.","Meanwhile, quarter the baby plum tomatoes. Cut the lime into wedges. In a medium bowl, combine a good squeeze of lime juice, the sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper and stir in the tomatoes. Grate the Cheddar cheese. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press).","Give the frying pan a quick clean, then return to medium heat with a drizzle of oil. Pan-fry the plant-based chicken until golden brown, 4-6 mins. Season with salt and pepper. Meanwhile, in a small bowl, mix together half the chipotle paste and the soured cream.","Once golden, add the garlic, Central American style spice mix, honey and remaining chipotle paste to the plant-based pieces and fry for 1 min more. If the measured honey is very thick, warm it briefly so it pours easily. Add a splash of water if it looks a little dry. Just before everything's ready, pop the tortillas (2 per person) into the oven to warm through, 1-2 mins.","When everything's ready, lay the tortillas onto your serving plates. Use the back of a spoon to spread the chipotle soured cream over the tortillas. Top with the a handful of the baby leaves, the chipotle plant-based chicken and the charred corn. Sprinkle on the cheese and scatter over half the chopped tomatoes. Add the remaining baby leaves to the remaining tomatoes and toss together. Serve the chips and salad alongside with any remaining lime wedges for squeezing over."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30/step-e3a68300.jpg","caption":"Chip Chip Hooray"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30/step-bf9a9f10.jpg","caption":"Char the Corn"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30/step-bd2c8920.jpg","caption":"Finish Prepping"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30/step-f2571930.jpg","caption":"Get Frying"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30/step-a1288140.jpg","caption":"Final Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30/step-da059b50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fable-mushroom-chipotle-soured-cream-and-charred-corn-veggie-tacos-695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/fable-mushroom-chipotle-soured-cream-and-charred-corn-veggie-tacos-695ea208c15b9f4be4dabb30","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"wrap","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["125 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["1","Lime"],["30 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["160 g","Plant-Based Soy Protein Chicken Pieces"],["20 g","Chipotle Paste"],["75 g","Soured Cream"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["15 g","Honey"],["4","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["50 g","Baby Leaf Mix"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Dressing"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"],["30 ml","water"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3","sourceId":"695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3","title":"Mediterranean Style Chicken Breast and Ditali Pasta Salad","subtitle":"with Roasted Chickpeas and Cheese","time":35,"cost":21.91,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["high protein","mediterranean","dinner-bowls","medium spice","poultry","salad","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Sieve","Large Saucepan","Bowl","Colander","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R17_W11_UK_R32637-9_Main_R32637-SP-1-1_var_high-01e2b8ff.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/mediterranean-style-chicken-breast-and-ditali-pasta-salad-695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Lemon"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Medium Tomato"],["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["90 g","Ditali Pasta"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Peri Peri Seasoning"],["50 g","Harissa Paste"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Lemon"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Medium Tomato"],["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["90 g","Ditali Pasta"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Peri Peri Seasoning"],["50 g","Harissa Paste"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60070aba8e7046341a491fcb","name":"Medium Tomato","type":"medium-tomato","family":"tomato","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Medium Tomato","marketLabel":"tomatoes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6387fd2cb99c598b4568","name":"Chickpeas","type":"organic chickpeas","family":"canned chickpeas","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chickpeas","marketLabel":"chickpeas 400g, 240g drained","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371e82d9848b9dac04fc52","name":"Ditali Pasta","type":"ditali-pasta","family":"none","amount":"90 g","sourceAmount":90,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ditali Pasta","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6390aea605fc26d5313f23d2","name":"Diced British Chicken Breast","type":"chicken-breast-diced","family":"none","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Diced British Chicken Breast","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837ac5df7d5496ac4a6831f","name":"Peri Peri Seasoning","type":"peri-peri-seasoning","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Peri Peri Seasoning","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c80fdf8b25e246c8b4567","name":"Harissa Paste","type":"rose-harissa-paste","family":"Chili sauce","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Harissa Paste","marketLabel":"harissa paste 130g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6764b4a77de812ab26271141","name":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","type":"greek-style-cheese","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Greek Style Salad Cheese","marketLabel":"feta 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e3416f081143769dd33ba49","name":"Sugar for the Pickle","type":"sugar-for-the-pickle-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Pickle","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt for the pasta. Cut the lemon into wedges. Halve and peel the red onion. Slice half the red onion as thinly as you can. Slice the remaining onion into 6 wedges. Cut the tomato into 1cm chunks. Drain and rinse the chickpeas in a sieve. Pat dry with kitchen paper. Spread the chickpeas and onion wedges onto a baking tray. Drizzle with oil and season. Toss to coat. When the oven is hot, roast on the middle shelf of your oven, 16-18 mins. Turn halfway through.","Pop the sliced onion into a small bowl and add half the lemon juice and sugar for the pickle (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Add a pinch of salt, mix together and set aside to pickle. When the water is boiling, add the ditali pasta and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir to stop it sticking together.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the diced chicken to the pan and season with salt and pepper. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Cook until browned all over and cooked through, 8-10 mins. Turn occasionally. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Sprinkle the peri peri over the chicken for the last 2 mins of fry time and turn to coat. Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine the harissa paste with the remaining lemon juice, honey and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Set aside.","Once everything's cooked, add the pasta, chicken, chickpeas and roasted onion to the large bowl with the harissa dressing. Toss together until evenly coated. Add the tomato, half the pickled onion and the pickle juices from the bowl and gently combine. Add the rocket leaves and toss to coat in the dressing.","Divide the salad between your bowls. Scatter with the remaining pickled onion and crumble over the cheese to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3/step-3fedaf00.jpg","caption":"Start the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3/step-e4bbfd10.jpg","caption":"Cook the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3/step-1ebfbd20.jpg","caption":"Fry the Chicken"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3/step-80ce8630.jpg","caption":"Make the Dressing"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3/step-fec4a640.jpg","caption":"Assemble the Salad"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3/step-f11c2b50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/mediterranean-style-chicken-breast-and-ditali-pasta-salad-695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/mediterranean-style-chicken-breast-and-ditali-pasta-salad-695ea1c7c15b9f4be4dabae3","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"salad","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Lemon"],["1","Red Onion"],["1","Medium Tomato"],["1 carton","Chickpeas"],["90 g","Ditali Pasta"],["240 g","Diced British Chicken Breast"],["1 sachet","Peri Peri Seasoning"],["50 g","Harissa Paste"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["50 g","Greek Style Salad Cheese"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["2 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9","sourceId":"695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9","title":"Spicy Prawn Linguine","subtitle":"with Veggie 'Nduja, Leek, Lemon and Spinach","time":25,"cost":19,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["pescatarian","quick","medium spice","regional-specialty","pasta-noodles","calorie smart","british","seafood","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Garlic Press","Kettle","Large Frying Pan","Colander","Large Saucepan","Zester"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R23_W11_UK_QR23389-12_MT_Main_high-a8263ad9.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spicy-prawn-linguine-695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Leek"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["180 g","Linguine"],["0.5","Lemon"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Vegan ‘Nduja"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["20 g","Butter"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Leek"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["180 g","Linguine"],["0.5","Lemon"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Vegan ‘Nduja"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["20 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e334dab71a9058b4567","name":"Leek","type":"leek","family":"leek","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Leek","marketLabel":"leeks 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55672166f8b25e412f8b4567","name":"Tomato Passata","type":"tomato passata","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Passata","marketLabel":"passata 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373081d9848b9dac050010","name":"Linguine","type":"linguine","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Linguine","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"0.5","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"64ad6bee48c7b9302c3330bc","name":"Vegan ‘Nduja","type":"vegan-nduja","family":"none","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegan ‘Nduja","marketLabel":"plant protein equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a full kettle. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Trim the root and dark green leafy part from the leek and discard. Halve lengthways, then thinly slice. Drain the prawns. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw prawns.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the leek and cook until softened, 4-6 mins. Once softened, add the garlic and fry for 1 min. Stir in the passata, veg stock paste and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then lower the heat and simmer until thickened slightly, 2-3 mins.","Meanwhile, pour the boiled water into a large saucepan with ½ tsp salt on high heat. Add the linguine and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Once the sauce has thickened, gently stir through the prawns. Simmer gently, stirring occasionally, until the prawns are cooked, 5-6 mins. The prawns are cooked when pink on the outside and opaque in the middle. While the prawns are cooking, zest and cut the lemon into wedges (use the amount listed in the ingredients).","Once cooked, add the spinach to the pan a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins. Stir through the Italian style cheese, veggie 'Nduja (use the listed amount; add less if you'd prefer things milder), honey and butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients), followed by the cooked linguine and some lemon juice from a lemon wedge. Taste and season with salt, pepper and more lemon juice if needed. Add a splash of water if it's a little too thick.","Share the prawn linguine between your serving bowls. Sprinkle over the lemon zest. Serve with any lemon wedges to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9/step-f71d1000.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9/step-1b710510.jpg","caption":"Make the Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9/step-16232520.jpg","caption":"Pasta Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9/step-b3485130.jpg","caption":"Poach the Prawns"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9/step-a0620440.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9/step-f22d4a50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spicy-prawn-linguine-695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/spicy-prawn-linguine-695ea1cec15b9f4be4dabae9","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Leek"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["180 g","Linguine"],["0.5","Lemon"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Vegan ‘Nduja"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["20 g","Butter"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-694beeab1676be04156e6a19","sourceId":"694beeab1676be04156e6a19","title":"Oven-Baked Sausage Risotto and Garlic Bread","subtitle":"with Hidden Veg: Tomatoes, Bell Pepper and Onion","time":45,"cost":21.53,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","hidden-veg","italian","pork","rice","cook"],"requiredEquipment":["blender"],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Garlic Press","Kettle","Blender","Lid","Large Saucepan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R26_W10_UK_F53397-3_edit_sausages_Mainhigh-386a4009.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/oven-baked-sausage-and-risotto-and-garlic-bread-694beeab1676be04156e6a19","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Onion"],["190 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["4","British Cumberland Sausages"],["4","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["650 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Onion"],["190 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["4","British Cumberland Sausages"],["4","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["650 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a59324dab71626c8b4575","name":"Onion","type":"onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Onion","marketLabel":"brown onions 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a3cee59c2880024501f6622","name":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","type":"baby-plum-tomatoes","family":"tomato","amount":"190 g","sourceAmount":190,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Plum Tomatoes","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"56d82283f8b25e9f418b4567","name":"British Cumberland Sausages","type":"cumberland-sausage","family":"beef veal pork","amount":"4","sourceAmount":4,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Cumberland Sausages","marketLabel":"herb equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"4","sourceAmount":4,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5992fd2cb95a598b456a","name":"Risotto Rice","type":"risotto-rice","family":"rice","amount":"175 g","sourceAmount":175,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Risotto Rice","marketLabel":"risotto rice 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"691c9f53bc8059f9ea10a506","name":"White Wine Stock Powder","type":"white-wine-stock-powder","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"White Wine Stock Powder","marketLabel":"vegetable stock concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5f327c6560efd3453038c2a8","name":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","type":"sundried-tomato-paste-duplicate","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","marketLabel":"sun-dried tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68c412723cfb117858763a9f","name":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","type":"basil-pesto-sauce","family":"none","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"602fb8be9c479d367f798aee","name":"Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread","type":"olive-oil-for-the-garlic-bread-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"61f968097f9b41760f4d2295","name":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","type":"boiled-water-for-the-risotto-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"650 ml","sourceAmount":650,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Slice into thin strips. Halve, peel and thinly slice the onion. Halve the baby plum tomatoes. Put the sausages, tomatoes, pepper and onion on a baking tray. Drizzle with oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and spread out in a single layer. Roast on the middle shelf until softened, 20-25 mins. Turn halfway through. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw meat. The sausages are cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Meanwhile, boil a full kettle. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the ciabatta and lay onto a baking tray, cut-side up. Spread over half the garlic and drizzle with the olive oil for the garlic bread (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Set aside. Hide the Veg: Once cooked, add the roasted tomatoes, pepper and onion to a blender. Blitz until smooth,1-2 mins. If you don't have a blender, set the veg aside in a small bowl. You can stir in the baked veg into the risotto at the end if preferred. When the sausages are cooked, slice into 2cm chunks.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large, wide-bottomed ovenproof pan on medium heat. If you don't have an ovenproof pan, use a normal pan and transfer to an ovenproof dish before baking. Add the remaining garlic and stir-fry for 1 min more. Add the risotto rice, stir and cook until the edges of the rice are translucent, 1-2 mins. Stir in the sausage chunks, blended veg, boiled water for the risotto and sugar for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and the white wine stock powder. Bring back up to the boil, then pop a lid on the pan (or cover with foil). Bake on the middle shelf of your oven until the rice is cooked and the water has been absorbed, 25-30 mins.","When the risotto is nearly ready, bake the garlic bread on the top shelf of your oven until golden, 4-5 mins.","When the risotto is cooked, remove it from the oven and stir through the hard Italian style cheese, butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and sun-dried tomato paste. Taste and season with salt and pepper if needed. Add a splash of water to loosen the risotto to your desired consistency.","Share your sausage and hidden veg risotto between your bowls. Drizzle over the pesto and scatter over the rocket leaves, if you wish. Serve with the garlic bread on the side."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beeab1676be04156e6a19/step-5cc46e00.jpg","caption":"Roast the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beeab1676be04156e6a19/step-737a2e10.jpg","caption":"Time to Blend"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beeab1676be04156e6a19/step-d8973120.jpg","caption":"Bake the Risotto"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beeab1676be04156e6a19/step-db28c730.jpg","caption":"Bake the Garlic Bread"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beeab1676be04156e6a19/step-8497b940.jpg","caption":"Add the Flavour"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beeab1676be04156e6a19/step-56d58450.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/oven-baked-sausage-and-risotto-and-garlic-bread-694beeab1676be04156e6a19","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/oven-baked-sausage-and-risotto-and-garlic-bread-694beeab1676be04156e6a19","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Onion"],["190 g","Baby Plum Tomatoes"],["4","British Cumberland Sausages"],["4","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["650 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62","sourceId":"695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62","title":"Super Green Cheesy Pesto Macaroni","subtitle":"with Hidden Broccoli","time":35,"cost":17.93,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","hidden-veg","family friendly","scout approved","new","american","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":["blender"],"sourceEquipment":["Colander","Large Saucepan","Grater","Blender"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R26_W11_UK_F53404-3_Main_QC_high-73cc6fe6.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/super-green-cheesy-pesto-macaroni-695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["200 g","Broccoli Florets"],["180 g","Macaroni"],["80 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["20 g","Butter for the Roux"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["200 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["200 g","Broccoli Florets"],["180 g","Macaroni"],["80 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["20 g","Butter for the Roux"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["200 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5a3be5d62c3e08459266fdc2","name":"Broccoli Florets","type":"broccoli-florets","family":"broccoli","amount":"200 g","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Broccoli Florets","marketLabel":"broccoli head","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68373081f7d5496ac4a65cee","name":"Macaroni","type":"macaroni","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Macaroni","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"69146769623e0c85b6821082","name":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","type":"cheddar-cheese","family":"hard cheese","amount":"80 g","sourceAmount":80,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mature Cheddar Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"75 g","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"691c9f53bc8059f9ea10a506","name":"White Wine Stock Powder","type":"white-wine-stock-powder","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"White Wine Stock Powder","marketLabel":"vegetable stock concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68c412723cfb117858763a9f","name":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","type":"basil-pesto-sauce","family":"none","amount":"30 g","sourceAmount":30,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6099506c9c6d58742c5645ca","name":"Balsamic Glaze","type":"balsamic-glaze","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 g","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Balsamic Glaze","marketLabel":"balsamic glaze equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6400aafb7cb532b7de19ed97","name":"Butter for the Roux","type":"butter-for-the-roux","family":"none","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter for the Roux","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60f9470be5a270ab7dbce1b8","name":"Plain Flour","type":"plain-flour-1-tbsp","family":"flour","amount":"1.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":1.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Plain Flour","marketLabel":"plain flour 1.5kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"200 ml","sourceAmount":200,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Bring a large saucepan of water with ½ tsp salt to the boil. Halve any large broccoli florets. When the water is boiling, add the broccoli and cook until tender, 4-5 mins. Once cooked, drain the broccoli in a colander. Leave to steam for 2 mins, uncovered.","Fill the (now empty) saucepan with water, add in ½ tsp salt and bring to the boil. When boiling, stir the macaroni into the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back into the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Meanwhile, grate the Cheddar cheese. Pop the drained broccoli in a blender along with the creme fraiche. Season with salt and pepper and blitz until completely smooth, 1-2 mins. This works best with a blender but if you don't have one, mash the broccoli in a bowl with a potato masher. Next, stir through the creme fraiche and set aside until the next step.","While the pasta cooks, melt the butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) in a large saucepan on medium heat. Stir in the flour (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Cook until it forms a paste, 1-2 mins - you've made a roux! Stir in the water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) a little at a time, followed by the white wine stock powder. Bring to the boil, then stir and simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins. Season with salt and pepper.","Once thickened, stir in the creamy blended broccoli mixture, Cheddar cheese and half the hard Italian style cheese until melted and combined, 1-2 mins. Stir in the cooked macaroni and pesto. Taste and season with salt and pepper if you feel it needs it. Add a splash of water if the sauce looks a little thick.","Share the super green mac and cheese between serving bowls. Serve the rocket alongside for those who'd like and drizzle over the balsamic glaze. Sprinkle the remaining hard Italian style cheese over the mac and cheese to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62/step-fcb22c00.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62/step-010b4010.jpg","caption":"Boil the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62/step-7cd76a20.jpg","caption":"Hide the Veg!"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62/step-bd3a7830.jpg","caption":"Start the Mac & Cheese"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62/step-13214940.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62/step-07b4ae50.jpg","caption":"Finish and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/super-green-cheesy-pesto-macaroni-695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/super-green-cheesy-pesto-macaroni-695ea228c15b9f4be4dabb62","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["200 g","Broccoli Florets"],["180 g","Macaroni"],["80 g","Mature Cheddar Cheese"],["75 g","Creme Fraiche"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["30 g","Basil Pesto with Cashew Nuts"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["20 g","Butter for the Roux"],["1.5 tbsp","Plain Flour"],["200 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e","sourceId":"695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e","title":"Weeknight Sticky Honey Beef Rice Bowl","subtitle":"with Pak Choi and Peanuts","time":20,"cost":17.35,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","quick","high protein","japanese","beef","rice"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Rolling Pin","Garlic Press","Kettle","Sieve","Medium Saucepan","Medium Bowl","Large Frying Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y24_R03_W49_UK_QF12279-28_Main_low-f4be3b73.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/weeknight-sticky-honey-beef-rice-bowl-695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Pak Choi"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["0.5","Lime"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["150 g","Jasmine Rice"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["120 g","Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix"],["15 g","Ginger Puree"],["40 g","Ketjap Manis"],["15 g","Honey"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Pak Choi"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["0.5","Lime"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["150 g","Jasmine Rice"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["120 g","Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix"],["15 g","Ginger Puree"],["40 g","Ketjap Manis"],["15 g","Honey"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"697cbee6d608bbef6ca06f3f","name":"Pak Choi","type":"bok-choy","family":"vegetable mix","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Pak Choi","marketLabel":"pak choi x2","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"0.5","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6877ced35a587f17f45951c6","name":"Salted Peanuts","type":"salted peanuts","family":"nut mix","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salted Peanuts","marketLabel":"table salt 750g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59b020d9c2880076673eb222","name":"Jasmine Rice","type":"jasmine-rice","family":"rice","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Jasmine Rice","marketLabel":"basmati rice 2kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c1c67fd2cb99f468b4567","name":"British Beef Mince","type":"beef mince","family":"beef","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Beef Mince","marketLabel":"5% fat beef mince 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5be4237630006c222055d042","name":"Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix","type":"coleslaw-mix","family":"salad mix","amount":"120 g","sourceAmount":120,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix","marketLabel":"carrots 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59f334f92c3e085ecd21b7f2","name":"Ginger Puree","type":"ginger-puree","family":"ginger","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ginger Puree","marketLabel":"fresh ginger 100g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"574eff80f8b25eab0d8b4567","name":"Ketjap Manis","type":"ketjap-manis","family":"sauce","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ketjap Manis","marketLabel":"Asian cooking sauce equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555363fff8b25e5e0c8b4567","name":"Honey","type":"honey","family":"honey","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"20 ml","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a half-full kettle. Trim the pak choi, then thinly slice widthways. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Cut the lime into wedges (use the amount listed in the ingredients). Crush the peanuts with a rolling pin or the base of a small saucepan.","Pour the boiled water into a large saucepan with ¼ tsp salt on high heat. Add the rice and cook for 12-13 mins. Once cooked, drain in a sieve and pop back in the pan. Cover with a lid and leave to the side until ready to serve.","While the rice cooks, heat a large frying pan on medium-high heat (no oil). Once hot, add the beef mince and fry until browned, 5-6 mins. Use a spoon to break it up as it cooks, then drain and discard any excess fat. Season with salt and pepper. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Add the pak choi and sliced carrot and cabbage mix to the beef. Stir-fry until just tender, 2-3 mins. Stir in the garlic and ginger puree. Cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.","Add the ketjap manis, honey, soy sauce and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) to the pan. If your honey has hardened, pop it in a bowl of hot water for 1 min. Cook until the sauce has thickened, 2-3 mins. Taste and season with salt, pepper and a good squeeze of lime juice. Add a splash of water if the sauce is a little thick.","When ready, share the rice between your bowls and top with the sticky honey beef. Sprinkle over the peanuts. Serve with any remaining lime wedges for squeezing over."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e/step-4c45ef00.jpg","caption":"Get Prepped"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e/step-c5fee810.jpg","caption":"Cook the Rice"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e/step-5ba57c20.jpg","caption":"Brown the Beef"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e/step-d4800130.jpg","caption":"Bring on the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e/step-d3987d40.jpg","caption":"Sauce Things Up"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e/step-97b84850.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/weeknight-sticky-honey-beef-rice-bowl-695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/weeknight-sticky-honey-beef-rice-bowl-695ea1dd2a2e2effad18aa6e","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Pak Choi"],["1","Garlic Clove"],["0.5","Lime"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["150 g","Jasmine Rice"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["120 g","Sliced Carrot and Cabbage Mix"],["15 g","Ginger Puree"],["40 g","Ketjap Manis"],["15 g","Honey"],["20 ml","Soy Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6","sourceId":"693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6","title":"Speedy Jerk Beef Tacos","subtitle":"with Bell Pepper, Pickled Onion and Kiwi","time":25,"cost":19.87,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["quick","medium spice","fusion","beef","wrap"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Small Bowl","Large Frying Pan","Large Salad Bowl"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R35_W06_UK_QR50727-3_Main_8_high-6bd7fb0a.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-jerk-beef-tacos-693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Red Onion"],["1","Lime"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Kiwi"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["50 g","Jerk Paste"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["0.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["2 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Red Onion"],["1","Lime"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Kiwi"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["50 g","Jerk Paste"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["0.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["2 tbsp","Mayonnaise"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6e2a4dab71a9058b4569","name":"Lime","type":"lime","family":"lime","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lime","marketLabel":"limes x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632cf717b4f4bc890195c7d3","name":"Bell Pepper","type":"bell-pepper","family":"pepper","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Bell Pepper","marketLabel":"peppers pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fb4f11b1a59b93e9336185a","name":"Kiwi","type":"fruit","family":"kiwi","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Kiwi","marketLabel":"fresh fruit equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68ecc674fa624b85e8848c26","name":"Baby Gem Lettuce","type":"baby gem lettuce","family":"salad mix","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Gem Lettuce","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"556c1c67fd2cb99f468b4567","name":"British Beef Mince","type":"beef mince","family":"beef","amount":"240 g","sourceAmount":240,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Beef Mince","marketLabel":"5% fat beef mince 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"679b631d33196a355d1e51aa","name":"Jerk Paste","type":"jerk-paste","family":"none","amount":"50 g","sourceAmount":50,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Jerk Paste","marketLabel":"cooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683727bfd9848b9dac04fe03","name":"Plain Taco Tortillas","type":"plain-taco-tortilla","family":"none","amount":"6","sourceAmount":6,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Plain Taco Tortillas","marketLabel":"wraps or tortillas x8","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e3416f081143769dd33ba49","name":"Sugar for the Pickle","type":"sugar-for-the-pickle-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Pickle","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"0.5 tbsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6172cb313021d49a7feafc84","name":"Honey","type":"honey-1-tbsp","family":"honey","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Honey","marketLabel":"runny honey 340g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbe487e8afb1b135f069bd2","name":"Mayonnaise","type":"mayonnaise-tbsp","family":"mayonnaise","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Mayonnaise","marketLabel":"mayonnaise 500ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["If you don't have a microwave, heat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7 for the tortillas. Halve, peel and slice the red onion as thinly as you can. Halve the lime. Pop half the onion into a small bowl and add half the lime juice and sugar for the pickle (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Add a pinch of salt, mix together and set aside to pickle. Halve the bell pepper and discard the core and seeds. Slice into thin strips. Peel the kiwi, then cut into 1cm chunks. Trim the baby gem, separate the leaves, then tear into bite-sized pieces.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat. Once hot, add the beef mince, pepper and remaining red onion. Fry until the mince has browned and the veg has softened, 8-10 mins. Use a spoon to break it up as it cooks. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince. When the mince has browned, drain and discard any excess fat. Season with salt and pepper. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw mince. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","While the mince is frying, in a large bowl, combine the remaining lime juice with the olive oil for the dressing and the sugar (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper. Set aside.","Once the mince and veg have cooked, stir in the jerk paste. Stir-fry for 1 min. Stir in the honey (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and remove the pan from the heat.","When everything's ready, pile the tortillas (3 per person) onto a plate. Heat them through in the microwave, 850W: 50 secs / 750W: 1 min, until warm and soft.b) If you're using the oven, pop them into the oven to warm through, 1-2 mins. Add the lettuce leaves to the bowl with the lime dressing. Toss to evenly coat.","Share your tacos between plates and top with the lettuce leaves, beef and veg. Finish the tacos with the kiwi and pickled onion. Drizzle over the mayonnaise (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6/step-aa857c00.jpg","caption":"Start the Prep"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6/step-09fbc810.jpg","caption":"Fry the Mince"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6/step-0aa6a720.jpg","caption":"Dress the Salad"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6/step-b5e91330.jpg","caption":"Dress the Salad"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6/step-8125c540.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6/step-518e2b50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-jerk-beef-tacos-693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/speedy-jerk-beef-tacos-693073827558b9c7de4dc3f6","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"wrap","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Red Onion"],["1","Lime"],["1","Bell Pepper"],["1","Kiwi"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["240 g","British Beef Mince"],["50 g","Jerk Paste"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["0.5 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Honey"],["2 tbsp","Mayonnaise"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-694bee6d1676be04156e69cd","sourceId":"694bee6d1676be04156e69cd","title":"Central American Prawn and Corn Oven-Baked Risotto","subtitle":"with Lemon Dressed Asparagus and Rocket","time":35,"cost":24.14,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["prepped in 10","regional-specialty","pasta-noodles","pescatarian","medium spice","british","seafood","rice","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Sieve","Garlic Press","Kettle","Large Oven-Proof Pan","Bowl","Baking Tray"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R27_W26_UK_V32721-3_Main__10prawns_edit_high-cd156f22.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/central-american-prawn-and-corn-oven-baked-risotto-694bee6d1676be04156e69cd","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Onion"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["1","Lemon"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["600 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["20 g","Butter"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Onion"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["1","Lemon"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["600 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["20 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a59324dab71626c8b4575","name":"Onion","type":"onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Onion","marketLabel":"brown onions 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a6de44dab71a6058b456a","name":"Sweetcorn","type":"sweetcorn","family":"corn","amount":"160 g","sourceAmount":160,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sweetcorn","marketLabel":"sweetcorn tin","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"59ad32ea2c3e08228606b422","name":"Central American Style Spice Mix","type":"central-american-style-spice-mix","family":"spice blend","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Central American Style Spice Mix","marketLabel":"seasoning blend equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5992fd2cb95a598b456a","name":"Risotto Rice","type":"risotto-rice","family":"rice","amount":"175 g","sourceAmount":175,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Risotto Rice","marketLabel":"risotto rice 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"691c9f53bc8059f9ea10a506","name":"White Wine Stock Powder","type":"white-wine-stock-powder","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"White Wine Stock Powder","marketLabel":"vegetable stock concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a58da4dab71d76f8b4573","name":"Asparagus","type":"asparagus-bundles","family":"asparagus","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Asparagus","marketLabel":"fresh vegetable equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308142dc4b928197f3b3","name":"Crispy Onions","type":"crispy-onions","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Crispy Onions","marketLabel":"crispy onions 75g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"61f968097f9b41760f4d2295","name":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","type":"boiled-water-for-the-risotto-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"600 ml","sourceAmount":600,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Boiled Water for the Risotto","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555093924dab71e7118b4568","name":"Sugar","type":"sugar-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"0.5 tsp","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb168688281450b8bd062","name":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","type":"olive-oil-for-the-dressing-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Dressing","marketLabel":"cooking oil 1 litre","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Boil a full kettle. Halve, peel and thinly slice the onion. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Drain the sweetcorn in a sieve. If you prefer hob cooking your risotto, just use a normal pan.","Heat a drizzle of oil in a large, wide-bottomed ovenproof pan on medium heat. If you don't have an ovenproof pan, use a normal pan and transfer to an ovenproof dish before baking. Once hot, add the onion and corn and cook until softened slightly, 4-5 mins. Next, add the garlic, Central American style spice mix and risotto rice. Stir and cook until the edges of the rice are translucent, 1-2 mins. Stir in the boiled water for the risotto (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and white wine stock powder. Bring back up to the boil, then pop a lid on the pan (or cover with foil). For hob cooking, pour in 2p: 800ml, 3p: 1200ml, 4p: 1600ml of boiled water a third at a time, stirring each time until the stock has been absorbed, 20-25 mins.","Bake the risotto on the middle shelf of your oven until the rice is cooked and the water has been absorbed, 25-30 mins. In the meantime, trim the bottom 2cm from the asparagus and discard. Cut the lemon into wedges. In a large bowl, add half the lemon juice with the sugar and olive oil for the dressing (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Season with salt and pepper, then set aside for later.","When 12 mins of risotto cooking time remain, pop the asparagus onto a baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Roast on the bottom shelf until tender, 11-13 mins. When the risotto has 10 mins left, drain the prawns. Add to the risotto and cook for the remaining time, 5-6 mins. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw prawns. Cook so they're opaque in the middle.","Once your risotto has finished cooking, remove from the oven and stir through the hard Italian style cheese and butter (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Add a squeeze of lemon juice. Taste and season with more salt, pepper and lemon juice if needed. Add a splash of water to loosen the risotto to your desired consistency.","When you're ready to serve, add the rocket to the bowl of dressing and toss to coat. Share your risotto out between your bowls and top with the lemon-dressed rocket and roasted asparagus. Sprinkle over the crispy onions to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6d1676be04156e69cd/step-b30d7300.jpg","caption":"Prep Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6d1676be04156e69cd/step-6500b010.jpg","caption":"Get Frying"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6d1676be04156e69cd/step-688c5c20.jpg","caption":"Time to Bake"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6d1676be04156e69cd/step-307f1730.jpg","caption":"Roast the Asparagus"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6d1676be04156e69cd/step-a2e18440.jpg","caption":"Finishing Touches"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6d1676be04156e69cd/step-ac56e650.jpg","caption":"Dinner Time"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/central-american-prawn-and-corn-oven-baked-risotto-694bee6d1676be04156e69cd","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/central-american-prawn-and-corn-oven-baked-risotto-694bee6d1676be04156e69cd","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"rice","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Onion"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["160 g","Sweetcorn"],["1 sachet","Central American Style Spice Mix"],["175 g","Risotto Rice"],["1 sachet","White Wine Stock Powder"],["100 g","Asparagus"],["1","Lemon"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["1 sachet","Crispy Onions"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["600 ml","Boiled Water for the Risotto"],["0.5 tsp","Sugar"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Dressing"],["20 g","Butter"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6","sourceId":"694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6","title":"Cheese and Tomato THIS™ Isn't Sausage Pasta","subtitle":"with Kale and Balsamic Rocket Salad","time":25,"cost":14.57,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["veggie","quick","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","new","high protein","italian","pasta"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Colander","Large Saucepan","Pan","Garlic Press"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y26_R45_W10_UK_HVV26116-6_Main_high-9718a258.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cheese-and-tomato-this-isnt-sausage-pasta-694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Red Onion"],["6","THIS™ Isn't Pork Sausages"],["100 g","Chopped Kale"],["180 g","Rigatoni Pasta"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Red Onion"],["6","THIS™ Isn't Pork Sausages"],["100 g","Chopped Kale"],["180 g","Rigatoni Pasta"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"554a6fb4fd2cb95a598b456e","name":"Red Onion","type":"red onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Onion","marketLabel":"red onions x3","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683656b9f7d5496ac4a64268","name":"THIS™ Isn't Pork Sausages","type":"this-isnt-pork-sausages","family":"none","amount":"6","sourceAmount":6,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"THIS™ Isn't Pork Sausages","marketLabel":"herb equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6242043ddf35475d1660ada1","name":"Chopped Kale","type":"chopped-kale","family":"kale","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chopped Kale","marketLabel":"curly kale 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308142dc4b928197f3ad","name":"Rigatoni Pasta","type":"rigatoni-pasta","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Rigatoni Pasta","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5f327c6560efd3453038c2a8","name":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","type":"sundried-tomato-paste-duplicate","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","marketLabel":"sun-dried tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55672166f8b25e412f8b4567","name":"Tomato Passata","type":"tomato passata","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Passata","marketLabel":"passata 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"633c6597aa3f33c15c854bb0","name":"Mixed Herbs","type":"mixed-herbs","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mixed Herbs","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5a4fc599c288003649295c52","name":"Red Wine Stock Paste","type":"red-wine-stock-pot","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"28 g","sourceAmount":28,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Red Wine Stock Paste","marketLabel":"beef cooking concentrate equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6099506c9c6d58742c5645ca","name":"Balsamic Glaze","type":"balsamic-glaze","family":"vinegar","amount":"12 g","sourceAmount":12,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Balsamic Glaze","marketLabel":"balsamic glaze equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Halve, peel and thinly slice the red onion. Slice the THIS™ Isn't Pork Sausages into 1cm rounds. Discard any tough stalks from the kale.","Bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt. When boiling, add the rigatoni to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan on medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. When hot, fry the THIS™ Isn't Pork Sausages and onion, stirring occasionally, until the onion has softened and the sausage pieces are golden, 6-8 mins. Ensure the sausage pieces are piping hot throughout","Meanwhile, peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Add the kale and garlic to the sausage and onion and fry until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in the sun-dried tomato paste, passata, mixed herbs, red wine stock paste, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat and simmer until thickened, 3-4 mins.","Stir the cheese into the sauce until melted. Stir the cooked rigatoni into the pasta sauce. Add a splash of water if it's a little too thick. Season with salt and pepper.","Share the sausage pasta between your serving bowls. Top with the rocket leaves. Finish by drizzling over the balsamic glaze."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6/step-835fa000.jpg","caption":"Get Started"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6/step-c825be10.jpg","caption":"Boil the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6/step-7f0ccb20.jpg","caption":"Get Frying"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6/step-29f0d230.jpg","caption":"Sauce Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6/step-35155340.jpg","caption":"All Together Now"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6/step-9446cf50.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cheese-and-tomato-this-isnt-sausage-pasta-694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/cheese-and-tomato-this-isnt-sausage-pasta-694bee512e3f6a49648ef4e6","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Red Onion"],["6","THIS™ Isn't Pork Sausages"],["100 g","Chopped Kale"],["180 g","Rigatoni Pasta"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["28 g","Red Wine Stock Paste"],["20 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["12 g","Balsamic Glaze"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4","sourceId":"6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4","title":"Pizza Inspired Chorizo and Chicken Pasta Bake","subtitle":"with Spinach, Garlic Ciabatta and Rocket","time":40,"cost":28.67,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["comfort food","family friendly","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","high protein","italian","pork","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking Tray","Garlic Press","Medium Saucepan","Pan","Colander","Oven dish"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y23_R10_W47_UK_F14691-5_Main_Rocket_edit_F14691-AP-1-1_var_high-4c741b2f.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/pizza-inspired-chorizo-and-chicken-pasta-bake-6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["3","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["180 g","Rigatoni Pasta"],["1","Onion"],["10","Chorizo Slices"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["1 ball","Mozzarella"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["3","Garlic Clove"],["1","Ciabatta"],["180 g","Rigatoni Pasta"],["1","Onion"],["10","Chorizo Slices"],["1 carton","Tomato Passata"],["25 g","Sun-Dried Tomato Paste"],["10 g","Chicken Stock Paste"],["1 sachet","Mixed Herbs"],["1 ball","Mozzarella"],["40 g","Baby Spinach"],["20 g","Wild Rocket"],["2","British Chicken Breasts"],["1 tbsp","Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["75 ml","Water for the Sauce"],["20 g","Butter"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"3","sourceAmount":3,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68371fec42dc4b928197f195","name":"Ciabatta","type":"ciabatta","family":"bread dough","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Ciabatta","marketLabel":"bread loaf","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308142dc4b928197f3ad","name":"Rigatoni Pasta","type":"rigatoni-pasta","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Rigatoni Pasta","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a59324dab71626c8b4575","name":"Onion","type":"onion","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Onion","marketLabel":"brown onions 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"656e68f02db9273db6a42986","name":"Chorizo Slices","type":"sliced-chorizo","family":"pork","amount":"10","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chorizo Slices","marketLabel":"prepared pork product equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"55672166f8b25e412f8b4567","name":"Tomato Passata","type":"tomato passata","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"1 carton","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"carton(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Tomato Passata","marketLabel":"passata 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5f327c6560efd3453038c2a8","name":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","type":"sundried-tomato-paste-duplicate","family":"single ingredient paste","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Sun-Dried Tomato Paste","marketLabel":"sun-dried tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60002d898c8c0a188200a96d","name":"Chicken Stock Paste","type":"chicken-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Chicken Stock Paste","marketLabel":"chicken stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"633c6597aa3f33c15c854bb0","name":"Mixed Herbs","type":"mixed-herbs","family":"none","amount":"1 sachet","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"sachet(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mixed Herbs","marketLabel":"dried herbs jar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555087684dab71e3118b4569","name":"Mozzarella","type":"mozzarella","family":"hard cheese","amount":"1 ball","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"ball(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Mozzarella","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555092a4f8b25ed3468b4569","name":"Wild Rocket","type":"rocket","family":"salad mix","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Wild Rocket","marketLabel":"rocket 60g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a5e56f8b25ed7288b4576","name":"British Chicken Breasts","type":"chicken-fillet","family":"chicken","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"British Chicken Breasts","marketLabel":"British chicken breast fillets 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"602fb8be9c479d367f798aee","name":"Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread","type":"olive-oil-for-the-garlic-bread-1-tbsp","family":"oil","amount":"1 tbsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Olive Oil for the Garlic Bread","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb104688281450b8bd061","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-100ml","family":"other drink","amount":"75 ml","sourceAmount":75,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"60c73507053f5e815cd52d5b","name":"Butter","type":"butter-100g","family":"butter","amount":"20 g","sourceAmount":20,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Butter","marketLabel":"butter 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Halve the ciabatta and lay onto one side of a large baking tray, cut-side up. Spread over half the garlic and drizzle with the olive oil for the garlic bread (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Set aside for now. Meanwhile, bring a large saucepan of water to the boil with ½ tsp salt.","When the water is boiling, add the rigatoni to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. Once cooked, drain in a colander and pop back in the pan. Drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together. Meanwhile, halve, peel and chop the onion into small pieces. Tear half the chorizo slices into small pieces. Heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on medium-high heat.","Once the oil is hot, add the onion and diced chicken. Fry until the onion is softened and the chicken is browned all over, 5-6 mins. Notice a stronger smell from your chicken? Don’t worry, this is normal due to packaging we use to keep it fresh. Once softened, add the chorizo pieces and remaining garlic to the pan. Fry until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in the passata, sun-dried tomato paste, chicken stock paste, mixed herbs and sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat and simmer until thickened, 4-5 mins. Wash your hands and equipment after handling raw chicken. It's cooked when no longer pink in the middle.","Meanwhile, preheat your grill to high. Drain and tear the mozzarella. Add the spinach to the sauce a handful at a time until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins. Stir the butter, cooked pasta and half the mozzarella pieces into the sauce until the cheese has melted. Taste and season with salt and pepper. Add a splash of water if the sauce is looking a little thick.","Transfer the tomato pasta to an appropriately sized ovenproof dish. Top with the remaining mozzarella pieces, then lay the remaining chorizo slices on top. Pop your ovenproof dish onto the baking tray alongside the garlic ciabatta. Grill until the ciabatta is golden and the pasta is bubbling, 5-6 mins. Grill them separately if you run out of space. When the garlic ciabatta is ready, cut in half diagonally.","Share the pizza inspired pasta bake between your serving bowls. Top the pastas with a handful of rocket and drizzle a little oil over the leaves. Serve the garlic ciabatta alongside to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4/step-45475900.jpg","caption":"Make the Garlic Ciabatta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4/step-67d42110.jpg","caption":"Cook the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4/step-cb05d420.jpg","caption":"Sauce Things Up"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4/step-cd9af330.jpg","caption":"Cheese Please"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4/step-80ded940.jpg","caption":"Get Grilling"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4/step-4b077b50.jpg","caption":"Serve Up"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/pizza-inspired-chorizo-and-chicken-pasta-bake-6930734e7558b9c7de4dc3b4","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.u