ooking paste equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"680b9d014a6668c89d92df5a","name":"Soy Sauce","type":"soy sauce","family":"sauce","amount":"10 ml","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Soy Sauce","marketLabel":"soy sauce 150ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"683727bfd9848b9dac04fe03","name":"Plain Taco Tortillas","type":"plain-taco-tortilla","family":"none","amount":"6","sourceAmount":6,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Plain Taco Tortillas","marketLabel":"wraps or tortillas x8","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6877ced35a587f17f45951c6","name":"Salted Peanuts","type":"salted peanuts","family":"nut mix","amount":"25 g","sourceAmount":25,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Salted Peanuts","marketLabel":"table salt 750g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"68ecc674fa624b85e8848c26","name":"Baby Gem Lettuce","type":"baby gem lettuce","family":"salad mix","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Gem Lettuce","marketLabel":"lettuce or salad leaves","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbeb612688281450b8bd07c","name":"Sugar for the Sauce","type":"sugar-for-the-sauce-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Sauce","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"602fb0d49c479d367f798aed","name":"Water for the Sauce","type":"water-for-the-sauce-1-tbsp","family":"other drink","amount":"2 tbsp","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"tbsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Water for the Sauce","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5e3416f081143769dd33ba49","name":"Sugar for the Pickle","type":"sugar-for-the-pickle-1-tsp","family":"single spice","amount":"1 tsp","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"tsp","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Sugar for the Pickle","marketLabel":"granulated sugar 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat your oven to 220°C/200°C fan/gas mark 7. Chop the potatoes into 2cm wide wedges (no need to peel). Pop onto a large baking tray. Drizzle with oil, season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat. Spread out in a single layer. Use two baking trays if necessary.","Remove the confit duck legs from their packaging and place on a lined baking tray, skin-side up. Sprinkle over half the Chinese Five Spice and rub all over the duck. When the oven is hot, roast the duck on the top shelf and the wedges on the middle shelf until the duck is piping hot and the wedges are golden, 25-35 mins. Ensure the duck is piping hot throughout. Turn the wedges halfway through.","Meanwhile, halve the plums, remove the stones and chop the flesh into 1cm pieces. Heat a drizzle of oil in a medium frying pan on medium heat. Once hot, add the plums and remaining Chinese Five Spice and stir-fry until softened, 4-5 mins. Stir in the hoisin sauce, sugar and water for the sauce (use the quantities listed in the ingredients). Simmer, stirring regularly, until the plums have completely softened and the sauce has thickened, 10-12 mins. Taste and add more sugar if you'd prefer it a bit sweeter. Once cooked, transfer to a small bowl to cool.","While the sauce simmers, trim and thinly slice the radishes. Pop the radishes into a small bowl and add the sugar (use the quantities listed in the ingredients) and half the rice vinegar. Add a pinch of salt, mix together and set aside. Trim the cucumber, then pop onto a board and use a rolling pin to gently smack it a few times until split. Cut the smacked cucumber into 1cm chunks and put it into a bowl. Pour over the remaining rice vinegar, sambal and soy sauce. Mix together and set your spicy smacked cucumber aside.","When everything's nearly ready, pop the tortillas (3 per person) onto a baking tray and into the oven to warm through, 1-2 mins. Crush the peanuts with a rolling pin or the base of a small saucepan. Trim the baby gem, halve lengthways, then thinly slice. Once the duck is piping hot, remove it from the oven and use two forks to pull the meat off the bones. Shred finely, then discard the bones. Add the baby gem to the radishes and toss together.","Share the tortillas between your plates. Top with the radishes and baby gem, then spoon over the duck and plum sauce. Scatter over the crushed peanuts to finish - as much as you'd like. Serve the smacked cucumber salad and wedges alongside."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beead2e3f6a49648ef564/step-da6e8f00.jpg","caption":"Prep the Wedges"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beead2e3f6a49648ef564/step-4f7dac10.jpg","caption":"Roast the Duck"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beead2e3f6a49648ef564/step-93d27920.jpg","caption":"Plum Sauce Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beead2e3f6a49648ef564/step-b3d14630.jpg","caption":"Prep the Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beead2e3f6a49648ef564/step-f273d540.jpg","caption":"It's a Wrap"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694beead2e3f6a49648ef564/step-8c8f9a50.jpg","caption":"Assemble and Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/crispy-chinese-style-duck-tacos-and-plum-sauce-694beead2e3f6a49648ef564","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/crispy-chinese-style-duck-tacos-and-plum-sauce-694beead2e3f6a49648ef564","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"wrap","shoppingIngredients":[["450 g","Potatoes"],["2","Confit British Duck Legs"],["1 sachet","Chinese Five Spice"],["2","Plum"],["60 g","Hoisin Sauce"],["100 g","Radishes"],["30 ml","Rice Vinegar"],["1","Baby Cucumber"],["15 g","Sambal Paste"],["10 ml","Soy Sauce"],["6","Plain Taco Tortillas"],["25 g","Salted Peanuts"],["1","Baby Gem Lettuce"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Sauce"],["2 tbsp","Water for the Sauce"],["1 tsp","Sugar for the Pickle"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"imageQa":{"status":"verified","reason":"Exact finished-dish photograph declared by the published recipe source."},"methodProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source.","preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-hf-694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe","sourceId":"694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe","title":"Creamy Citrus Prawn and Courgette Rigatoni","subtitle":"with Garlicky Greens and Flaked Almonds","time":35,"cost":15,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["family friendly","mediterranean","pasta-noodles","pescatarian","italian","seafood","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Zester","Garlic Press","Large Saucepan","Colander","Bowl","Pan"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/image/HF_Y25_R08_W50_UK_R1702-70_prawns_edit_Main_high-0b71d737.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-citrus-prawn-and-courgette-rigatoni-694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published HelloFresh UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","Echalion Shallot"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Courgette"],["0.5","Lemon"],["180 g","Rigatoni Pasta"],["100 g","Baby Spinach"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["15 g","Toasted Flaked Almonds"],["100 ml","Reserved Pasta Water"],["as needed","cooking oil"],["to taste","salt"],["to taste","black pepper"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","Echalion Shallot"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Courgette"],["0.5","Lemon"],["180 g","Rigatoni Pasta"],["100 g","Baby Spinach"],["150 g","King Prawns"],["150 g","Creme Fraiche"],["10 g","Vegetable Stock Paste"],["40 g","Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese"],["15 g","Toasted Flaked Almonds"],["100 ml","Reserved Pasta Water"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"id":"5568817d4dab71121f8b4568","name":"Echalion Shallot","type":"echalion shallot","family":"onion","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Echalion Shallot","marketLabel":"brown onions 1kg","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"58f11054d56afa789e7f2b22","name":"Garlic Clove","type":"garlic-clove","family":"garlic","amount":"2","sourceAmount":2,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Garlic Clove","marketLabel":"garlic bulbs equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a727dfd2cb959598b4574","name":"Courgette","type":"courgette","family":"zucchini","amount":"1","sourceAmount":1,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Courgette","marketLabel":"courgettes pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"554a72ebfd2cb95a598b4570","name":"Lemon","type":"lemon","family":"lemon","amount":"0.5","sourceAmount":0.5,"sourceUnit":"unit(s)","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Lemon","marketLabel":"lemons x4","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308142dc4b928197f3ad","name":"Rigatoni Pasta","type":"rigatoni-pasta","family":"other noodle","amount":"180 g","sourceAmount":180,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Rigatoni Pasta","marketLabel":"pasta 500g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555c9dd5fd2cb92f6c8b4569","name":"Baby Spinach","type":"baby spinach","family":"spinach","amount":"100 g","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Baby Spinach","marketLabel":"spinach 200g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"632c5abbb4f4bc890195c7a6","name":"King Prawns","type":"king prawns","family":"seafood preparation","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"King Prawns","marketLabel":"large king prawns 150g","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"555084f34dab718e128b4569","name":"Creme Fraiche","type":"creme-fraiche","family":"soured cream","amount":"150 g","sourceAmount":150,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Creme Fraiche","marketLabel":"creme fraiche 300ml","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"641093570565a60137055ba9","name":"Vegetable Stock Paste","type":"vegetable-stock-paste","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"10 g","sourceAmount":10,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Vegetable Stock Paste","marketLabel":"vegetable stock cubes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5550865efd2cb974658b4568","name":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","type":"grated-hard-italian-style-cheese-duplicate","family":"hard cheese","amount":"40 g","sourceAmount":40,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Grated Hard Italian Style Cheese","marketLabel":"cheese pack","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"6837308042dc4b928197f3a9","name":"Toasted Flaked Almonds","type":"toasted-flaked-almonds","family":"none","amount":"15 g","sourceAmount":15,"sourceUnit":"grams","shipped":true,"shoppingName":"Toasted Flaked Almonds","marketLabel":"nuts and seeds equivalent","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"id":"5fbe496c04c348699907c2a2","name":"Reserved Pasta Water","type":"reserved-pasta-water-100ml","family":"stock concentrate","amount":"100 ml","sourceAmount":100,"sourceUnit":"milliliter(s)","shipped":false,"shoppingName":"Reserved Pasta Water","marketLabel":"tap water","marketChecked":false,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Put a large saucepan of water with ½ tsp salt on to boil for the pasta. Halve, peel and thinly slice the shallot. Peel and grate the garlic (or use a garlic press). Trim the courgette and slice into 1cm thick rounds. Zest and halve the lemon (use the amount listed in the ingredients).","Once boiling, add the rigatoni to the water and bring back to the boil. Cook until tender, 12 mins. When ready, reserve some of the pasta water (use the quantities listed in the ingredients), then drain in a colander. Pop the pasta back into the pan, drizzle with oil and stir through to stop it sticking together.","Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of oil in a large frying pan on high heat. When hot, add the courgette and cook until charred, 3-4 mins each side. Once cooked, lower the heat, then stir in the garlic and cook for 1 min more. Season with salt and pepper. Add the spinach a handful at a time and cook until wilted and piping hot, 1-2 mins. Once cooked, transfer everything to a large bowl and cover to keep warm.","Put your (now empty) frying pan back on medium-high heat with a drizzle of oil. Drain the prawns. Once hot, add the prawns and shallot and cook, stirring occasionally, 2-3 mins. Stir in the veg stock paste and reserved pasta water, then simmer until reduced by half, 3-4 mins. Mix in the creme fraiche and heat through until piping hot, then season with pepper. Wash hands and utensils after handling raw prawns. Cook so they're opaque in the middle.","Stir three quarters of the hard Italian style cheese through your creamy sauce. Add the cooked pasta and the cooked green veg and stir well to combine. Simmer until everything's piping hot, 1-2 mins. Add a pinch of lemon zest and a squeeze of lemon juice. Taste and add more salt, pepper and lemon juice if needed. Add a splash of water if it's a little too thick.","Share the creamy pasta between your bowls. Sprinkle over the remaining hard Italian style cheese and flaked almonds to finish."],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe/step-81230f00.jpg","caption":"Prep Time"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe/step-fac05010.jpg","caption":"Cook the Pasta"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe/step-47730020.jpg","caption":"Stir-Fry the Green Veg"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe/step-97e01230.jpg","caption":"Make the Creamy Sauce"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe/step-fa236d40.jpg","caption":"Combine and Stir"},{"src":"https://d3hvwccx09j84u.cloudfront.net/0,0/694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe/step-750c9450.jpg","caption":"Serve"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"HelloFresh UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-citrus-prawn-and-courgette-rigatoni-694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe","recipeSource":"HelloFresh UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.hellofresh.co.uk/recipes/creamy-citrus-prawn-and-courgette-rigatoni-694bee6b2e3f6a49648ef4fe","recipeProvenance":"Published HelloFresh UK recipe retained as the cooking source; My Week normalisation is limited to app display, pantry visibility and supermarket planning.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","lunchBucket":"pasta","shoppingIngredients":[["1","Echalion Shallot"],["2","Garlic Clove"],["1","Courgette"],["0.5","Lemon"]