to"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Sugar"]],"sourceIngredients":[["2","white potato"],["1","carrot"],["320 g","free range chicken thighs"],["40 g","harissa paste"],["1 tsp","ground smoked paprika"],["50 g","baby leaf salad"],["80 g","natural yoghurt"],["15 ml","cider vinegar"],["1","red onion"],["1","sweet potato"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"white potato","amount":"2","shoppingName":"white potato","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"carrot","amount":"1","shoppingName":"carrot","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"free range chicken thighs","amount":"320 g","shoppingName":"free range chicken thighs","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"harissa paste","amount":"40 g","shoppingName":"harissa paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"ground smoked paprika","amount":"1 tsp","shoppingName":"ground smoked paprika","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"baby leaf salad","amount":"50 g","shoppingName":"baby leaf salad","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"natural yoghurt","amount":"80 g","shoppingName":"natural yoghurt","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"cider vinegar","amount":"15 ml","shoppingName":"cider vinegar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"red onion","amount":"1","shoppingName":"red onion","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"sweet potato","amount":"1","shoppingName":"sweet potato","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat the oven to 220°C/ 200°C (fan)/ gas 7 Take your chicken out of the fridge, open the packet and let it air Chop your potato[es] (skins on) into small bite-sized pieces Chop your sweet potato[es] (skins on) into small bite-sized pieces","Top, tail, and slice your carrot[s] into chunky discs on the diagonal Peel and chop your red onion[s] into thin wedges","Add the chopped potatoes , chopped carrot and onion wedges to a large tin foil -lined baking tray (or two!) Add a generous drizzle of olive oil , a generous pinch of salt and pepper and give everything a good mix up Put the tray[s] in the oven for an initial 15-17 min or until the potatoes are starting to soften","Meanwhile, add most of your ground smoked paprika (save some for later!), 1 tsp sugar , a generous drizzle of olive oil and half your cider vinegar (you'll use the rest later!) to a medium bowl Add a generous pinch of salt and pepper and give everything a good mix up – this is your marinade","Once the potatoes have slightly softened, remove the tray[s] from the oven and add your chicken, drizzle the marinade over the chicken then return the tray[s]to the oven and cook for a further 12-14 min or until almost cooked (reserve the bowl) (Doubled your protein? Do this in batches!) Remove the tray[s] from the oven, spread your harissa paste (can't handle the heat? Go easy!) over the chicken and return to the oven for a final 5-6 min or until the chicken is cooked through (no pink meat!) – this is your harissa chicken & carrot traybake","While the chicken is cooking, wipe the reserved bowl clean with kitchen paper Combine your natural yoghurt with the remaining ground smoked paprika and a pinch of salt in the reserved bowl Stir it all together – this is your paprika yoghurt","Wash your salad , then pat dry with kitchen paper","Serve the harissa chicken & carrot traybake with the salad to the side and drizzle over the paprika yoghurt Drizzle the salad with a little olive oil and the remaining cider vinegar and season with a pinch of salt and pepper Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-1-1686665877955-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-2-1686665882329-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-1686665890186-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/03-01-24_09h19m53s-APIC-1704362303806-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-5-1686665897414-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-1686665901242-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-7-1686665909959-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/harissa-free-range-chicken-thigh-carrot-traybake-w-paprika-yoghurt","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/harissa-free-range-chicken-thigh-carrot-traybake-w-paprika-yoghurt","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["2","white potato"],["1","carrot"],["320 g","free range chicken thighs"],["40 g","harissa paste"],["1 tsp","ground smoked paprika"],["50 g","baby leaf salad"],["80 g","natural yoghurt"],["15 ml","cider vinegar"],["1","red onion"],["1","sweet potato"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Sugar"]],"lunchBucket":"other","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-f17fcbd1-b9d5-49fe-8696-330e922f2e23","sourceId":"f17fcbd1-b9d5-49fe-8696-330e922f2e23","title":"Curried Cod, Leek & Potato Chowder","subtitle":"Warm your cockles with a fragrant cod chowder with sweet leeks and a mildly spiced curry twist.","time":30,"cost":26.34,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","fusion","soup","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Saucepan","Kettle"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/1309_Curried-Haddock-Leek--Potato-Chowder_001_0-1729585138781-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/curried-cod-leek-potato-chowder","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["3","white potato"],["1","carrot"],["1 tsp","ground turmeric"],["1","leek"],["1","cod fillets"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["1 tbsp","curry powder"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["80 g","spinach"],["as needed","Butter"],["as needed","Flour"],["as needed","Milk"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["3","white potato"],["1","carrot"],["1 tsp","ground turmeric"],["1","leek"],["1","cod fillets"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["1 tbsp","curry powder"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["80 g","spinach"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"white potato","amount":"3","shoppingName":"white potato","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"carrot","amount":"1","shoppingName":"carrot","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"ground turmeric","amount":"1 tsp","shoppingName":"ground turmeric","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"leek","amount":"1","shoppingName":"leek","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"cod fillets","amount":"1","shoppingName":"cod fillets","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"intense vegetable stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"intense vegetable stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"curry powder","amount":"1 tbsp","shoppingName":"curry powder","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"soft cheese","amount":"50 g","shoppingName":"soft cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"spinach","amount":"80 g","shoppingName":"spinach","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Top, tail, peel and finely dice your carrot[s] Wash your leek[s] thoroughly to remove any grit from between the leaves, then top, tail and slice finely","Heat a large, wide-based pot (with a matching lid) with a large knob of butter over a medium heat Once melted, add the diced carrot and sliced leek with a pinch of salt and cook for 5-6 min or until softened","Meanwhile, boil a full kettle","Chop your potatoes (skins on) into bite-sized pieces","Dissolve your vegetable stock mix in 550ml boiled water and 100ml milk","Once the leek has softened, add your curry powder , ground turmeric and 1 tsp flour and cook for 30 secs or until fragrant Add the stock and chopped potatoes and cook for 15-18 min or until the potatoes are almost fork-tender Wash your spinach , then pat it dry with kitchen paper","Chop your cod into bite-sized pieces Once the potatoes are almost fork-tender, bring the pot to a boil over high heat, then decrease to medium-high, add your cod, spinach and soft cheese to the potatoes and season with a pinch of salt and pepper Cook, covered, for 6 min or until the cod is cooked through and the potatoes are fork-tender – this is your curried cod, leek & potato chowder Tip: Your fish is cooked when it turns opaque and flakes easily","Serve the curried cod, leek & potato chowder Season with a generous grind of pepper Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1309.-step-1-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1309.-step-2-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-3-1728473078994-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1309.-step-4-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1309.-step-5-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1309.-step-6-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1309.-step-7-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/curried-cod-leek-potato-chowder","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/curried-cod-leek-potato-chowder","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["3","white potato"],["1","carrot"],["1 tsp","ground turmeric"],["1","leek"],["1","cod fillets"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["1 tbsp","curry powder"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["80 g","spinach"],["as needed","Butter"],["as needed","Flour"],["as needed","Milk"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"soup","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":true,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-413e4ee6-125f-4a41-bfe8-6adc12e67072","sourceId":"413e4ee6-125f-4a41-bfe8-6adc12e67072","title":"3 Cheese Veg-Packed Pasta Bake With Beans Side","subtitle":"This hearty pasta dish doesn't just have a rich tomato sauce, it's layered with mozzarella, cheddar cheese and Italian hard cheese for a tasty and who","time":25,"cost":23.92,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","italian","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Oven","Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Colander","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/2023---3-Cheese-Veg-Packed-Pasta-Bake-7065-1579799730289-1677589450897-1757432218798-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/3-cheese-veg-packed-pasta-bake-with-beans-side","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["40 g","cheddar cheese"],["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["200 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["2","garlic clove"],["150 g","tortiglioni"],["1 tsp","dried basil"],["1","courgette"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["16 g","tomato paste"],["10 g","parsley"],["160 g","fine green beans"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["15 ml","balsamic vinegar"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Sugar"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["40 g","cheddar cheese"],["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["200 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["2","garlic clove"],["150 g","tortiglioni"],["1 tsp","dried basil"],["1","courgette"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["16 g","tomato paste"],["10 g","parsley"],["160 g","fine green beans"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["15 ml","balsamic vinegar"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"cheddar cheese","amount":"40 g","shoppingName":"cheddar cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"Italian hard cheese","amount":"20 g","shoppingName":"Italian hard cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"finely chopped tomatoes","amount":"200 g","shoppingName":"finely chopped tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"intense vegetable stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"intense vegetable stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"2","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tortiglioni","amount":"150 g","shoppingName":"tortiglioni","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"dried basil","amount":"1 tsp","shoppingName":"dried basil","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"courgette","amount":"1","shoppingName":"courgette","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"mozzarella","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"mozzarella","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tomato paste","amount":"16 g","shoppingName":"tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"parsley","amount":"10 g","shoppingName":"parsley","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"fine green beans","amount":"160 g","shoppingName":"fine green beans","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"cherry tomatoes","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"cherry tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"balsamic vinegar","amount":"15 ml","shoppingName":"balsamic vinegar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat the oven to 240ºC/ 220ºC (fan)/ gas 9 Boil a kettle Peel and finely chop (or grate) your garlic","Add your pasta to a pot of boiled water with a pinch of salt , bring to the boil over a high heat and cook for 7-9 min (10-12 min for wholewheat) or until cooked with a slight bite Once cooked, drain the pasta Reboil a kettle","While the pasta is cooking, top, tail and chop your courgette[s] into quarters lengthways, then slice finely Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat Once hot, add the sliced courgette with a pinch of salt and cook for 4 min or until beginning to soften","Meanwhile, dissolve your vegetable stock mix , dried basil , balsamic vinegar , tomato paste and 1 tsp sugar in 100ml boiled water – this is your stock Chop your cherry tomatoes roughly","Once the courgette is beginning to soften, add the chopped garlic to the pan and cook for 30 secs Add the stock with the chopped cherry tomatoes and your finely chopped tomatoes and bring to the boil over a high heat Season with a generous grind of black pepper and cook for 3-4 min further","Grate your cheddar cheese and grate your Italian hard cheese then drain your mozzarella , then pat and squeeze as much liquid out as you can with kitchen paper and tear the drained mozzarella into rough, bite-sized pieces Chop your parsley finely, including the stalks and trim, then add your green beans to a pot, cover them with boiled water (just enough to cover them) with a pinch of salt Bring to the boil over a high heat and cook for 3-4 min or until tender","Add the drained pasta to the sauce with most of the chopped parsley (save some for garnish!) and mix it up Add half the pasta mixture to an oven-proof dish , then top with the grated cheddar cheese Top with the remaining pasta mixture , torn mozzarella and grated Italian hard cheese and put the dish in the oven for 5-10 min or until all the cheese has melted – this is your 3 cheese veg-packed pasta bake","Serve the 3 cheese veg-packed pasta bake topped with the reserved chopped parsley and a grind of black pepper Serve the green beans to the side Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-1-1677569204992-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-2-1677569211042-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-1677569214727-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-4-1677569218113-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-5-1677569221847-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-1677569225197-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-7-1677569228302-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/3-cheese-veg-packed-pasta-bake-with-beans-side","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/3-cheese-veg-packed-pasta-bake-with-beans-side","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["40 g","cheddar cheese"],["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["200 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["2","garlic clove"],["150 g","tortiglioni"],["1 tsp","dried basil"],["1","courgette"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["16 g","tomato paste"],["10 g","parsley"],["160 g","fine green beans"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["15 ml","balsamic vinegar"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Sugar"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-e5720f16-9a0d-4117-b383-4e2fc095dddc","sourceId":"e5720f16-9a0d-4117-b383-4e2fc095dddc","title":"Beef Wholewheat Spaghetti Bolognese","subtitle":"This classic crowdpleaser is a guaranteed good time.","time":25,"cost":20.48,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","italian","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/13392-Beef-Spaghetti-Bolognese-1765547596535-1767369280812-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/beef-wholewheat-spaghetti-bolognese","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["5.5 g","intense beef stock mix"],["1 tsp","dried oregano"],["250 g","beef mince"],["8 ml","soy sauce"],["200 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["32 g","tomato paste"],["1","garlic clove"],["190 g","wholewheat spaghetti"],["1","brown onion"],["1","carrot"],["as needed","Water"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Sugar"]],"sourceIngredients":[["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["5.5 g","intense beef stock mix"],["1 tsp","dried oregano"],["250 g","beef mince"],["8 ml","soy sauce"],["200 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["32 g","tomato paste"],["1","garlic clove"],["190 g","wholewheat spaghetti"],["1","brown onion"],["1","carrot"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"Italian hard cheese","amount":"20 g","shoppingName":"Italian hard cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"intense beef stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"intense beef stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"dried oregano","amount":"1 tsp","shoppingName":"dried oregano","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"beef mince","amount":"250 g","shoppingName":"beef mince","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"soy sauce","amount":"8 ml","shoppingName":"soy sauce","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"finely chopped tomatoes","amount":"200 g","shoppingName":"finely chopped tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tomato paste","amount":"32 g","shoppingName":"tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"1","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"wholewheat spaghetti","amount":"190 g","shoppingName":"wholewheat spaghetti","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"brown onion","amount":"1","shoppingName":"brown onion","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"carrot","amount":"1","shoppingName":"carrot","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a kettle Top, tail, peel and finely chop your carrot[s] Peel and finely chop your brown onion[s]","Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat Once hot, add the chopped onion and chopped carrot with a pinch of salt and cook for 5-6 min or until beginning to soften","Meanwhile, peel and finely chop (or grate) your garlic","Once the onion and carrot are beginning to soften, add your mince to the pan and increase the heat to high Cook for 3-4 min further or until browned all over, breaking it up with a wooden spoon as you go (Doubled your protein? Use 2 pans!)","While the mince is cooking, add your pasta to a pot of boiled water and bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the pasta for 7-9 min (10-12 min for wholewheat) or until cooked with a slight bite, then drain, reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water Meanwhile, dissolve your beef stock mix and soy sauce in 100ml boiled water – this is your stock","Add the chopped garlic to the pan with your tomato paste and dried oregano and cook for 30 secs or until fragrant Once fragrant, add the stock with your chopped tomatoes and a generous pinch of sugar , salt and black pepper Bring to the boil and cook for 5 min further or until thickened and the mince is cooked through (no pink meat!) – this is your beef bolognese","Grate your Italian hard cheese finely Add the cooked pasta to the beef bolognese with a splash of starchy pasta water and give everything a good mix up – this is your beef spaghetti bolognese","Serve the beef spaghetti bolognese Top with the grated Italian hard cheese Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-1-1653470072631-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-2-1653470084436-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-1653470088939-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-4-1653470093969-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-5-1653470097936-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-1653470101618-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/grated-italian-hard-cheese-1762447614230-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientId