-identity"},{"name":"brown onion","amount":"1","shoppingName":"brown onion","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"carrot","amount":"1","shoppingName":"carrot","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"spaghetti","amount":"190 g","shoppingName":"spaghetti","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a kettle Top, tail, peel and finely chop your carrot[s] Peel and finely chop your brown onion[s]","Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat Once hot, add the chopped onion and chopped carrot with a pinch of salt and cook for 5-6 min or until beginning to soften","Meanwhile, peel and finely chop (or grate) your garlic","Once the onion and carrot are beginning to soften, add your mince to the pan and increase the heat to high Cook for 3-4 min further or until browned all over, breaking it up with a wooden spoon as you go (Doubled your protein? Use 2 pans!)","While the mince is cooking, add your pasta to a pot of boiled water and bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the pasta for 7-9 min (10-12 min for wholewheat) or until cooked with a slight bite, then drain, reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water Meanwhile, dissolve your beef stock mix and soy sauce in 100ml boiled water – this is your stock","Add the chopped garlic to the pan with your tomato paste and dried oregano and cook for 30 secs or until fragrant Once fragrant, add the stock with your chopped tomatoes and a generous pinch of sugar , salt and black pepper Bring to the boil and cook for 5 min further or until thickened and the mince is cooked through (no pink meat!) – this is your beef bolognese","Grate your Italian hard cheese finely Add the cooked pasta to the beef bolognese with a splash of starchy pasta water and give everything a good mix up – this is your beef spaghetti bolognese","Serve the beef spaghetti bolognese Top with the grated Italian hard cheese Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-1-1653470072631-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-2-1653470084436-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-1653470088939-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-4-1653470093969-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-5-1653470097936-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-1653470101618-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/grated-italian-hard-cheese-1762447614230-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/lean-beef-spaghetti-bolognese","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/lean-beef-spaghetti-bolognese","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["5.5 g","intense beef stock mix"],["1 tsp","dried oregano"],["250 g","lean beef mince (<5% fat)"],["8 ml","soy sauce"],["200 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["32 g","tomato paste"],["1","garlic clove"],["1","brown onion"],["1","carrot"],["190 g","spaghetti"],["as needed","Water"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Sugar"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-8ed5755d-bda2-4852-90d0-eab2876bf8ef","sourceId":"8ed5755d-bda2-4852-90d0-eab2876bf8ef","title":"Jumbo King Prawn Wholewheat Spaghetti With Tomatoes, Chilli & Chorizo","subtitle":"To rustle up this punchy pasta, you'll stir jumbo king prawns into a cherry tomato sauce with garlic, chilli and clotted cream.","time":20,"cost":21.36,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","italian","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Colander","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/2800_Creamy-King-Prawn-Linguine-With-Tomatoes--Chilli-1789999788482-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/jumbo-king-prawn-wholewheat-spaghetti-with-tomatoes-chilli-chorizo","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["0.5 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["212 g","jumbo king prawns"],["40 g","Cornish clotted cream"],["100 g","diced chorizo"],["1","garlic clove"],["190 g","wholewheat spaghetti"],["5.5 g","vegetable stock mix"],["16 g","tomato paste"],["15 ml","Chinese rice wine"],["5 g","chives"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["0.5 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["212 g","jumbo king prawns"],["40 g","Cornish clotted cream"],["100 g","diced chorizo"],["1","garlic clove"],["190 g","wholewheat spaghetti"],["5.5 g","vegetable stock mix"],["16 g","tomato paste"],["15 ml","Chinese rice wine"],["5 g","chives"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"dried chilli flakes","amount":"0.5 tsp","shoppingName":"dried chilli flakes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"jumbo king prawns","amount":"212 g","shoppingName":"jumbo king prawns","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"Cornish clotted cream","amount":"40 g","shoppingName":"Cornish clotted cream","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"diced chorizo","amount":"100 g","shoppingName":"diced chorizo","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"1","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"wholewheat spaghetti","amount":"190 g","shoppingName":"wholewheat spaghetti","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"vegetable stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"vegetable stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tomato paste","amount":"16 g","shoppingName":"tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"Chinese rice wine","amount":"15 ml","shoppingName":"Chinese rice wine","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"chives","amount":"5 g","shoppingName":"chives","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"cherry tomatoes","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"cherry tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a kettle Peel and finely chop (or grate) your garlic Chop your cherry tomatoes in half","Add your pasta to a pot of boiled water with a pinch of salt , bring to the boil over a high heat and cook for 7-9 min (10-12 min for wholewheat) or until cooked with a slight bite Once cooked, drain the pasta and set aside until later While the pasta is cooking, reboil half a kettle","Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat Once hot, add the chopped garlic and chilli flakes (can't handle the heat? Go easy!) and cook for 1 min Add the halved cherry tomatoes with a pinch of salt and cook for 2 min further","Meanwhile, dissolve your tomato paste and vegetable stock mix in 200ml boiled water – this is your tomato stock Chop your chives finely","Add your Chinese rice wine to the pan and cook for 30 secs Pour in the tomato stock and cook for 3-4 min or until the sauce has begun to thicken Drain your jumbo prawns , then add them to the pan and bring to a boil over a high heat Once boiling, reduce the heat to medium-high and cook for 7 min further or until cooked through Season with a generous pinch of salt and pepper and remove from the heat","Stir through your clotted cream and half the chopped chives (save the rest for later!)","Add the drained pasta to the sauce and give everything a good mix up – this is your creamy jumbo king prawn pasta with tomatoes & chilli Tip: If the sauce is too thin, return it to the heat and stir until the sauce sticks to the pasta","Serve the creamy jumbo king prawn pasta with tomatoes & chilli and sprinkle over the remaining chopped chives Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-1-1599209809128-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-2-1599209814487-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-1599209819262-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-4-1599209834257-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-5-1599209840797-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-1599209854366-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-7-copy-1599209860644-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/jumbo-king-prawn-wholewheat-spaghetti-with-tomatoes-chilli-chorizo","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/jumbo-king-prawn-wholewheat-spaghetti-with-tomatoes-chilli-chorizo","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["0.5 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["212 g","jumbo king prawns"],["40 g","Cornish clotted cream"],["100 g","diced chorizo"],["1","garlic clove"],["190 g","wholewheat spaghetti"],["5.5 g","vegetable stock mix"],["16 g","tomato paste"],["15 ml","Chinese rice wine"],["5 g","chives"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-979eb257-24f8-42c2-a9af-4019a3db657c","sourceId":"979eb257-24f8-42c2-a9af-4019a3db657c","title":"One Pot Sun-Dried Tomato Pesto Orzo With Mozzarella & A Chicken Breast","subtitle":"This dish is the ultimate easy dinner, you'll cook your orzo, pepper and tomato together before draining it and stirring through sun-dried tomato pest","time":20,"cost":20.79,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","italian","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Saucepan","Kettle"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/7240_One-Pot-Sun-Dried-Tomato-Pesto-Orzo-With-Mozzarella-1787908655952-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/one-pot-sun-dried-tomato-pesto-orzo-with-mozzarella-a-chicken-breast","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","red pepper"],["1","chicken breast portions"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["90 g","sun-dried tomato pesto"],["15 g","pine nuts"],["5 g","basil"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["125 g","baby plum tomatoes"],["150 g","orzo"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","red pepper"],["1","chicken breast portions"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["90 g","sun-dried tomato pesto"],["15 g","pine nuts"],["5 g","basil"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["125 g","baby plum tomatoes"],["150 g","orzo"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"red pepper","amount":"1","shoppingName":"red pepper","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"chicken breast portions","amount":"1","shoppingName":"chicken breast portions","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"intense vegetable stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"intense vegetable stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"sun-dried tomato pesto","amount":"90 g","shoppingName":"sun-dried tomato pesto","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"pine nuts","amount":"15 g","shoppingName":"pine nuts","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"basil","amount":"5 g","shoppingName":"basil","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"mozzarella","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"mozzarella","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"soft cheese","amount":"50 g","shoppingName":"soft cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"baby plum tomatoes","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"baby plum tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"orzo","amount":"150 g","shoppingName":"orzo","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil kettle Heat a dry pot (with a matching lid) over a medium heat Once hot, add your pine nuts and cook for 2-3 min or until toasted and lightly golden Set them aside and reserve the pot Tip: Watch them like a hawk to make sure they don’t burn!","Deseed your pepper[s] (scrape the seeds and pith out with a teaspoon) and dice","Add your orzo to the reserved pot with your baby plum tomatoes , diced pepper and cover with plenty of boiled water Bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the orzo for 6-8 min or until cooked with a slight bite","Meanwhile, drain your mozzarella , then pat and squeeze as much liquid out as you can with kitchen paper Tear the drained mozzarella into rough, bite-sized pieces","Chop your basil finely, including the stalks","Once your orzo is cooked, drain and then return it to the pot, reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water","Add your vegetable stock mix , sun-dried tomato pesto , soft cheese and the torn mozzarella to the pot with a splash of the starchy pasta water Give everything a good mix up – this is your one pot sun-dried tomato pesto orzo with mozzarella","Serve the one pot sun-dried tomato pesto orzo with mozzarella Garnish with the toasted pine nuts , chopped basil and a generous grind of black pepper Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-1-1721812569807-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-2-1721812572842-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-3-1721812576355-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-4-1721812579399-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-5-1721812582826-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-6-1721812590485-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-7-1721812597296-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/one-pot-sun-dried-tomato-pesto-orzo-with-mozzarella-a-chicken-breast","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/one-pot-sun-dried-tomato-pesto-orzo-with-mozzarella-a-chicken-breast","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["1","red pepper"],["1","chicken breast portions"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["90 g","sun-dried tomato pesto"],["15 g","pine nuts"],["5 g","basil"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["125 g","baby plum tomatoes"],["150 g","orzo"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-44a165e7-7535-4170-a0ac-ff8f2514bd95","sourceId":"44a165e7-7535-4170-a0ac-ff8f2514bd95","title":"Cheesy Pepperoni Pasta Bake","subtitle":"Can't choose between pizza or pasta?","time":35,"cost":18.43,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","family classics","pork recipes","beef & pork","american","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Oven","Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/1940_Cheesy-Pepperoni-Pasta-Bake_002_0-1693818955575-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/pork-recipes/cheesy-pepperoni-pasta-bake","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["40 g","cheddar cheese"],["1 tsp","dried oregano"],["1","red pepper"],["30 g","sliced pepperoni"],["32 g","tomato paste"],["5 g","basil"],["5.5 g","vegetable stock mix"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["150 g","tortiglioni"],["1","red onion"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["40 g","cheddar cheese"],["1 tsp","dried oregano"],["1","red pepper"],["30 g","sliced pepperoni"],["32 g","tomato paste"],["5 g","basil"],["5.5 g","vegetable stock mix"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["150 g","tortiglioni"],["1","red onion"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"cheddar cheese","amount":"40 g","shoppingName":"cheddar cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"dried oregano","amount":"1 tsp","shoppingName":"dried oregano","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"red pepper","amount":"1","shoppingName":"red pepper","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"sliced pepperoni","amount":"30 g","shoppingName":"sliced pepperoni","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tomato paste","amount":"32 g","shoppingName":"tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"basil","amount":"5 g","shoppingName":"basil","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"vegetable stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"vegetable stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"mozzarella","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"mozzarella","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"cherry tomatoes","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"cherry tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tortiglioni","amount":"150 g","shoppingName":"tortiglioni","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"red onion","amount":"1","shoppingName":"red onion","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat the oven to 240ºC/ 220ºC (fan)/ gas 9 Boil a kettle Peel and finely slice your red onion[s] Deseed your pepper[s] (scrape the seeds and pith out with a teaspoon) and cut into thin strips","Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a drizzle of olive oil over a medium heat Once hot, add the sliced onion and pepper strips with a pinch of salt and cook for 5-6 min or until starting to soften","While the onion and pepper are cooking, add your pasta to a pot of boiled water with a pinch of salt and bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the pasta for 7-9 min (10-12 min for wholewheat) or until cooked with a slight bite Once done, drain the cooked pasta and set it aside until later Reboil half a kettle","Slice your cherry tomatoes in half Dissolve your vegetable stock mix and tomato paste in 200ml boiled water – this is your tomato stock","Once the onion and pepper are starting to soften, add the tomato stock to the pan with the halved tomatoes and dried oregano and cook for 2-3 min or until thickened Once thickened, stir the cooked pasta through the tomato sauce and season generously with black pepper","Meanwhile, grate your cheddar cheese Drain your mozzarella , then pat and squeeze as much liquid out as you can with kitchen paper Tear the drained mozzarella into rough, bite-sized pieces","Transfer the pasta to an oven-proof dish and top with the grated cheese and torn mozzarella Lay your pepperoni over the top then put the dish in the oven for 15-20 min or until golden on top – this is your cheesy pepperoni pasta bake Roughly tear your basil leaves","Serve the cheesy pepperoni pasta bake and garnish with the torn basil leaves Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1940.-step-1-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1940.-step-2-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1940.-step-3-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1940.-step-4-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1940.-step-5-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1940.-step-6-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1940.-step-7-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/pork-recipes/cheesy-pepperoni-pasta-bake","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/pork-recipes/cheesy-pepperoni-pasta-bake","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["40 g","cheddar cheese"],["1 tsp","dried oregano"],["1","red pepper"],["30 g","sliced pepperoni"],["32 g","tomato paste"],["5 g","basil"],["5.5 g","vegetable stock mix"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["150 g","tortiglioni"],["1","red onion"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-675f473f-5fce-4f30-acc9-fb225ec80098","sourceId":"675f473f-5fce-4f30-acc9-fb225ec80098","title":"Creamy 'Nduja & Fennel Seed Spaghetti","subtitle":"Fiery 'Nduja pork stars in this creamy, fresh and speedy tomato sauce.","time":20,"cost":20.04,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","pork recipes","beef & pork","italian","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Colander","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/R-2212-2-Creamy_NdujaFennelSeedPappadelle-0197-1674034290565-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/pork-recipes/creamy-nduja-fennel-seed-pappardelle","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["40 g","'Nduja"],["1 tsp","fennel seeds"],["2","garlic clove"],["30 ml","Chinese rice wine"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["10 g","basil"],["80 g","spinach"],["250 g","cherry tomatoes"],["190 g","spaghetti"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["40 g","'Nduja"],["1 tsp","fennel seeds"],["2","garlic clove"],["30 ml","Chinese rice wine"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["10 g","basil"],["80 g","spinach"],["250 g","cherry tomatoes"],["190 g","spaghetti"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"Italian hard cheese","amount":"20 g","shoppingName":"Italian hard cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"'Nduja","amount":"40 g","shoppingName":"'Nduja","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"fennel seeds","amount":"1 tsp","shoppingName":"fennel seeds","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"2","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"Chinese rice wine","amount":"30 ml","shoppingName":"Chinese rice wine","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"soft cheese","amount":"50 g","shoppingName":"soft cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"basil","amount":"10 g","shoppingName":"basil","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"spinach","amount":"80 g","shoppingName":"spinach","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"cherry tomatoes","amount":"250 g","shoppingName":"cherry tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"spaghetti","amount":"190 g","shoppingName":"spaghetti","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Boil a kettle Chop your cherry tomatoes in half, then peel and finely slice (don't chop) your garlic Add your fennel seeds to a pestle & mortar and grind (or chop if you don't have a pestle and mortar!) to a fine powder","Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a generous drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat Once hot, add the halved cherry tomatoes with a pinch of salt and cook for 2-3 min or until beginning to soften","Add your pasta to a pot of plenty of boiled water with a large pinch of salt and bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the pasta for 7-9 min (10-12 min for wholewheat) or until cooked with a slight bite Once done, drain the pasta and return to the pot, reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water","Once the tomatoes are beginning to soften, add the sliced garlic and crushed fennel seeds and cook for 1 min or until fragrant Add your Chinese rice wine and cook for a further 30 secs","Wash your spinach , then add to the pan along with your 'Nduja (can't handle the heat? Go easy!) and 50ml boiled water and give everything a good mix up until fully combined and the spinach has wilted Season with a generous pinch of salt and pepper and cook for a further 3-4 min or until a sauce has formed","Meanwhile, peel half your Italian hard cheese until you end up with a pile of cheese shavings Grate the remaining Italian hard cheese Chop your basil finely, including the stalks, keeping the stalks and leaves separate","Add the chopped basil stalks to the sauce with your soft cheese and stir it all together Add the drained pasta with the grated Italian hard cheese and give everything a good mix up – this is your creamy 'Nduja & fennel seed pasta Tip: Add a splash of the starchy pasta water if your sauce is looking a little dry","Serve the creamy 'Nduja & fennel seed pasta topped with the cheese shavings and chopped basil leaves Season with a grind of black pepper Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-1-1674120509083-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-2-1674120512969-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Spaghetti-draining-1730302079087-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-3-1674120550660-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-5-1674120598624-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-1674120607470-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-7-1674120613746-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/pork-recipes/creamy-nduja-fennel-seed-pappardelle","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/pork-recipes/creamy-nduja-fennel-seed-pappardelle","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["40 g","'Nduja"],["1 tsp","fennel seeds"],["2","garlic clove"],["30 ml","Chinese rice wine"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["10 g","basil"],["80 g","spinach"],["250 g","cherry tomatoes"],["190 g","spaghetti"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-7c9eb3f3-58ed-4921-b39c-a5c61069261b","sourceId":"7c9eb3f3-58ed-4921-b39c-a5c61069261b","title":"Aubergine, Mozzarella & Tomato Pasta Bake","subtitle":"We’ve taken inspiration from the flavours of a ‘parmigiana’ – a classic Italian baked aubergine dish – for this easy, cheesy, incredibly tasty pasta b","time":45,"cost":19.56,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","family classics","vegetarian recipes ","vegetarian","aubergine recipes","classics","italian","pasta","cook"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Oven","Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Colander","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/1260_Aubergine-Mozzarella--Tomato-Pasta-Bake_001_0-1741682913007-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/vegetarian-recipes/aubergine-mozzarella-tomato-pasta-bake","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["390 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["3 tsp","dried oregano"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["40 g","cheddar cheese"],["1","garlic clove"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["16 g","tomato paste"],["10 g","basil"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["1","aubergine"],["150 g","tortiglioni"],["15 ml","balsamic vinegar"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Sugar"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["390 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["3 tsp","dried oregano"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["40 g","cheddar cheese"],["1","garlic clove"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["16 g","tomato paste"],["10 g","basil"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["1","aubergine"],["150 g","tortiglioni"],["15 ml","balsamic vinegar"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"finely chopped tomatoes","amount":"390 g","shoppingName":"finely chopped tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"dried oregano","amount":"3 tsp","shoppingName":"dried oregano","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"intense vegetable stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"intense vegetable stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"cheddar cheese","amount":"40 g","shoppingName":"cheddar cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"1","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"mozzarella","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"mozzarella","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tomato paste","amount":"16 g","shoppingName":"tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"basil","amount":"10 g","shoppingName":"basil","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"cherry tomatoes","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"cherry tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"aubergine","amount":"1","shoppingName":"aubergine","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tortiglioni","amount":"150 g","shoppingName":"tortiglioni","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"balsamic vinegar","amount":"15 ml","shoppingName":"balsamic vinegar","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Preheat the oven to 240ºC/ 220ºC (fan)/ gas 9, then trim the green stalk[s] off your aubergine[s] and chop into small bite-sized pieces Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably an oven-proof casserole dish ) with a generous drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat Once hot, add the chopped aubergine with a pinch of salt and cook for 5-6 min or until softened","Meanwhile, boil a kettle Peel and finely chop (or grate) your garlic Dissolve your vegetable stock mix in 100ml boiled water","Add your pasta to a pot of boiled water with a large pinch of salt and bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the pasta for 7-9 min (10-12 min for wholewheat) or until cooked with a slight bite Once done, drain the pasta , reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water","Once the aubergine has softened, add the chopped garlic , balsamic vinegar , tomato paste , dried oregano and a pinch of sugar and cook for 1 min Add your chopped tomatoes and vegetable stock and cook for 5-6 min further or until starting to thicken","Meanwhile, cut your cherry tomatoes in half Grate your cheddar cheese Drain your mozzarella and cut it into slices","Once the tomato sauce has thickened, stir in the drained pasta and chopped cherry tomatoes Tip: if it looks a little dry, add a splash of the starchy pasta water","Top the pasta with your basil , grated cheddar and the sliced mozzarella Add a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of pepper Put the pan in the oven for 15-20 min or until the cheese is melted and golden Tip: if you don't have an oven-proof pan, transfer to an oven-proof dish instead","Serve the aubergine, mozzarella & tomato pasta bake Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1260.-step-1-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1260.-step-2-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1260.-step-3.2-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1260.-step-4-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1260.-step-5-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1260.-step-6-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/1260.-step-7-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/vegetarian-recipes/aubergine-mozzarella-tomato-pasta-bake","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/vegetarian-recipes/aubergine-mozzarella-tomato-pasta-bake","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["390 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["3 tsp","dried oregano"],["5.5 g","intense vegetable stock mix"],["40 g","cheddar cheese"],["1","garlic clove"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["16 g","tomato paste"],["10 g","basil"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["1","aubergine"],["150 g","tortiglioni"],["15 ml","balsamic vinegar"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Sugar"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"cook","light":true,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-4e64c8b2-fb9b-4ab1-83b0-8915034240f9","sourceId":"4e64c8b2-fb9b-4ab1-83b0-8915034240f9","title":"Spicy Mozzarella & Baby Plum Tomato Spaghetti","subtitle":"For this quick, punchy pasta, you'll toss spaghetti with chilli, garlic and parsley.","time":10,"cost":15.62,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","italian","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Baking tray","Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Colander","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/3876_Spicy-Mozzarella--Cherry-Tomato-Spaghetti-1787909652758-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/spicy-mozzarella-baby-plum-tomato-spaghetti","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["250 g","baby plum tomatoes"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["0.5 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["2","garlic clove"],["1","lemon"],["5.5 g","vegetable stock mix"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["10 g","parsley"],["190 g","spaghetti"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["250 g","baby plum tomatoes"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["0.5 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["2","garlic clove"],["1","lemon"],["5.5 g","vegetable stock mix"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["10 g","parsley"],["190 g","spaghetti"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"baby plum tomatoes","amount":"250 g","shoppingName":"baby plum tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"grated Italian hard cheese","amount":"30 g","shoppingName":"grated Italian hard cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"dried chilli flakes","amount":"0.5 tsp","shoppingName":"dried chilli flakes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"2","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"lemon","amount":"1","shoppingName":"lemon","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"vegetable stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"vegetable stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"mozzarella","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"mozzarella","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"parsley","amount":"10 g","shoppingName":"parsley","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"spaghetti","amount":"190 g","shoppingName":"spaghetti","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Before you begin... Get all your ingredients and equipment ready Skim through these steps, then wash your fruit and veg Note: Equipment and pan sizes vary. Make sure you cook food thoroughly (even if it takes you a little longer than 10 min)","Now, let’s get started! Boil a kettle and preheat the grill to high Chop half your baby plum tomatoes in half Add the halved baby plum tomatoes and remaining whole baby plum tomatoes to a baking tray (or two!) with a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt Give everything a good mix up and put the tray[s] under the grill until serving","Meanwhile, add your pasta to a pot of boiled water with a large pinch of salt , then bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the pasta for 7-9 min or until cooked with a slight bite Once done, drain the pasta , reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water","Peel and roughly slice (don't chop) your garlic Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with 4 tbsp olive oil over a medium heat Once hot, add your chilli flakes (can't handle the heat? Go easy!) and cook for 30 secs","Add the sliced garlic to the pan with a very generous pinch of salt and cook for 30 secs Remove the pan from the heat, and add 100ml of the reserved starchy pasta water Tip: Be careful when adding the water to the pan, it may splash! Return the pan to the heat, sprinkle in your vegetable stock mix , tear your parsley into the pan and stir it all together","Add the drained pasta to the pan with the juice of half your lemon[s] and give everything a good mix up – this is your spicy pasta Tip: Add a splash more starchy pasta water if your sauce is looking a little dry Cut the remaining lemon into 1 wedge per person","Drain your mozzarella , then pat and squeeze as much liquid out as you can with kitchen paper Tear the drained mozzarella into rough, bite-sized pieces","Serve the spicy pasta topped with the grilled baby plum tomatoes and the torn mozzarella – this is your spicy mozzarella & baby plum tomato pasta Sprinkle over your grated Italian hard cheese and garnish with a lemon wedge Season with a generous grind of black pepper Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Admin10mm-Step-1-1668184504083-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-2-1686323022109-1690277203687-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-1686323012758-1690277208821-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-4-1633433368667-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-5-1633433398618-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-6-1633433449865-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Step-7-1633433475064-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/spicy-mozzarella-baby-plum-tomato-spaghetti","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/spicy-mozzarella-baby-plum-tomato-spaghetti","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["250 g","baby plum tomatoes"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["0.5 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["2","garlic clove"],["1","lemon"],["5.5 g","vegetable stock mix"],["125 g","mozzarella"],["10 g","parsley"],["190 g","spaghetti"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-7da7ef31-7c24-4b21-96bd-65fa90cca5a1","sourceId":"7da7ef31-7c24-4b21-96bd-65fa90cca5a1","title":"Spicy Sausage & Creamy Tomato Sauce With Mushroom Tortelloni","subtitle":"There’s no slaving over this ‘salsiccia piccante’ inspired sauce.","time":10,"cost":23.81,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","italian","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/4000---Spicy-Sausage--Creamy-Tomato-Tortelloni-_13-1640171396767-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/spicy-sausage-creamy-tomato-sauce-with-mushroom-tortelloni","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["0.5 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["250 g","portobello mushroom tortelloni"],["200 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["1 tsp","dried oregano"],["1","garlic clove"],["150 g","sausage meat"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["0.5 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["250 g","portobello mushroom tortelloni"],["200 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["1 tsp","dried oregano"],["1","garlic clove"],["150 g","sausage meat"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"dried chilli flakes","amount":"0.5 tsp","shoppingName":"dried chilli flakes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"portobello mushroom tortelloni","amount":"250 g","shoppingName":"portobello mushroom tortelloni","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"finely chopped tomatoes","amount":"200 g","shoppingName":"finely chopped tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"dried oregano","amount":"1 tsp","shoppingName":"dried oregano","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"1","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"sausage meat","amount":"150 g","shoppingName":"sausage meat","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"grated Italian hard cheese","amount":"30 g","shoppingName":"grated Italian hard cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"soft cheese","amount":"50 g","shoppingName":"soft cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"chicken stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"chicken stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Before you begin... Get all your ingredients and equipment ready Skim through these steps, then wash your fruit and veg Note: Equipment and pan sizes vary. Make sure you cook food thoroughly (even if it takes you a little longer than 10 min)","Now, let's get started! Boil a kettle Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a drizzle of olive oil over a high heat Divide your sausage meat (remove the paper if required!) into 6 bite sized balls per person","Once hot, add the sausage meatballs to the pan with a pinch of salt and cook for 4-5 min or until starting to brown","Meanwhile, add your portobello mushroom tortelloni to a pot of boiled water and bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the tortelloni for 3-4 min or until cooked with a slight bite Once done, drain the tortelloni , reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water","Peel and slice (don't chop!) your garlic Once the sausage is starting to brown, add the sliced garlic , dried oregano and most of your chilli flakes (can't handle the heat? Go easy!) to the pan and cook for 1 min further or until fragrant","Once fragrant, add your chicken stock mix , soft cheese and chopped tomatoes to the pan with the sausage and give everything a good stir Cook for 3 min further or until the sauce thickens slightly and the sausage is cooked through (no pink meat!)","Stir the drained tortelloni and half your grated Italian hard cheese (you'll use the rest later!) into the sauce and give everything a gentle mix up until the pasta is coated in the sauce Tip: Add a splash of starchy pasta water if your sauce is looking a little dry","Serve the spicy sausage & creamy tomato sauce with mushroom tortelloni topped with the remaining grated Italian hard cheese Garnish with the reserved chilli flakes (not a fan of spice? Just add a little!) and season with a generous grind of black pepper Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Admin10mm-Step-1-1658836622662-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-2-1727171369475-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-1727171374610-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-4-copy-1644923887191-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Sliced-Garlic-1739204102757-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-copy-3-1644923893055-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-7-copy-1644923895967-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/spicy-sausage-creamy-tomato-sauce-with-mushroom-tortelloni","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/spicy-sausage-creamy-tomato-sauce-with-mushroom-tortelloni","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["0.5 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["250 g","portobello mushroom tortelloni"],["200 g","finely chopped tomatoes"],["1 tsp","dried oregano"],["1","garlic clove"],["150 g","sausage meat"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Salt"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-1fdd3567-8a13-4d0e-94e4-446b85451809","sourceId":"1fdd3567-8a13-4d0e-94e4-446b85451809","title":"Tomato & Bacon Amatriciana Sauce With Tomato & Mozzarella Tortelloni","subtitle":"Savoury bacon lardons, fresh tomatoes and chilli flakes come together for this spicy Roman favourite.","time":10,"cost":16.58,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","italian","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/3998-1783336248608-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/tomato-bacon-amatriciana-sauce-with-tomato-mozzarella-tortelloni","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["250 g","tomato & mozzarella tortelloni"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["1 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["32 g","tomato paste"],["100 g","bacon lardons"],["2","garlic clove"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["as needed","Sugar"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["250 g","tomato & mozzarella tortelloni"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["1 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["32 g","tomato paste"],["100 g","bacon lardons"],["2","garlic clove"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"Italian hard cheese","amount":"20 g","shoppingName":"Italian hard cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tomato & mozzarella tortelloni","amount":"250 g","shoppingName":"tomato & mozzarella tortelloni","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"chicken stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"chicken stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"dried chilli flakes","amount":"1 tsp","shoppingName":"dried chilli flakes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"tomato paste","amount":"32 g","shoppingName":"tomato paste","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"bacon lardons","amount":"100 g","shoppingName":"bacon lardons","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"2","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"cherry tomatoes","amount":"125 g","shoppingName":"cherry tomatoes","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Before you begin... Get all your ingredients and equipment ready Skim through these steps, then wash your fruit and veg Note: Equipment and pan sizes vary. Make sure you cook food thoroughly (even if it takes you a little longer than 10 min)","Now, let's get started! Boil a kettle Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a drizzle of olive oil over a high heat Once hot, add your bacon lardons and cook for 2-3 min or until starting to brown","Meanwhile, add your tomato & mozzarella tortelloni to a pot of boiled water and bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the tomato & mozzarella tortelloni for 3-4 min or until cooked with a slight bite Once done, drain the cooked tortelloni, reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water","While the pasta is cooking, slice your cherry tomatoes in half Peel and finely slice (don't chop!) your garlic","Once the bacon lardons have started to brown, add the halved tomatoes , sliced garlic and chilli flakes (can't handle the heat? Go easy!) to the pan and cook for 3-4 min further Meanwhile, dissolve your chicken stock mix and tomato paste in 75ml boiled water with a pinch of sugar – this is your tomato stock","Add tomato stock to the pan and cook for 2-3 min or until the sauce has thickened slightly – this is your Amatriciana sauce Tip: Add a splash of starchy pasta water if your sauce is looking a little dry! Grate your Italian hard cheese","Add the drained tomato & mozzarella tortelloni to the pan and give everything a gentle mix up until the pasta is coated in the sauce – this is your tomato & bacon Amatriciana sauce with tomato & mozzarella tortelloni","Serve the tomato & bacon Amatriciana sauce with tomato & mozzarella tortelloni topped with your grated Italian hard cheese Season with a generous grind of black pepper Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Admin10mm-Step-1-1643717124349-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-2-copy-1643717108143-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-copy-1643717114841-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-4-copy-1643717139830-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-5-copy-1643717146860-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-copy-1643717152270-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-7-copy-1643717159747-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/tomato-bacon-amatriciana-sauce-with-tomato-mozzarella-tortelloni","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/tomato-bacon-amatriciana-sauce-with-tomato-mozzarella-tortelloni","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["20 g","Italian hard cheese"],["250 g","tomato & mozzarella tortelloni"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["1 tsp","dried chilli flakes"],["32 g","tomato paste"],["100 g","bacon lardons"],["2","garlic clove"],["125 g","cherry tomatoes"],["as needed","Sugar"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-cb3cedff-c4b9-4101-ac82-3f4ad701a869","sourceId":"cb3cedff-c4b9-4101-ac82-3f4ad701a869","title":"Creamy Bacon Alfredo Sauce With Mushroom Tortelloni","subtitle":"Rich, cheesy, and oh-so easy.","time":10,"cost":16.46,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","fusion","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Colander","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/3997---Creamy-Bacon-Alfredo-Tortelloni-1640171293223-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/creamy-bacon-alfredo-sauce-with-mushroom-tortelloni","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["250 g","portobello mushroom tortelloni"],["100 g","bacon lardons"],["2","garlic clove"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["80 g","spinach"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["250 g","portobello mushroom tortelloni"],["100 g","bacon lardons"],["2","garlic clove"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["80 g","spinach"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"portobello mushroom tortelloni","amount":"250 g","shoppingName":"portobello mushroom tortelloni","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"bacon lardons","amount":"100 g","shoppingName":"bacon lardons","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"2","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"grated Italian hard cheese","amount":"30 g","shoppingName":"grated Italian hard cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"soft cheese","amount":"50 g","shoppingName":"soft cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"chicken stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"chicken stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"spinach","amount":"80 g","shoppingName":"spinach","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Before you begin... Get all your ingredients and equipment ready Skim through these steps, then wash your fruit and veg Note: Equipment and pan sizes vary. Make sure you cook food thoroughly (even if it takes you a little longer than 10 min)","Now, let's get started! Boil a full kettle Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a drizzle of olive oil over a high heat Once hot, add your bacon lardons and cook for 4-5 min or until beginning to crisp","Meanwhile, add your mushroom tortelloni to a pot of boiled water and bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the tortelloni for 3-4 min or until cooked with a slight bite Once done, drain the tortelloni , reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water","Reboil a kettle Peel and slice (don't chop!) your garlic Add the sliced garlic to the pan with the bacon and cook for 1 min further or until fragrant Tip: Watch them like a hawk to make sure they don’t burn!","Meanwhile, dissolve your chicken stock mix in 50ml boiled water and stir in your soft cheese – this is your creamy stock Add the creamy stock and half your grated Italian hard cheese (save the rest for garnish!) to the pan with the bacon and cook for 1-2 min or until starting to thicken – this is your creamy bacon Alfredo sauce","While the sauce is thickening, wash your spinach , then add to a colander and pour boiled water all over it so that it starts to wilt Rinse the wilted spinach under cold running water until it’s cool Once cool, squeeze as much water out of the spinach as you can, then chop it roughly","Add the drained tortelloni and chopped wilted spinach to the creamy bacon Alfredo sauce and give everything a good mix up Tip: Add a splash of starchy pasta water if your sauce is looking a little dry","Serve the creamy bacon Alfredo tortelloni topped with the remaining grated Italian hard cheese Season with a generous grind of black pepper Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Admin10mm-Step-1-2-1657031374611-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-2-1648553533192-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-1648553535626-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-4-1648553538807-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-5-1648553541032-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-1648553544373-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-7-1648553546901-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/creamy-bacon-alfredo-sauce-with-mushroom-tortelloni","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/creamy-bacon-alfredo-sauce-with-mushroom-tortelloni","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["250 g","portobello mushroom tortelloni"],["100 g","bacon lardons"],["2","garlic clove"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["80 g","spinach"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."},{"id":"lunch-gousto-a64a93f8-6a94-47f4-937f-d8c9bcbaffe5","sourceId":"a64a93f8-6a94-47f4-937f-d8c9bcbaffe5","title":"Sausage, Leek & Fennel Sauce With Mushroom Tortelloni","subtitle":"Fennel fans, right this way.","time":10,"cost":24.52,"servings":2,"scaleSafe":true,"tags":["all gousto recipes","italian","pasta","quick"],"requiredEquipment":[],"sourceEquipment":["Frying pan","Saucepan","Kettle","Grater"],"image":"","sourceImageUrl":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/mood-image/3995---Sausage-Leek--Fennel-Tortelloni11310-1640170962418-x1500.jpg","imageSource":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/sausage-leek-fennel-sauce-with-mushroom-tortelloni","imageLicense":"Recipe source image","imageProvenance":"Exact finished-dish photograph from the published Gousto UK recipe","ingredients":[["1","leek"],["250 g","portobello mushroom tortelloni"],["1 tsp","fennel seeds"],["1","garlic clove"],["150 g","sausage meat"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["as needed","Flour"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"sourceIngredients":[["1","leek"],["250 g","portobello mushroom tortelloni"],["1 tsp","fennel seeds"],["1","garlic clove"],["150 g","sausage meat"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"]],"ingredientMeta":[{"name":"leek","amount":"1","shoppingName":"leek","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"portobello mushroom tortelloni","amount":"250 g","shoppingName":"portobello mushroom tortelloni","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"fennel seeds","amount":"1 tsp","shoppingName":"fennel seeds","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"garlic clove","amount":"1","shoppingName":"garlic clove","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"sausage meat","amount":"150 g","shoppingName":"sausage meat","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"grated Italian hard cheese","amount":"30 g","shoppingName":"grated Italian hard cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"soft cheese","amount":"50 g","shoppingName":"soft cheese","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"},{"name":"chicken stock mix","amount":"5.5 g","shoppingName":"chicken stock mix","marketChecked":true,"priceMatchType":"source-identity"}],"steps":["Before you begin... Get all your ingredients and equipment ready Skim through these steps, then wash your fruit and veg Note: Equipment and pan sizes vary. Make sure you cook food thoroughly (even if it takes you a little longer than 10 min)","Now, let's get started! Heat a large, wide-based pan (preferably non-stick) with a drizzle of olive oil over a high heat Add your fennel seeds and sausage meat (remove the paper if required!) to the pan and cook for 2-3 min or until beginning to brown, breaking it up with a wooden spoon as you go","Boil a kettle Chop your leek[s] in half lengthways, wash thoroughly to remove any grit, then top, tail and slice finely Peel and slice (don't chop!) your garlic","Add the sliced leek and sliced garlic to the pan with the sausage meat and cook for 4-5 min or until the leek is beginning to soften","Meanwhile, add your portobello mushroom tortelloni to a pot of boiled water and bring to the boil over a high heat Cook the tortelloni for 3-4 min or until cooked with a slight bite Once done, drain the tortelloni , reserving a cup of the starchy pasta water","While the pasta is cooking, dissolve your chicken stock mix in 50ml boiled water and stir in your soft cheese – this is your creamy stock Once the leek is beginning to soften, add 1 tsp flour to the pan and give everything a good mix up Add the creamy stock to the pan and cook for 1-2 min further or until the sauce has thickened and the sausages are cooked through (no pink meat!)","Once the sauce has thickened, stir in the drained portobello mushroom tortelloni with half of your grated Italian hard cheese (save the rest for later!), a splash of starchy pasta water and a generous grind of black pepper – this is your sausage, leek & fennel sauce with mushroom tortelloni","Serve the sausage, leek & fennel sauce with mushroom tortelloni topped with the remaining grated Italian hard cheese Season with a grind of black pepper Enjoy!"],"sourceStepImages":[{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Admin10mm-Step-1-1649234913285-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 1"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/Sausage-meat-1727684129023-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 2"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-3-1649234927656-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 3"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-4-1649234934854-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 4"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-5-1649234942644-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 5"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-6-1649234950424-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 6"},{"src":"https://production-media.gousto.co.uk/cms/recipe-step-image/step-7-1649234957404-x1500.jpg","caption":"Step 7"},{"src":"","caption":"Step 8"}],"sourceStepIngredientIds":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]],"source":"Gousto UK","sourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/sausage-leek-fennel-sauce-with-mushroom-tortelloni","recipeSource":"Gousto UK","recipeSourceUrl":"https://www.gousto.co.uk/recipes/sausage-leek-fennel-sauce-with-mushroom-tortelloni","recipeProvenance":"Published Gousto UK recipe retained as the cooking source. My Week only normalises it for planning and display.","sourcedCatalogue":true,"catalogueVersion":"0.31-source-lunch-240","shoppingIngredients":[["1","leek"],["250 g","portobello mushroom tortelloni"],["1 tsp","fennel seeds"],["1","garlic clove"],["150 g","sausage meat"],["30 g","grated Italian hard cheese"],["50 g","soft cheese"],["5.5 g","chicken stock mix"],["as needed","Flour"],["as needed","Olive oil"],["as needed","Pepper"],["as needed","Water"]],"lunchBucket":"pasta","isLunch":true,"prepStyle":"quick","light":false,"prepLocation":"home","workplaceEquipment":["microwave","kettle"],"workplaceReady":true,"preparationNote":"Prepare and cook this lunch at home. My Week scales it automatically to the lunch days and people selected for this week.","storageNote":"Cook fully at home, cool promptly and refrigerate within 1 to 2 hours. At work, eat cold where appropriate or reheat once in a microwave until steaming hot. No hob, oven, grill, toaster or sandwich press is assumed at work."}];
